window.FWN_GODLY_EMPRESS_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_GODLY_EMPRESS_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":2101,"title":"Chapter 2101 - How Dare You!","paragraphs":["“Feng Wu” raised “her” fist.","Thump!","“She” then punched the younger prince in the nose.","Everyone was astonished.","Including the younger prince himself.","He stared at “Princess Feng Wu” in disbelief.","“You —”","“She” was the woman he wanted to marry, but “she” had just hit him. Covering his nose, the prince stared at “Feng Wu” in disbelief.","Because Feng Wu’s body was still weak, Jun Linyuan’s punch hadn’t done much damage to him.","Had Jun Linyuan been in his own body, the prince would have been killed already.","Before the prince could react, Jun Linyuan punched him again.","The poor prince was knocked to the ground.","Thump! Thump! Thump!","Jun Linyuan kept throwing punches at his head.","He was the crown prince; would his punches be the same as other people’s?","Obviously not.","He aimed at the spots that would hurt the most.","Therefore, after a few punches, the poor prince collapsed on the ground and was barely breathing.","Feng Wu covered her eyes involuntarily.","She preferred to use her brain to solve problems. Jun Linyuan was smarter than she was, but he couldn’t be bothered to think, and had chosen to directly use his fists.","However, what everyone else saw was that Feng Wu had beaten up the prince.","They believed that Feng Wu was the culprit here.","Everyone was dumbfounded.","They stared at the “teenage girl” in disbelief and couldn’t believe how violent “she” was.","She was no more than 14 years old, but she jumped so high, and her punches were relentless. That was the prince who wanted to marry her. How could she bring herself to do this?","Ranmil was the first to react, and her eyes widened in surprise.","It had never occurred to her that “Feng Wu” would use such a way to solve “her” problem.","It was straightforward but effective.","However...","Such an opportunity wouldn’t appear every day, so of course, Ranmil wouldn’t give in just yet.","Therefore, she tugged at Emperor Wu.","Emperor Wu reacted immediately and shouted angrily, “That’s enough! Take Feng Wu down!”","Instantly, two of his four guards stepped out and charged at “Feng Wu.”","However, when they almost touched “Feng Wu’s” arms, Jun Linyuan looked at them with frightening eyes, and they felt their hearts stop.","Being Emperor Wu’s guards, the two men had to be very capable.","Their cultivation levels should be much higher than Feng Wu’s.","But strangely, when “Feng Wu” glanced at them with “her” cold eyes, they involuntarily froze.","The two guards looked at each other uneasily.","For a split second, they thought that they were seeing the crown prince’s eyes.","That was so frightening...","“Back off.” Given Jun Linyuan’s intimidating demeanor, the two guards backed away before they realized what they were doing.","“Take her down!” Emperor Wu shouted angrily.","He decided that the “girl” was mimicking Jun Linyuan and had done a very good job, but it only made him even more furious."]},{"number":2102,"title":"Chapter 2102","paragraphs":["“How dare you?!” Jun Linyuan said arrogantly. He was ready to fight.","His demeanor made many people uneasy.","Master Zuo and Master Dugu looked at each other.","Master Dugu murmured, “Since when has Feng Wu been so intimidating?”","“She’s bluffing.” Master Zuo snorted.","Master Dugu glanced at him. “And she’s good enough to fool both of us?”","Master Zuo didn’t know what to say.","Master Dugu said, “Although her cultivation level is still the same, her demeanor reminds me of an invincible sword. We have to admit that she’s going to be great one day.”","Master Zuo clenched his fists.","Master Dugu was right. He couldn’t fool himself anymore.","At the thought of Zuo Qingxian and Zuo Qingyu, Master Zuo was filled with hatred.","Feng Wu had to die!","At the same time...","Feng Wu sighed in resignation. She tugged at the proud crown prince’s sleeve and said, “Calm down. Don’t be mad.”","Was the “crown prince” appeasing “Feng Wu” now?","Exactly what did “he” see in “her”?!","Everyone watched in disbelief.","But to their surprise, “Feng Wu” didn’t show any gratitude. Rather, “she” behaved even worse.","“She” threw off the “crown prince’s” hand.","OMG!","Everyone was shocked by “Feng Wu’s” willfulness.","This “girl” was the boldest person they had ever seen. Did she have a death wish?","At the same time, Feng Wu held Jun Linyuan’s arm and tried to appease him. “Your Royal Highness, didn’t you agree that you would behave yourself?”","She caressed the back of his hand, trying to calm him down. “As I said, I’ll owe you one, so please help me. Please? You’re the best.”","Feng Wu was great at these things because she had practised them on her beautiful master; she didn’t even need to warm up.","Luckily, Feng Wu had whispered those words to Jun Linyuan. If anyone else heard what she said, Jun Linyuan’s image would be ruined instantly.","Jun Linyuan stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu gave him a grin in return.","The crown prince looked at her in resignation. “Just this once.”","Feng Wu was so happy that if she had a tail, it would be wagging now. “Just this once!”","Jun Linyuan snorted reluctantly and put his hands behind his back. He resumed his indifferent demeanor, which to other people, was a sign of “her” arrogance.","But to Jun Linyuan, he felt that he had never been so humble.","If Feng Wu hadn’t pleaded...","The crown prince shot a cold glance at the younger prince.","Poor prince. He had wanted to make a marriage proposal, but his dream girl had beaten him up. That had to be a first.","Ranmil wouldn’t stand for such humiliation."]},{"number":2103,"title":"Chapter 2103","paragraphs":["Of course, Ranmil wouldn’t allow “Feng Wu” to look so arrogant.","She felt like she had been slapped in the face.","At that thought, Ranmil frowned and said, “Princess Feng Wu, I don’t think I can agree with what you’ve done!”","Before Jun Linyuan could say anything, Feng Wu spoke up.","She said, “What?”","Ranmil looked at her and said, “Your Royal Highness, are you on Princess Feng Wu’s side, then?”","“Of course I’m on my side,” Feng Wu thought.","She nodded, which infuriated Ranmil.","Ranmil gritted her teeth. “Fine. If Your Royal Highness doesn’t care about your woman’s chastity, why should we?”","Was she going to incriminate Feng Wu?","Feng Wu couldn’t let her do that, so she stepped forward, stared at Ranmil, and asked, “Princess Ranmil, are you sure that Feng Wu gave your brother her consent?”","Ranmil smirked. “I believe my brother.”","Feng Wu snorted. “But I believe Feng Wu.”","“You —” Ranmil was rendered speechless.","Although she claimed that she didn’t like Jun Linyuan anymore, her actions weren’t convincing. She hadn’t moved on. Instead, she was obsessed with taking revenge.","Because of that, when she saw “Jun Linyuan” turn against her for “Feng Wu,” she was even more furious and heartbroken.","But she had no idea that she was in fact arguing with Feng Wu.","Ranmil stared at Feng Wu. “So what if you believe her? We need proof!”","Feng Wu chuckled and crossed her hands. “Proof? I’m her proof.”","Ranmil glared at “Jun Linyuan.” “What do you mean?”","Feng Wu said, “Who has known Feng Wu for longer? Me or this prince?”","Everyone looked at the beaten-up prince, and felt that he had made the worst choice. Why would he try to compete with the crown prince over a woman?","Ranmil said, “So what?”","She wouldn’t accept this!","Why was this even happening?!","Why would the unapproachable crown prince support Feng Wu now? It was so frustrating!","Feng Wu had no idea how Ranmil felt. She only looked at her and snorted. “Given the choice, who would you choose, me or my father?”","Ranmil’s gaze was fixed on “Jun Linyuan.”","That was an outrageous question!","How could “he” ask such a thing?!","“Jun Linyuan” said, “If I accept you as a consort and take you away as long as you say yes, will you come?”","Wow —","Everyone was astonished.","Oh god!","No one saw that coming.","They never expected the crown prince to be so bold.","Ranmil had slept with Emperor Wu already and was the emperor’s Consort Ranmil. Technically speaking, she was Jun Linyuan’s stepmother now.","That was incredible!","The continent was quite open about such things, but this was still unheard of.","However, Ranmil had confessed her love for Jun Linyuan first before sleeping with Emperor Wu, which proved that she wasn’t that faithful. The looks the other people gave her changed."]},{"number":2104,"title":"Chapter 2104","paragraphs":["Emperor Wu’s face turned livid, and he almost fainted.","That defiant son!","But now, everyone was looking at Ranmil.","She didn’t lose her temper or decline the offer immediately. Rather, she was hesitating... She was considering the offer!","Oh god...","That was what infuriated Emperor Wu the most.","Looking around, Feng Wu saw the astonished crowd, the furious Emperor Wu, and the hesitant Ranmil...","Human beings were such complicated animals.","“I wi—” Ranmil started to say, but was cut off.","Feng Wu said, “Of course, it’s only a hypothesis.”","A hypothesis?!","Ranmil wanted to slap “Jun Linyuan.”","She had been so close to saying that she would go with “him.” Luckily, she was stopped mid-sentence.","She was Consort Ranmil, Emperor Wu’s woman. She could never marry Jun Linyuan.","What she didn’t notice was that Feng Wu had set her up.","Emperor Wu had seen Ranmil’s hesitation.","Because of Ranmil’s Enchanting Body, Emperor Wu might like her more and more in the future, but now, Feng Wu had planted a seed of distrust in his heart.","It was easy for all kings and emperors to distrust others.","The more he liked Ranmil, the more doubts he would have about her.","Therefore, he would dote on Ranmil, but he would never trust her.","Poor Ranmil. She hadn’t realized that Feng Wu had ruined her future.","Of course, she was too jealous of Feng Wu right now to see things clearly.","Feng Wu smiled at Ranmil. “Princess, you’ve given your answer, haven’t you?”","Ranmil glared at her. “No! I didn’t say anything!”","Feng Wu chuckled. “Of course you did. You confessed your love for me first. After I turned you down, you chose His Majesty instead. Isn’t it obvious?”","Ranmil was so furious.","So was Emperor Wu. He thought he was going to pass out.","Feng Wu smirked.","“Even if you wanted to choose me, do you think Feng Wu is blind?","“Why would she choose another man instead of me?","“Ranmil, don’t take other people to be idiots!”","The questions made Ranmil’s face turn scarlet red.","She stared at “Jun Linyuan” and said, “Maybe she’s trying to use my brother as her plan B, in case she can’t marry Your Royal Highness!”","Feng Wu snorted. “Princess, do you think that we’re all as stupid as you are?","“Don’t you know that Feng Wu and I are still engaged?”","Feng Wu then glanced at Ranmil and shook her head. “Princess, do you ever use your brain?”","Wow —","Everyone’s eyes widened, and they held their breaths.","When the crown prince lost his temper, no one could withstand his rage.","The humiliation made Ranmil want to hide in a cave. Feng Wu then turned to lead Jun Linyuan away.","After taking a few steps, she turned around and stared at Emperor Wu.","“Father, are you sure you want to take such a stupid woman back to the imperial capital?”","Ranmil was almost in tears.","Once Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan had said everything there was to say, they left together."]},{"number":2105,"title":"Chapter 2105","paragraphs":["The people looked at one another in bewilderment.","No one knew what to say.","Did the emperor bring His Royal Highness and Feng Wu here only to be humiliated?","Why...","The younger prince was still in shock. He had been crying since “Feng Wu” beat him up.","He couldn’t understand.","Feng Wu hadn’t been so scary before.","Ranmil threw a dirty look at her brother. The thought of what she had gone through made her want to scream.","Since Jun Linyuan had given her no hope, Ranmil focused on Emperor Wu instead.","However, when she tried to hold Emperor Wu’s arm, the emperor, who had been affectionate before, brushed her hand off and walked away.","All the officials left with him, leaving Ranmil behind.","“Ranmil...” The chieftain wanted to say something, but hesitated.","Ranmil bit her lip and clenched her fists. “Father, don’t worry! I can handle Emperor Wu! I remember what I need to do!”","“The imperial capital is worlds away, and your life in the royal palace won’t be easy... the Senal Grassland is counting on you.”","“Father, I promise you: One day, the entire grassland will be ours!”","...","Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan went back to their carriage.","Feng Wu sat down and let out a breath of relief.","Jun Linyuan had walked so fast that she almost couldn’t catch up with him.","A few times, they were almost over ten steps apart. That was close.","She looked at Jun Linyuan with a grin.","“What are you smiling at me for?” Jun Linyuan glanced at her. “You look fishy.”","Feng Wu smacked him on the shoulder. “Who are you calling ‘fishy’?!”","Jun Linyuan ignored her and turned to look out the window.","The carriage had already started moving, and the view outside was quite pleasant.","He knew that the girl would soon come to talk to him.","As expected —","Before long, Feng Wu gave him a little nudge.","He pretended that he didn’t see her, and kept looking out the window as if he was drawn to the view.","“Hey, hey —”","Seeing that Jun Linyuan wouldn’t reply, Feng Wu grew anxious. She ran to the other side so that Jun Linyuan had to look at her.","“What?” The crown prince sounded annoyed.","Feng Wu said, “I need to talk to you.”","Jun Linyuan said, “No.”","Feng Wu said, “I haven’t said anything yet.”","The crown prince said, “It won’t be anything good.”","Feng Wu punched him lightly on the shoulder. “Why do you say that? I haven’t told you what it’s about yet! Jun Linyuan, you have to listen to me!”","Jun Linyuan said in annoyance, “You’re such a troublemaker.”","Feng Wu took a deep breath and forced a smile. “My dearest crown prince, please hear me out, alright?”","She knew that Jun Linyuan would say yes if she asked nicely.","As expected, the impatient look gradually faded from Jun Linyuan’s face, and he was about to speak."]},{"number":2106,"title":"Chapter 2106","paragraphs":["“Boss Jun, Boss Jun —”","There was a familiar voice.","Feng Wu cried out inwardly. Feng Xun was coming.","“Boss Jun, we’re arriving at a courier station. I’ve had your room cleaned, and there’s hot water inside. You can freshen up right away.”","Feng Xun grinned at Feng Wu from outside the window, ready to be praised. If he had a tail, it would be wagging nonstop right now.","Feng Wu wanted to smack him on the head.","She was so close to getting Jun Linyuan to agree to play the game, and to tie the two of them together with a transparent rope...","But...","Feng Xun had ruined everything.","“Why, little Feng Wu, you’re here, too.” Feng Xun looked at Jun Linyuan and tried to take him away. “Come with me. I need to talk to you.”","As he spoke, Feng Xun put a hand on Jun Linyuan’s shoulder, trying to drag him away.","However...","The crown prince hated other people touching him, so he looked sharply at Feng Xun.","WTF!","The look made Feng Xun jump, and he drew back his hand involuntarily.","“What?” Jun Linyuan looked at Feng Xun.","Since Feng Xun was his best childhood friend, the crown prince was relatively nice to him.","Feng Xun cleared his throat and murmured, “Why do I feel like Boss Jun is staring at me? Am I daydreaming?”","Meanwhile, the real crown prince was giving him a “you idiot” look.","“Little Feng Wu, come here. I have something serious to tell you.” Feng Xun remembered what he wanted to do.","The crown prince wasn’t interested, until Feng Xun said, “It’s about your reputation!”","Jun Linyuan frowned. If that was the case, he was indeed intrigued.","Feng Xun took Jun Linyuan to a quiet corner. Seeing that “Jun Linyuan” was walking toward them, he gestured for “him” to stop.","“Stop —","“Boss Jun, I’ve always listened to you, but now, you have to listen to me.","“This is a private matter between me and my sister. Boss Jun, don’t eavesdrop.”","Feng Wu looked at Feng Xun in resignation.","What did he want to do now?","Feng Xun’s attitude made Feng Wu a little uneasy.","Because every time Feng Xun tried to help, he ended up giving her more trouble than she already had.","Therefore, she stepped forward, trying to soothe Feng Xun.","“Feng...”","However, as soon as she started talking, Xuan Yi stopped her. “Boss Jun, I need to talk to you.”","Feng Wu was a little speechless when she saw the silent and prim teenager standing in front of her.","But she had to admit that hearing him call her “Boss” felt really good.","“Boss Jun, I need to talk to you,” Xuan Yi repeated.","Feng Wu rolled her eyes at him. “Fine. Go ahead.”","But all of Feng Wu’s attention was on Feng Xun. She didn’t know if he would make trouble for her again.","Her hunch was accurate.","Feng Xun pulled Jun Linyuan to a corner and said seriously, “Xiao Wu, do you know that you’ve made a terrible mistake?”","The crown prince narrowed his eyes and glanced at Feng Xun.","Feng Xun snorted. “You’re going to sleep in the same room as Boss Jun! Feng Wu, are you an idiot?!”","Jun Linyuan narrowed his eyes further."]},{"number":2107,"title":"Chapter 2107","paragraphs":["However, Feng Xun was too absorbed in his own thoughts to notice the oncoming storm. He jabbed “Feng Wu” in the temple and gritted his teeth. “You make me so mad!”","The crown prince had never been jabbed in the temple before.","He brushed off Feng Xun’s hand.","Feng Xun didn’t realize how strong “Feng Wu” had become. He only stared at “her” and said in frustration, “Do you know what that kind of behavior will do to a girl? You’re not married yet. Your reputation will be ruined!”","Jun Linyuan had a brooding look in his eyes.","Feng Xun went on babbling for a while before he reached the conclusion. “Anyway, you need to marry His Royal Highness as soon as possible! Otherwise, you’ll have a lot to lose!”","The crown prince glanced at Feng Xun and walked away.","“What’s that look on your face? I’m so mad!” Feng Xun said in frustration.","The courier station wasn’t big, and there were a lot of people. In the end, only the royal family and the high-ranking officials could spend the night inside. The rest had to set up tents around the station.","After they settled in, naturally, Feng Wu ran into Jun Linyuan’s room.","Of course, she had to.","With the ninth trial, Feng Wu couldn’t stay more than ten steps away from Jun Linyuan, and nothing was more important than completing that trial.","Jun Linyuan glanced at Feng Wu but didn’t say a thing.","Feng Wu asked, “What?”","The crown prince wanted to say something, but hesitated.","Feng Wu quickly set up her bed on the floor. She then asked Jun Linyuan in bewilderment, “What did Feng Xun say?”","The crown prince shook his head. “Nothing.”","Feng Wu was curious. “If that’s the case, why do you look so preoccupied? He must have said something to you. Just tell me. I’m not that fragile. I can take it.”","The crown prince looked at her for a moment and suddenly said, “You should go back to your own room.”","What?","Feng Wu stared at him in disbelief, then narrowed her eyes. “What did you say?”","“Go back.” Jun Linyuan stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu was angry.","When she didn’t want to be around him, he did all he could to trap her.","But now, when she had to stick around because of the ninth trial, his attitude changed completely.","Feng Wu stared at Jun Linyuan.","Jun Linyuan also looked back at Feng Wu.","Hmph!","Feng Wu rose to her feet and headed for the door, but she walked very slowly.","She was sure that Jun Linyuan would stop her.","But to her frustration –","She was about ten steps away, but Jun Linyuan still hadn’t said a thing.","In fact, the crown prince was thinking along the same lines as Feng Wu.","He felt at quite a loss when Feng Wu walked away, as if a hole had opened up in his chest. He opened his mouth.","But he wondered if it would weaken his authority if he stopped her.","He decided that he would stop her after she took the 11th step.","Hence –","While Feng Wu waited for him to stop her, he was waiting for her to take one more step. It was a stalemate.","The atmosphere grew rather awkward.","Anyone else might not have been able to stand it, but not Feng Wu. She was great at enduring awkwardness."]},{"number":2108,"title":"Chapter 2108","paragraphs":["Feng Wu turned around, walked back to Jun Linyuan, and sat down.","“Why are you back?” the crown prince asked with a frown.","He wanted to smile, but he forced himself to look reluctant. That was just what he would do.","Feng Wu stared at Jun Linyuan with a smirk on her face. “Your Royal Highness, haven’t you forgotten something very important?”","As she spoke, she lay on the bed on the floor, rested her head on her hands and crossed her legs. She looked very relaxed.","Jun Linyuan looked at Feng Wu suspiciously.","Feng Wu patted her chest and said proudly, “I’m Jun Linyuan now. If you want to leave, be my guest. I’m not leaving this room.”","Jun Linyuan stared at her.","She grinned. “You don’t scare me!”","Jun Linyuan was speechless.","But he had to admit that with the girl around, he slept much better.","He frowned, rose to his feet, and seemed about to head for the door.","Feng Wu’s stomach lurched.","No!","What was the point in staying here if Jun Linyuan left this room? She had to stay within ten steps of him!","What happened next was quicker than words could describe!","With a whoosh, she ran past Jun Linyuan.","Looking up, Jun Linyuan saw that Feng Wu had jumped onto the bed and wrapped the blanket around her. Only her head was left outside.","“Please don’t leave.” Her eyes glistened, and the look in them was very innocent.","That look —","It could melt any heart.","Jun Linyuan had never wanted to leave, and seeing Feng Wu like this only convinced him to stay.","But he wasn’t good at expressing his emotions, so he waved at her and said, “Go to bed.”","“Yes!”","He thought he saw a bright, happy smile on Feng Wu’s face.","Yes, it was a bright smile. As for happiness, he had probably imagined it.","Before they put out the lamp —","Thump!","The door was kicked open, and someone rushed into the room.","Jun Linyuan and Feng Wu bolted up.","Jun Linyuan quickly stood behind Feng Wu.","But it was too late.","The intruders had spotted him.","The empress dowager saw “her” as soon as she stepped into the room.","“Feng Wu! How dare you?!” The empress dowager pointed at “Feng Wu.”","Of course, she was in fact pointing at the crown prince.","Although Jun Linyuan seldom showed emotions, she was still his grandmother, so he stepped forward and said, “Grandma —”","“Shut up! Who gave you permission to call me that? I’m not your grandmother! You’re not a part of the family! Don’t flatter yourself!” The empress dowager scolded Jun Linyuan.","Feng Wu laughed inwardly.","She was glad to see Jun Linyuan, whom the empress dowager doted on, get told off.","“And you!”","However, the empress dowager saw her grin and turned to lash out at her in frustration.","“Jun Linyuan, have you lost your mind? How can you do such a thing?!” the empress dowager said angrily.","Feng Wu was dumbfounded.","What did she do?","“Grandma, please don’t be mad. What did I do?” Feng Wu spoke like a loving grandson."]},{"number":2109,"title":"Chapter 2109","paragraphs":["The empress dowager glared at Feng Wu. “Don’t you know what you’ve done?!”","Feng Wu smiled wryly, “Grandmother, please tell me what I did wrong.”","That infuriated the empress dowager again.","“Jun Linyuan, are you really that stupid? Have you forgotten who you are? You’re the crown prince, and you’ll rule the Junwu Empire one day! What are you doing?","“You don’t care about your health at all. You’re sleeping on the ground and letting the girl sleep on the bed!","“Have you lost your mind?!” The empress dowager jabbed Feng Wu’s forehead with a finger. “She’s the maid! She should be looking after you and sleeping on the ground! Use your brain!”","The empress dowager wouldn’t stop scolding Jun Linyuan, and he could only listen.","Feng Wu saw his face turn dark.","She couldn’t help but chuckle.","“Why are you smiling? Stop it!” The old lady hit Feng Wu’s butt with her walking stick. “You’re such a fool! That girl is making you forget who you are!”","Feng Wu said, “Grandmother, please don’t be mad. You’ll give yourself a headache.”","The empress dowager said, “If I die, you’re to blame!","“Gosh, my head...” The empress dowager felt dizzy.","Feng Wu immediately helped the old lady sit down. She checked her pulse and said, “Your Majesty, you need to calm down. You’re stressing yourself out.”","“I’m stressed out because of you!” The empress dowager thumped her walking stick on the ground and glared at “Jun Linyuan.”","Feng Wu asked, “What’s wrong?”","The empress dowager said, “Don’t you know? That Ranmil is no kitten. I’ve been watching her. Your father was mad at her before we set out, but the two of them did something in the carriage, and when they got out, your father looked refreshed. Plus, he was holding Consort Ranmil’s hand.”","Feng Wu said, “That’s impressive.”","The empress dowager glared at Feng Wu. “Do you know where Consort Ranmil is now?”","Feng Wu asked, “Where?”","The empress dowager said angrily, “She’s gone to the empress! That woman has been losing ground, and her son is nothing compared with you. Her side was going to be doomed, but then, this Ranmil showed up.","“One look and you know that she’s a tough one. She used to like you, but now, she’s with the emperor. What a foolish son I have!","“But you’re the one to blame. If you had accepted her, she would never have had the chance to obtain your father’s favor or join hands with the empress. Of course, you’re perfect. It’s all her fault!”","The empress dowager complained to Feng Wu.","“Ahem — Grandma, it’s not like that.” Feng Wu helped the empress dowager sit down and said patiently, “Grandma, that Ranmil confessed her love for me first, but when I turned her down, she immediately went to my father. That kind of woman...”","The empress dowager smacked the table. “You’re right! She’s not good enough for you!”","Feng Wu sighed. “Grandma, just think about it. Would that woman stay faithful if I married her?”"]},{"number":2110,"title":"Chapter 2110","paragraphs":["The empress dowager said, “She wouldn’t dare!”","Feng Wu sighed. “Grandma, you know what Ranmil is like. Although she’s my father’s Consort Ranmil now, she still has feelings for me.”","The empress dowager was furious. “That woman is a disaster!”","Feng Wu shrugged. “She knows the Fierce Face dance and has an Enchanting Body. Of course my father adores her.”","The empress dowager said angrily, “Your father is a fool! I’ll break his legs if he doesn’t listen to me!”","Feng Wu chuckled inwardly.","Ranmil wouldn’t leave her alone, but she didn’t have the time to handle Ranmil. However, she had prepared a lot of traps for Ranmil in advance.","She was curious to know if Ranmil could win the empress dowager over.","It wouldn’t be easy, because “Jun Linyuan” had made it clear that “he” and Ranmil were at daggers drawn.","“He” was the empress dowager’s favorite grandson, and she was the bad woman who wanted both the son and the father. It didn’t take a genius to figure out which side the empress dowager would be on.","The empress dowager rose to her feet. “I’d like to see what the emperor will say!”","Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan looked at each other and were glad that the old lady was leaving.","However, the empress dowager suddenly turned around and gave Jun Linyuan a threatening look.","“You’re a maid! Behave like one!” said the empress dowager.","But “Feng Wu” was in fact the proud Jun Linyuan. Of course he wouldn’t behave like a humble maid.","Therefore, Feng Wu stepped forward and blocked Jun Linyuan’s view. She then smiled at the empress dowager. “Of course. I’m sure she knows that.”","The empress dowager said angrily, “You’re indulging her, and she’s spoiled! How can she let you sleep on the floor?!”","After that, the empress dowager glared at Jun Linyuan. “If I see that happening one more time, I’m going to sell you off!”","Feng Wu cleared her throat.","What the empress dowager said made her heart skip a beat.","Luckily, Jun Linyuan hadn’t lost his temper yet.","But if the empress dowager still wouldn’t leave...","Feng Wu immediately took the empress dowager’s hand and led her toward the door. “It’s dark and slippery outside. Granny Lan, be careful on your way back. Don’t let the empress dowager fall.”","The empress dowager told Feng Wu, “That maid is impossible. She doesn’t understand her role. In the end, you’ll be maltreated. So —”","Feng Wu’s stomach lurched.","And she had a very bad feeling.","The empress dowager told Granny Lan, “Send two disciplinary grannies here tomorrow. Feng Wu needs to learn the rules and how to serve her master!”","She left after that.","Feng Wu was dumbfounded.","Oh god...","Feng Wu looked at Jun Linyuan. As expected, his face was very dark.","Feng Wu said, “Don’t take her too seriously. I won’t let those nannies do anything to you! I’m not someone who would do something like that at all!”","“Feng Wu, do you have some misconception about me?” The crown prince glanced at Feng Wu."]},{"number":2111,"title":"Chapter 2111","paragraphs":["Feng Wu asked, “What?”","Jun Linyuan said, “Do you think a couple of disciplinary nannies can do anything to me?”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Just then, they heard a thump.","Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan exchanged a look.","Feng Wu said, “That was loud. I think it came from His Majesty’s room.”","Emperor Wu lived in the largest courtyard in the center, whereas Jun Linyuan’s room was in the east. Therefore, it sounded to them like the thump had come from the west.","Jun Linyuan said, “Go to bed.”","Just then, they heard running footsteps as well.","The fairy suddenly stuck her head out and cried out.","Feng Wu patted her head. “Be quiet!”","Luckily, she and the fairy could communicate with their minds. Because Feng Wu’s cultivation level wasn’t very high, Jun Linyuan couldn’t sense the fairy and the 12 trials yet, nor had he noticed her beautiful master.","The fairy looked very anxious.","Feng Wu grew uneasy and asked, “What?”","“Well... the tenth trial was just activated,” the fairy stammered.","“The tenth trial?’ Feng Wu frowned. “Aren’t I still on the ninth trial? Why is there a new one already?’","The ninth trial required Feng Wu to stay within ten steps of Jun Linyuan.","The fairy sounded very helpless. “I have no idea...”","Feng Wu said, “Fine. What’s the tenth trial, then?”","The fairy gave her a strange look.","Feng Wu suddenly had a bad feeling. “Tell me.”","The fairy said, “Find the Dongsang Kingdom’s revival list, and eliminate everyone on it.”","Feng Wu was dumbfounded. “First of all, what’s a revival list?”","The fairy looked at Feng Wu and shook her head.","Feng Wu was surprised. “You don’t know, either?”","The fairy shook her head. “No, I don’t.”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say. “Is there a time limit, then?”","The fairy shook her head. “No.”","Feng Wu rubbed her chin. “That makes sense. A time limit would make it impossible to finish this trial. The Dongsang Kingdom’s revival list. Where do I begin?","“And why was the tenth trial suddenly triggered? I haven’t finished the ninth trial yet. Did something happen just then?” Feng Wu racked her brain for an answer. Suddenly, she heard Feng’s voice.","“There was an assassination attempt on His Majesty. The attackers were from the Dongsang Kingdom.”","What?!","Feng Wu smacked her head.","The Dongsang Kingdom... The revival list... Feng Wu’s eyes lit up.","The tenth trial was triggered when the Dongsang Kingdom tried to assassinate Emperor Wu. Was there a connection?","At that thought, Feng Wu rose to her feet.","And she pulled Jun Linyuan up as well.","Jun Linyuan had sat down on the bed, trying to repair Feng Wu’s body, but was interrupted. He frowned at her.","Feng Wu chuckled. “Shall we go visit your father?”"]},{"number":2112,"title":"Chapter 2112","paragraphs":["Jun Linyuan said, “He’s protected by so many people. He’ll live. I’m not going.”","Feng Wu thought, “If you don’t go, I can’t go. What about my tenth trial?”","Hence, Feng Wu gave Jun Linyuan a pleading look.","Jun Linyuan looked at Feng Wu in resignation. “Do you really want to go so badly?”","Feng Wu said, “Yes!”","Having no other choice, Jun Linyuan had to go with her.","In the middle courtyard where Emperor Wu lived.","Empress Dugu was keeping Emperor Wu company, and the atmosphere was quite subdued.","The floor was covered with broken cups, shattered chairs, and a screen that had been knocked over. It was a mess.","“Father?” Seeing Emperor Wu’s dark face, Feng Wu frowned and asked Gongshu Ji, the captain of Emperor Wu’s guards, “What happened?”","Gongshu Ji said solemnly, “Ten men in black cloaks were waiting inside the courier station when we arrived. They were very good at hiding, and our men didn’t notice them.”","His voice was filled with frustration. “We were caught off guard when they attacked. They were so fast that there was little we could do.”","Emperor Wu steadied Empress Dugu and said, “I have to thank the empress. If she hadn’t warned me and shielded me with her own body...”","It seemed that Empress Dugu was injured. Blood soaked the cloth over her shoulder.","That attack had been aimed at Emperor Wu’s heart.","So, Empress Dugu had indeed saved the emperor.","Feng Wu couldn’t help but look at Empress Dugu.","She was impressed.","The day before, Empress Dugu had been furious about what happened between Emperor Wu and Ranmil, and she looked like she wanted to run away from her husband.","But it only took her one day to calm down, and now, she was already trying to win Emperor Wu back.","This woman was a chameleon!","Feng Wu glanced at Empress Dugu before asking, “Are you sure that the assassins were from the Dongsang Kingdom?”","Gongshu Ji nodded. “Their great concealment skills are enough to prove that they’re ninjas from the Dongsang Kingdom!","“We checked the calluses on the hands of the dead bodies. It’s obvious that they usually wield katanas.","“Therefore, I’m sure that the assassins were from the Dongsang Kingdom.”","Emperor Wu said angrily, “Are they going to revolt again?!”","Everyone fell silent.","The entire Junwu Empire knew how savage the Dongsang Kingdom was.","They had committed heinous crimes in the Junwu Empire 13 years ago.","Dongsang Kingdom was less than one-tenth of the size of the Junwu Empire.","However, the Dongsang Kingdom was very powerful.","They had too little land and too many people. They experienced constant natural disasters, and took death more lightly than the people of other countries.","They had a sense of national cohesion that united them and enabled them to fight as one.","No matter how large their population was, if they didn’t work together, they wouldn’t be able to achieve anything.","However, a few people working together could become a formidable force!","13 years ago, the Dongsang Kingdom was driven by such a force and tore through the defense line of the Junwu Empire. After that, they quickly reached every corner of the empire..."]},{"number":2113,"title":"Chapter 2113","paragraphs":["The Dongsang Kingdom’s cavalry ran wild in the Junwu Empire and committed many unspeakable crimes.","The entire empire was dragged into the war and was on the verge of a total collapse. Fortunately, a capable hero led the army and chased the men of the Dongsang Kingdom out of the Junwu Empire.","However, it didn’t change the fact that it was a humiliating past for the empire.","Emperor Wu forbade anyone from recording this part of history, hoping that the people would forget about it.","Naturally, the imperial censor disagreed.","He killed himself in court in order to try and stop the emperor.","But Emperor Wu was stubborn and refused to listen to anyone. He insisted that the war should be omitted from historical records and never mentioned again. Gradually, everyone forgot about it.","Children younger than 13 had never experienced the war and knew little about it.","For instance, Feng Wu only had a rough idea.","She knew that a great master helped the empire end the war.","But no one ever mentioned who the master was.","After performing such a great achievement, the people shouldn’t forget this person.","Feng Wu wanted to ask who the person was, but she was playing Jun Linyuan now.","Of course, Jun Linyuan should know the person’s name, so she had to keep the question to herself until she got back to her room.","However, what Emperor Wu said next answered her question. “Back then, Master Linghu single-handedly killed the enemy leader, and the Dongsang army admitted defeat. After that, they signed a treaty that was to our benefit.”","Feng Wu was surprised.","Master Linghu? Wasn’t he the old monk of Wandering Temple?","Feng Wu was very familiar with that name.","She had to finish the 12 Trials of Love because of that master!","So, it was him...","“That’s why people respect the old monk so much, including Emperor Wu and the empress dowager,” thought Feng Wu. That old man had done so much for the empire.","“But Master Linghu said that he can’t do this forever. He owed my grandfather a favor, and because of that, he killed the enemy leader. Now that we’re even, he won’t do anything if war breaks out again,” said Jun Linyuan casually.","Emperor Wu exploded.","He glared at “Feng Wu” and shouted, “Why do you know that?!”","It was classified information!","No more than ten people knew the secret, and they were all close to Emperor Wu.","If the Dongsang Kingdom knew about this, they would invade the empire again.","“Jun Linyuan, how could you tell her?!” Emperor Wu was furious.","“Are you really going to marry her? Have you forgotten your agreement with Zuo Qingluan?!”","What?","Of all the things Emperor Wu said, Feng Wu only heard the last part.","Jun Linyuan and Zuo Qingluan had an agreement? What was it?","She gave Jun Linyuan a confused look, but Jun Linyuan didn’t seem to want to answer her question.","“Ahem.” He cleared his throat.","Things kept happening after they left the tombs, and he didn’t have time to properly repair Feng Wu’s body. Because of that, he would still cough from time to time.","Luckily, he had repaired 30%, which was enough to keep Feng Wu alive."]},{"number":2114,"title":"Chapter 2114","paragraphs":["However, at that moment —","A young eunuch came in to serve the tea.","He was called Qiu and had been doing this job for a very long time. After serving the tea, he turned to leave the room.","Something happened when he walked past Jun Linyuan.","He suddenly smashed the teapot onto Jun Linyuan’s back.","Jun Linyuan was using Feng Wu’s body, which he had only repaired by 30%.","No one had expected the young eunuch to be a martial arts practitioner.","Moreover, he was great at hiding his skills.","Jun Linyuan shifted to the side, barely evading the attack. Feng Wu reacted in time and punched the eunuch.","Thump!","Qiu’s head was smashed into a pulp!","Wow —","Everyone stared at Feng Wu in disbelief.","Oh god!","That was such terrifying power.","The crown prince was as formidable as rumored.","Seeing the dead body, even Empress Dugu was impressed.","Caught off guard, Feng Wu didn’t control her power. While killing Qiu, she almost brought the courier station to the ground.","The ceiling trembled, and rubble fell.","But she couldn’t care less about the building.","Where was Jun Linyuan?","Normally, she wouldn’t worry about Jun Linyuan, but he was using her body now, and her cultivation level wasn’t high enough to protect him.","Looking around, Feng Wu saw that Jun Linyuan was being held by a person that was moving very fast.","It seemed that Jun Linyuan had been knocked out.","“Don’t.”","Feng Wu was about to go after them, when Emperor Wu stopped her. “Have you lost your mind? Stop right there!","“They’re from the Dongsang Kingdom and are great at using tricks. They’ve taken Feng Wu to lure you out! It’s a trap!","“That Feng Wu is just a maid! You can’t risk your life for her!”","Of course, Emperor Wu wouldn’t want his son to take the risk.","Feng Wu was furious.","Emperor Wu had no idea that “Feng Wu” was his son. No matter how advanced his original level was, he couldn’t use any of his skills now.","At that thought, Feng Wu shoved Emperor Wu to the side and said, “I’m going to save her!”","Emperor Wu stumbled. The next second, Feng Wu disappeared from sight.","“That defiant son!” Emperor Wu slapped his hand down on the table.","Did this defiant son think that he could do anything just because he was a capable fighter?","“Protect the crown prince!” Emperor Wu glanced at Gongshu Ji.","Hearing that, Gongshu Ji immediately dashed off with his elite soldiers.","Feng Wu kept her gaze on the man ahead of her and ran as fast as she could.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","Because it was Jun Linyuan’s power and Feng Wu wasn’t used to it yet, she was almost flung away several times whenever she turned a corner.","There was a thick forest up ahead.","Feng Wu narrowed her eyes in an intimidating way.","Once inside, her view would be hindered. Moreover, she couldn’t master this power yet, and it would be very disadvantageous for her.","However, to the ninjas of the Dongsang Kingdom, the forest was the best place for them to hide.","Feng Wu was a little frustrated. If it was the real Jun Linyuan, he would have caught the enemy already..."]},{"number":2115,"title":"Chapter 2115 - Jun Linyuan Was Snatched","paragraphs":["Right now, Feng Wu couldn’t control Jun Linyuan’s great power.","It was like owning a great fortune but only being able to use one coin at a time. Feng Wu was so frustrated.","She swore that once this was over, she would use all her time to train herself so that she could master this power.","If the Dongsang Kingdom heard about this weakening of Jun Linyuan’s power, they would try to assassinate him.","That would be dangerous.","Just then, the ninja disappeared.","Where did he go?","On guard, Feng Wu narrowed her eyes.","Right now, she had even forgotten about the ninth trial and the fact that she had to stay within ten steps of Jun Linyuan.","At that moment, she heard a loud explosion.","It was 500 meters to the northeast!","Without thinking, Feng Wu dashed off.","She reached the site in a split second.","Jun Linyuan was leaning against a slope, and opposite him was the ninja, who had been severely injured by the explosion.","“Kill him.”","Jun Linyuan was covered by wounds, and there was blood at the corner of his mouth. However, his tone remained authoritative.","Without thinking, Feng Wu charged at the ninja.","She drew out Sky Destroyer.","The ninja’s pupils contracted.","He was doomed!","The crown prince of the Junwu Empire was said to be the most formidable cultivator on this continent. The ninja knew that he wouldn’t be able to withstand the attack.","However, men of the Dongsang Kingdom never surrendered.","Therefore, the ninja still raised his sword even though he knew that he would be killed.","Seeing the way Feng Wu struck out, Jun Linyuan frowned.","And he was right to do so!","The two swords met in mid-air.","Thump!","The strike sent the ninja flying backward. He smashed into the mountain wall, destroying half of it.","Feng Wu didn’t notice anything different, but Jun Linyuan’s face darkened.","And he was right to do so!","The ninja struggled to his feet and stared at Feng Wu. His eyes were filled with confusion, but he also looked pleasantly surprised.","“Are you really the crown prince?” he asked in a deep voice.","Feng Wu didn’t know what gave her away, but she wouldn’t give in.","She glared at the ninja.","“I see. The crown prince of the Junwu Empire hasn’t even mastered the power of the primary stage yet. Hahahaha —” The ninja sounded happy.","Feng Wu frowned and wondered what had given her away.","But before she could ask anything, the ninja dashed off.","She had a bad feeling and wanted to go after him.","“Stop —”","Jun Linyuan coughed violently and almost spat out blood.","Feng Wu immediately ran back to Jun Linyuan and stuffed some pills into his mouth. She then checked his pulse. “You’re badly injured. That 30% you repaired has gone to waste. How do you feel?”","Jun Linyuan said, “I’ll live.”","Feng Wu asked, “Why didn’t you let me kill him? He’ll be a huge problem for us in the future. He must have...”","Jun Linyuan asked, “He must have what?”","Feng Wu said, “He must have noticed something different about you. Judging by his tone, he was happy about it. Is it possible that I’ll become their target?”"]},{"number":2116,"title":"Chapter 2116 - Failed the Ninth Trial?","paragraphs":["After the war 13 years ago, the Junwu Empire had been keeping a low profile. It was because of Jun Linyuan that the empire gained fame again.","Compared with assassinating Emperor Wu, they would rather kill Jun Linyuan.","“Your body will be in danger.” Feng Wu stared at Jun Linyuan.","The crown prince said, “I know.”","Feng Wu took his hands. “Aren’t you worried?”","Jun Linyuan smiled but didn’t say anything.","Feng Wu asked, “What’s the primary stage? Why did that ninja notice the difference?”","Jun Linyuan said, “You’re too far below that stage now, and it won’t do you any good to know too much. As for why he noticed it...”","He glanced at Feng Wu, but before he could say anything, he was caught in a fit of coughing again.","Feng Wu immediately steadied him. “Your lungs are injured. You shouldn’t be talking.”","The crown prince shook his head. “Because your energy is everywhere when you strike out, but powerful people like me can concentrate their power to a single point. It’s still too early to tell you how to do that.”","Suddenly, white wild geese flew into the sky.","Jun Linyuan looked at the birds and shook his head. “Your worry has just come true.”","Feng Wu asked, “What?”","Jun Linyuan pointed at the wild geese and said, “That’s sign language used by the Dongsang Kingdom. They’re sending a signal.”","Feng Wu had a bad feeling. “What signal?”","Jun Linyuan looked at Feng Wu. “Assassinate the crown prince.”","Feng Wu asked, “What?”","Her prediction was right.","Feng Wu said, “I...”","Jun Linyuan waved at her. “I anticipated this when I switched bodies with you. There’s no need for you to worry about anything.”","Feng Wu looked perplexed.","Feng Wu thought that she was farsighted and prudent, but as it turned out, Jun Linyuan was even more so.","Feng Wu suddenly remembered something, and she cried out.","Jun Linyuan was perplexed.","Feng Wu suddenly remembered the fairy.","Because!","“I was more than ten steps away from Jun Linyuan when I came out to chase the ninja, wasn’t I?”","The fairy said, “Yes...”","Feng Wu’s eyes widened, and blue veins popped on her forehead. “Have I failed the trial?”","Feng Wu was so frustrated that she spat out a mouthful of blood.","Her broken star piece, her beautiful master... Feng Wu felt that she had been struck by lightning, and she thought that her head was going to explode.","Her ears were buzzing so loudly that she almost passed out.","Jun Linyuan’s pupils contracted. What was wrong with her?","Luckily, the fairy said, “Hey! Calm down! You didn’t fail!”","Seeing that Feng Wu didn’t respond, the fairy raised her voice. “I’m here, aren’t I? That means that you haven’t failed the 12 Trials of Love! You can still find the broken star piece! Wake up!”","For a moment, the fairy thought that Feng Wu’s soul was going to leave her body!"]},{"number":2117,"title":"Chapter 2117 - The Angry Crown Prince","paragraphs":["Feng Wu’s question almost made the fairy jump.","Hearing the fairy’s reply, Feng Wu gradually returned to herself. “I didn’t fail the trial?”","The fairy patted her chest. “Look. I’m still here, aren’t I?”","Feng Wu stared at the fairy and saw that she hadn’t disappeared.","She was relieved, but not completely.","“Didn’t you say that I had to stay within ten steps of Jun Linyuan, otherwise I would fail the trial?”","The fairy lowered her head and wouldn’t look at Feng Wu.","Seeing this, Feng Wu knew that something was off, so she said loudly, “Tell me the truth now! Are you deliberately hiding something from me?!”","Her tone almost scared the fairy, but the fairy felt that it was her fault, and didn’t dare object.","She quickly looked up at Feng Wu, before lowering her head.","“I didn’t try to keep it from you, but... but I forgot to tell you that there’s an exception.”","“What exception?” asked Feng Wu","“The rules say that you have one chance...”","Feng Wu stared at her. “One chance to do what?”","The fairy said, “You have one chance to stay further than ten steps from him.”","Feng Wu asked, “Only once? Are you sure?”","The fairy said, “Yes. Only once. You can see it here.”","After that, the fairy showed Feng Wu the task log.","The first line said “Ninth Trial,” and the second line was the footnote, which was written in tiny font.","The fairy was right. Feng Wu only had one chance.","Feng Wu patted her chest and let out a breath of relief. She almost had a heart attack just then.","“Feng Wu? Feng Wu?!”","In reality, Feng Wu had fainted. Therefore, the fairy urged her, “You need to wake up now. Otherwise, your crown prince will be so worried.”","“What are you talking about? He’s not mine,” Feng Wu retorted.","The fairy gave her a shove. “Yours or not...”","Feng Wu was then pushed out by the fairy and didn’t hear the remainder of the sentence.","The fairy shook her head and smiled wryly. “Haven’t you realized? The point of every trial so far has been to try and make you and the crown prince get to know each other better.”","From the upsy-daisy to the “no more than ten steps apart,” the 12 Trials of Love had been trying to warm things up between the two of them. Otherwise, there would never be any intimate interactions between the two proud teenagers.","Unfortunately, Feng Wu still hadn’t realized the purpose of the trials.","“Feng Wu!” Jun Linyuan shook her violently.","“That hurts!” Feng Wu cried out and sat up.","Jun Linyuan stared at her and let out a breath of relief. He leaned back onto the slope and was too tired to even move a finger.","He wanted to scold Feng Wu but didn’t have the energy to do it.","Feng Wu realized that she had overreacted, so she scratched her head and said, “Is it because of our body swap? I’m not used to your body yet and can’t control your power well. It’s too easy to use too much energy.”"]},{"number":2118,"title":"Chapter 2118 - Ninja In Black","paragraphs":["That was an excuse good enough to fool Jun Linyuan.","Just then —","Feng Xun and Xuan Yi arrived, bringing a man with them.","“What?”","Feng Wu was surprised to see the man.","“Isn’t he...”","Wasn’t he the ninja that she had fought earlier?","Feng Xun and Xuan Yi had caught him. Had they become so capable already?","Jun Linyuan snorted. “I planted the seed of the Magic Soul Vine in him before he ran off. There was no way he could escape.”","“The seed of the Magic Soul Vine?” Feng Wu was shocked. “Isn’t that... poison?”","Jun Linyuan nodded.","That was why Jun Linyuan had been so calm. Although his current body was weak, everything was still under his control.","Feng Wu said, “Isn’t the Magic Soul Vine highly poisonous? And what’s its seed?”","Jun Linyuan glanced at her. “Do you want to know?”","Feng Wu was very curious.","After all, that the Magic Soul Vine was in her body and for her to use now. Of course she had to figure out what it was.","“Yes, I do!” Feng Wu nodded.","But the crown prince said coldly, “I’m not telling you.”","Feng Wu said, “You —”","Just then.","Whoosh!","Feng Xun threw the man onto the ground.","The ninja had been poisoned by the Magic Soul Vine, and the impact made him spit out a mouthful of blood. He felt dizzy and could barely open his eyes.","“Xiao Wu, are you alright?” Feng Xun quickly ran to Jun Linyuan’s side, trying to pick him up.","Feng Wu immediately stopped Feng Xun. “Don’t move her!”","Feng Xun looked at Feng Wu and said, “Boss Jun, please save Xiao Wu. I know how stubborn she is, but she means well. Please don’t be mad at her.”","Feng Wu glanced at Feng Xun and wondered when she gave him that impression.","Seeing “Boss Jun’s” expressionless face, Feng Xun grew uneasy. “Boss Jun, Feng Wu really likes you. Don’t believe what she told you.”","Feng Wu said, “What?”","Feng Xun gave Jun Linyuan a little kick and whispered at him, “Say something!”","Jun Linyuan was speechless.","Feng Xun smiled obsequiously and said, “Xiao Wu really likes you. She talks about you a lot when you’re not around. That’s enough...”","Jun Linyuan’s eyes flickered.","Infuriated, Feng Wu stomped on Feng Xun’s foot. “Shut up!”","Feng Xun cried out in pain and jumped around on one foot.","Poor Feng Xun.","Meanwhile, the ninja tried to seize the moment to run away. Suddenly, he was out of sight.","The look on Xuan Yi’s face changed.","Jun Linyuan smiled a little and flicked out a soybean.","Poof!","The soybean ripped through the air, and the ninja hiding in the branches lost his cover.","Seeing the ninja crouching on the branch like a monkey, Feng Xun forgot about his painful foot and guffawed.","Xuan Yi leaped up. The next second, he threw the ninja onto the ground."]},{"number":2119,"title":"Chapter 2119 - Seed of the Magic Soul Vine","paragraphs":["Thump!","The ninja spat out another mouthful of blood when he hit the ground.","“You...”","The ninja stared at Jun Linyuan in disbelief. “How did you know...”","Jun Linyuan glanced at Feng Wu, and she quickly helped him to his feet.","“Interrogate him,” said Jun Linyuan.","Feng Xun quickly picked up the ninja, but the next second, he paused and gave “Feng Wu” a strange look.","“Her” tone and demeanor reminded him so much of Boss Jun.","However, Feng Xun still didn’t suspect anything. He had found a perfect excuse for “Feng Wu.”","The two of them had been staying together all the time; they were bound to resemble each other. Just look at how serious “Feng Wu” had become.","At that thought, Feng Xun rolled his eyes at “Boss Jun.” He wanted the old Feng Wu back!","Feng Wu was perplexed by that look.","Soon, Feng Wu saw how Feng Xun carried out an interrogation.","He was usually a silly teenager, but when he was at work, he could become very serious.","The ninja tried to kill himself several times, but Feng Xun stopped him in time.","When he tried to bite down on the poisonous pill hidden in his tooth, Feng Xun dislocated his chin.","When he tried to rip his collar open to get the poison, Feng Xun cut off his right hand.","The ninja glared at Feng Xun.","Feng Xun pushed the ninja’s chin back in place and smirked. “Did you really think you could pull that off in front of me? Don’t you know that I work for the interrogation department of Military Intelligence?”","Feng Wu couldn’t help but glance at Feng Xun. The interrogation department?","She saw that neither Jun Linyuan nor Xuan Yi had any reaction. Did they belong to that department as well?","It was said that the Junwu Empire used to have an interrogation department that was under the command of the Ministry of War. The department then developed into Military Intelligence, which was under the direct command of Emperor Wu and followed his orders only.","Today, Feng Wu finally saw how formidable Feng Xun could be when he put his mind to it.","“Ahhh —","“Ahhh —","“Ahhh —”","The ninja was indeed a tough man. At first, he wouldn’t say anything, not even when he was tortured.","But Feng Xun was relentless.","Seeing the blood which splattered and how much the ninja suffered, Feng Wu was impressed.","She should have known. Jun Linyuan’s friends couldn’t be that simple.","Feng Xun seemed harmless, but that was only because he was nice to Feng Wu. When it came to other people, he could be very intimidating.","“If you want to stay silent, be my guest, but you’re going to...” With a flip of his dagger, Feng Xun peeled another thin slice of flesh off the ninja.","Feng Wu felt that Feng Xun would make a great sashimi cook.","The ninja wanted to die but couldn’t.","He was tied to a tree and stripped to the waist. Feng Xun was cutting off his flesh one strip at a time. With each cut, the ninja screamed.","Of course it hurt.","Feng Xun’s interrogation skills were...","He could peel off a strip of flesh all the way from the ninja’s shoulder to his stomach without making him bleed.","“Kill me... Please let me die...”"]},{"number":2120,"title":"Chapter 2120 - Saturn Revival Team","paragraphs":["Under Feng Xun’s relentless interrogation, the ninja finally broke.","He gritted his teeth and stared at Feng Xun. Sweat rolled down his forehead and into his eyes.","He looked like he had just been pulled out of the water.","His throat was raw from all the screaming.","Feng Xun patted his chest with the dagger and said teasingly, “You don’t have to speak. There’s still so much flesh left. I can wait.”","“Stop... I’ll tell you...” When Feng Xun raised his dagger again, the ninja shouted, “I’ll tell you whatever you want.”","Feng Xun grinned. “Where are you from?”","The ninja said, “The Dongsang Kingdom.”","Feng Xun said, “Your name.”","The ninja said, “Tanimura Ryuichi.”","Feng Xun asked, “What’s your mission?”","The ninja said, “I’m an undercover agent. I collect information and carry out assassinations.”","Feng Xun smiled a little. “When did you come to the Junwu Empire?”","The ninja said, “13 years ago.”","That answer surprised a lot of people.","Wasn’t that when the war took place? Had this man been here since then?","Feng Wu’s stomach lurched.","She was reminded of the tenth trial.","It was to kill everyone on the Dongsang Kingdom’s revival list.","Was it possible that this ninja was one of them?","Feng Xun asked, “Did you participate in the war?”","The ninja hesitated, but nodded in the end.","Feng Xun said, “Didn’t you sign the letter of surrender, and were chased out of the Junwu Empire by that man?!”","He grabbed the ninja’s collar and shouted, “Speak!”","The ninja said, “Before the sacred war...”","“The sacred war? Is that what you call it?” Feng Xun almost broke his neck.","The ninja almost choked, but Feng Xun released him in time and said, “Keep talking!”","The ninja coughed and panted for a while before going on. “Back then, our kingdom sent people here before the war started, and some of them weren’t exposed during the war. Therefore, they’ve stayed hidden since then.”","Feng Wu frowned.","“Is that your so-called ‘revival project’?” Feng Wu smiled.","The ninja looked up in astonishment and stared at Feng Wu in disbelief. “Why do you know that title?!","“Hahaha! The crown prince is indeed a capable man. We can’t keep anything from you.” The ninja laughed, but stopped abruptly.","“You deliberately let me get away so that I could send that message... You!” The ninja glared at Feng Wu. “This is a trap! Curse you!”","Feng Wu didn’t say anything.","Nor did Jun Linyuan.","Feng Xun looked at Feng Wu in confusion.","Feng Wu was troubled but couldn’t tell anyone else.","She knew what the ninja meant.","When he got away, he had sent a message to say that the crown prince wasn’t as capable as he was said to be. After the undercover agents in the Junwu Empire learned this, they would definitely try to assassinate Jun Linyuan.","But now, this ninja thought that this was a trap designed by the crown prince..."]},{"number":2121,"title":"Chapter 2121 - Youre Lying","paragraphs":["That was why the ninja was so frustrated.","As a matter of fact –","Right now, “Jun Linyuan” was indeed very weak... Feng Wu smiled wryly.","Of course, she couldn’t tell anyone this secret, and decided to keep the ninja guessing. She was going to let the ninja continue to be misinformed.","The most important thing now was to obtain the revival list.","Feng Wu stared at the ninja. “Give me the list.”","The ninja stared back at Feng Wu. “Don’t you have it already?”","Feng Wu smirked. “If you lie to us... Feng Xun, make sure he suffers for 81 days before he dies.”","By that, she meant that Feng Xun should keep peeling off the ninja’s flesh.","No matter how tough the ninja was, he wouldn’t be able to endure the torture for 81 days.","Therefore, the ninja could only grit his teeth as he glared at Feng Wu. “I only know the members of the Saturn Revival Team. I swear I don’t know the rest!”","The Saturn Team?","Feng Wu raised an eyebrow.","She was an avid reader and knew what that meant.","In a long-lost ancient civilization, a month was divided into four seven-day weeks, and this civilization used a seven-star altar.","Seven gods were worshiped on the seven levels of the altar, which were the gods of the sun, the moon, Mars, Mercury, Jupiter, Venus, and Saturn.","The day of the sun was Sunday.","The day of the moon was Monday.","The day of Mars was Tuesday.","The day of Mercury was Wednesday.","The day of Jupiter was Thursday.","The day of Venus was Friday.","The day of Saturn was Saturday.","However, only a handful of people still remembered this information.","Therefore, when the ninja said that he belonged to the Saturn Team, it suddenly occurred to Feng Wu that there were six more of them.","Feng Wu smiled a little. “Are you saying that you don’t have any contact with the other six teams?”","The ninja felt that he had just been struck by a thunderbolt.","Was the “crown prince” even human? How could “he” know that there were six more teams?","Seeing the look on his face, Feng Wu knew that she had guessed right.","The boss of the intelligence department of the Dongsang Kingdom was to be blamed for this. Why did he have to copy the names from an ancient book?","Feng Wu gave Feng Xun a warning glance.","Feng Xun nodded and smacked the ninja on the forehead. “The names of your team.”","The ninja hesitated at first, but when he saw how confident “the crown prince” was, he lost all hope.","In the end, he gave them seven names.","“Is that all?” Feng Wu asked.","The ninja nodded. “The Saturn Team has seven members, including me.”","Just then, Feng Wu received a message in her head.","It was about the tenth trial.","It read, “The Saturn Team, 6/10.”","What?","That was to say, six of them were dead, and four were still at large.","Feng Wu narrowed her eyes. “How many of them are dead?”","Feng Xun said, “He just said that the Saturn Revival Team has seven members.”","Feng Wu stared at the ninja. “Is that so?”","The ninja said, “Yes.”","Why did he feel that “the crown prince’s” eyes were so black and so frightening?"]},{"number":2122,"title":"Chapter 2122 - Do You Have a Death Wish?","paragraphs":["Feng Wu chuckled. “Six of the seven members are dead. So, you’re saying that you’re the only one left.”","The ninja said, “Yes.”","Liar!","Feng Wu smirked inwardly.","Had it not been for the note that the fairy had shown her, she wouldn’t have been able to see through his lie. However, with the note...","Feng Wu glanced at Feng Xun.","Taking the hint, Feng Xun slid the blade of his dagger across the ninja’s skin.","“Ah!”","The ninja screamed.","Feng Wu smirked. “You’re lying.”","The ninja finally believed that the “crown prince” knew everything about the revival teams.","“There are ten members on my team! Ten!” the ninja screamed.","Feng Wu said coldly, “That’s the answer I want to hear. However, you just lied to me. That was interesting. Feng Xun, what do you think we should do?”","Feng Xun smiled. “He tried to hide three members from us. How about we take three more pieces from him?’","Feng Wu crossed her hands behind her back and nodded. “Go ahead.”","“Ah!","“Ah!","“Ahhh!!!”","The ninja almost passed out from the pain.","The “crown prince” was as terrifying as “he” was said to be.","Recalling the signal he had just sent to tell his people that the crown prince was weak, he wanted to kill himself.","Once the ninja completely surrendered, Feng Xun obtained much more information from him.","Feng Wu said, “Write it up in a report.”","Feng Xun nodded. That was what he usually did.","Just then —","“Your Royal Highness —”","Gongshu Ji arrived.","Behind him was a team of 50 royal guards.","Feng Wu frowned because it had taken Gongshu Ji too long.","Gongshu Ji knew why the “crown prince” was displeased, and he immediately said, “We were stopped by a group of men in black on our way here and were delayed. That’s why...”","Who else would try to stall them?","Feng Wu snorted and made a mental note of it.","Hearing “his” snort, Gongshu Ji felt uneasy. The “crown prince” wasn’t someone he could offend.","“Your Royal Highness, who’s this?” Gongshu Ji studied the badly tortured man and was pleasantly surprised. “Is he a ninja of the Dongsang Kingdom?!”","Feng Wu nodded. She then told Feng Xun, “Take him back.”","Obviously, she wasn’t going to let Gongshu Ji have him.","Gongshu Ji rubbed his nose. If the “crown prince” wouldn’t give him the man, there was nothing he could do.","Jun Linyuan was badly wounded. Any slight move would make him cough violently.","Feng Wu had wanted Feng Xun to carry Jun Linyuan back, but she then realized that it was her own body and shouldn’t be held by a man.","With no other choice, Feng Wu had to pick Jun Linyuan up herself.","“ Cough! ”","Jun Linyuan coughed and stared at Feng Wu.","“Do you have a death wish?!” he shouted angrily.","He was the crown prince of the empire!","But Feng Wu had picked him up as if she was carrying a little girl...","The crown prince felt humiliated.","He wanted to kill Feng Wu with his eyes.","Everyone lowered their heads.","They decided that they hadn’t seen anything."]},{"number":2123,"title":"Chapter 2123 - Ill Call You Consort Ranmil","paragraphs":["Feng Xun dragged the ninja away. He patted Feng Wu’s shoulder and said sympathetically, “Boss Jun, I thought the two of you already passed this stage. It seems that your relationship is going nowhere. You have my sympathy.”","Feng Wu didn’t say anything.","Jun Linyuan was astonished!","Back in the courier station.","Feng Wu was going to report back to Emperor Wu to show some respect.","But Jun Linyuan snorted and said, “Go back to your room!”","Feng Wu didn’t say anything.","Jun Linyuan kept his gaze on her, and Feng Wu had no choice but to take him back to their room.","Gongshu Ji went to report to the emperor.","“What? Jun Linyuan caught a ninja alive?!”","Emperor Wu was overjoyed!","However, he then realized that it shouldn’t be difficult for Jun Linyuan to do that at all!","“Where is that ninja? Bring him here! I’ll interrogate him myself!”","Gongshu Ji said, “Well, Your Majesty...”","Emperor Wu said angrily, “Bring him here!”","Gongshu Ji said, “Your Majesty, His Royal Highness took him away.”","“Then tell him...” Emperor Wu stopped abruptly because he suddenly realized that Jun Linyuan had the ninja.","Anyone else would have followed the emperor’s orders.","But not Jun Linyuan, the “defiant son.”","The more he thought about it, the angrier Emperor Wu got, but there was nothing he could do to Jun Linyuan.","“Get out of my sight!” he said angrily.","Gongshu Ji let out a breath of relief and quickly walked away.","Before long, Wang announced, “Your Majesty, Consort Ranmil is here to see you.”","Ranmil had arrived.","Emperor Wu had doted on Ranmil, both because of her beauty and her Enchanting Body.","But he remembered how Ranmil’s trick had backfired and she had admitted in front of everyone that she liked Jun Linyuan... The thought made Emperor Wu hate her.","“I don’t want to see her!” said Emperor Wu.","Wang went out of the room and told Ranmil, “His Majesty is busy. Consort Ranmil, please go back.”","Ranmil bit her lower lip in frustration.","She wouldn’t have come here if they hadn’t caught the ninja, but now, Emperor Wu wouldn’t even see her.","She stormed off.","She had her own room.","After she got back, Qingcao closed the door before looking at her.","Ranmil said angrily, “Not only won’t Emperor Wu see me, he sent me back. I have an Enchanting Body! If he summons me to his bedchamber next time, I won’t go!”","Qingcao gave her an indescribable look.","That look made Ranmil uneasy.","“Why are you staring at me?” Ranmil frowned.","Qingcao was smart and good with people. Therefore, Ranmil had been taking advice from her for years.","Qingchao walked to Ranmil’s side, crouched down, and held the princess’s hand without speaking.","Before Ranmil asked the question, Qingcao spoke.","“Princess, from now on, I’ll address you as Consort Ranmil.”","Ranmil stared at Qingcao in astonishment.","Qingcao had a solemn look on her face."]},{"number":2124,"title":"Chapter 2124 - Love and Hate","paragraphs":["“The moment you leave the grassland, you’re Consort Ranmil of the Junwu Empire. Princess Ranmil doesn’t exist anymore.","“Once we reach the Junwu Empire, you’ll have no one to depend on. The only way you can survive is to gain the emperor’s favor.","“Emperor Wu can tolerate the crown prince’s defiance, but have you seen him tolerate anyone else? Everyone else has to show him their utter respect.","“My lady, your Enchanting Body is nothing compared with the dignity of an emperor. His Majesty was doing perfectly fine before you showed up.”","Ranmil clenched her fists, her face very dark.","Qingcao knew that Ranmil didn’t like to hear that, but she had to tell her the truth.","“The emperor tolerates HIs Royal Highness’s behavior because the crown prince is irreplaceable. The empire can’t afford to lose him!","“But my lady, you’re not irreplaceable.”","Consort Ranmil stared at Qingcao. “You!”","Qingcao took a deep breath. “Even if you’re mad at me, I still need to say this. My lady, you think too highly of yourself. You’re not that unique, and you shouldn’t be too proud.","“Even our chieftain respects Emperor Wu, but you’ve been giving the emperor attitude. That’s very presumptuous!","“Haven’t you realized how bad things have gotten for you?","“You showed your affection for the crown prince in front of everyone. As the ruler of an empire, what do you think the emperor will think? He has to face all the people!” said Qingcao.","“But I have the Enchanting...” said Ranmil.","“The emperor can live without an Enchanting Body!” Qingcao said loudly.","Ranmil glared at her.","Qingcao said, “You know very well that if things aren’t going well, Emperor Wu will abandon you.”","Ranmil said, “Qingcao!”","Qingcao said, “Therefore, your top priority is to gain the emperor’s favor and replace Empress Dugu. You need to give him a son that’ll inherit the throne. That’s the best way to get back at the crown prince, and will also be the best outcome for the Senal Grassland!","“My lady, you’re the hope of the entire grassland!","“But you’re still angry at His Majesty!”","...","Qingcao analyzed the current situation for Ranmil.","Ranmil clenched her fists and thought about it.","She had to admit that Qingcao’s words made sense.","Since she had chosen this path, there was no going back.","She and Jun Linyuan could only be enemies.","Instead of affection, she should think about what she could gain for the grassland.","She had been so silly before.","Moreover, she also had a secret agreement with the Dongsang Kingdom.","“So, what do you think I should do now?” Ranmil stared at Qingcao.","Qingcao said, “Make Emperor Wu like you.”","Ranmil said, “He won’t even see me.”","Qingcao smiled. “His Majesty must be missing your Enchanting Body now. Therefore, all you need to do is take some initiative, and you’ll have his favor again. However, you need to do something about the crown prince.","“You need to convince Emperor Wu that you don’t have any love for the crown prince anymore, nor do you hate him. You simply find him unpleasant.”","Love and hate were two sides of the same coin.","“I know.”"]},{"number":2125,"title":"Chapter 2125 - How Do You Know?","paragraphs":["Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan didn’t know of the change in Ranmil’s mentality.","Right now, they were engaged in a staring contest.","Feng Wu said, “I need to treat the wounds on my body. Close your eyes.”","The crown prince glanced at her. “Why?”","Feng Wu glared at him. “This is my body! If you don’t close your eyes, I’ll look at yours!”","Jun Linyuan said, “You’re so childish.”","Feng Wu said, “I’m going to wash you now, so you need to close your eyes.”","Not only did she have Jun Linyuan close his eyes, she also wrapped black cloth around his head several times to cover his eyes.","When she removed his clothes and saw her own body, she couldn’t bring herself to keep looking.","Since when were there so many wounds on her body?","There were more bruises than she could count.","Her chest and abdomen had been cut and whipped. They were the marks of an interrogation...","The ninja had used the short period of time to torture “her.”","And those weren’t the only wounds...","Her back was badly burnt from the explosion.","And her arms and legs...","They were also covered with wounds.","Feng Wu almost burst into tears!","She didn’t want to imagine what her body would look like if all the wounds left scars.","Feng Wu drew in her breath. When Jun Linyuan heard it, he said, “Don’t worry. You won’t get scars.”","Feng Wu threw a dirty look at Jun Linyuan. “They all look so painful. How could you fight the ninja and still find an opportunity to inject him with the seed of the Magic Soul Vine?”","Feng Wu knew that she wouldn’t be able to do it.","It wasn’t that she had a weaker mind.","She was very confident in how tough her mind was.","However, she would pass out from all the pain.","But Jun Linyuan didn’t.","When she saw him, he had been leaning on a slope, and looked like nothing had happened.","Despite all the wounds, he was able to smile.","“Does it hurt?” he said indifferently. “I don’t think so.”","Feng Wu said, “How could you not feel any pain?!”","Feng Wu had been a secret again in her previous life and had been trained to withstand pain, but she knew that she wouldn’t be able to do better than Jun Linyuan.","The crown prince mumbled, “I’ve had pain ten times worse. This is nothing.”","“What?”","Feng Wu didn’t hear it clearly.","The crown prince wasn’t the type to complain to other people. He would never show his weakness.","Therefore, he snorted, “Are you going to treat me or not?”","Feng Wu said, “Of course I will! This is my own body!”","Feng Wu had to admit that she was more impressed by Jun Linyuan now.","He was such a tough guy.","Suddenly, the crown prince asked in an indifferent tone, “How do you know about the revival list of the Dongsang Kingdom?”","Feng Wu asked, “What?”","Jun Linyuan said, “How do you know that there are seven teams?","“And how do you know that three of them are still out there?”","Even though Jun Linyuan’s eyes were covered, Feng Wu could still feel his intense gaze!"]},{"number":2126,"title":"Chapter 2126 - Untitled","paragraphs":["“How do you know about the revival list of the Dongsang Kingdom?","“How do you know that there are seven teams?","“How do you know that the Saturn Team still has three surviving members?”","Jun Linyuan stared at Feng Wu, looking rather intimidating.","Feng Wu said, “Ah...”","She wanted to slap herself.","How could she make such a stupid mistake when Jun Linyuan was around? She should have remembered how smart the crown prince was...","If she told him the truth, she would have to tell him about the fairy and the 12 Trials of Love, which in turn would lead to her beautiful master...","That was a consequence she couldn’t bear.","Therefore, her only option now was...","“Do you really want to know?” She smiled at Jun Linyuan.","The crown prince glanced at her and snorted, hinting at her to go on.","Feng Wu moved closer and grinned. “No, I’m not telling you.”","He grabbed her hand when she turned to leave.","Jun Linyuan’s stare was very intense.","Feng Wu said, “Your grip doesn’t hurt at all.”","She looked down at her wrist.","Before, when Jun Linyuan was angry, his grip would be frighteningly painful even if he didn’t deliberately use any force.","But now...","Feng Wu chuckled. “I’m living in your body now, while you’re in mine.","“Your body is so strong that your grip can never hurt me.","“On the other hand, my body has been injured again. There’s nothing you can do to me!”","Jun Linyuan looked at Feng Wu in resignation.","Feng Wu gloated. “Do you want to hit me now? Too bad. You can’t!”","Jun Linyuan said, “You’re so happy, aren’t you?”","Feng Wu snorted. “Of course. I’m Jun Linyuan now.”","The crown prince said, “Do you really think there’s nothing I can do?”","Feng Wu smiled and said, “How do you think people will react if I go out as you and start cooking...”","She then turned to leave.","“Stop!”","Jun Linyuan glared at her.","He firmly believed that gentlemen should stay away from the kitchen. If people saw “him” cooking, Feng Xun would be the first to laugh at him.","He would be so humiliated!","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up!","And she was very pleased.","So, that was what Jun Linyuan was afraid of.","Before, Jun Linyuan was used to picking on her, but now, she finally could get back at him!","At that thought, Feng Wu didn’t find swapping bodies such a bad idea.","She said in a solemn tone, “Look at your wounds. I have to do something, or you’ll starve. Just wait here. I’ll be right...”","“Stop!” Jun Linyuan glared at Feng Wu.","Why was she so happy about the body swap now?","Feng Wu looked back at him. “Everyone has their secrets, and you’re no exception, right?”","By that, she meant that Jun Linyuan should stop trying to poke into her secrets.","Jun Linyuan glanced at her and said, “Fine.”","Feng Wu said, “What?”","Jun Linyuan said grumpily, “I’ll let you keep that secret for now.”"]},{"number":2127,"title":"Chapter 2127 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Feng Wu was elated and was happy to dodge the question.","“But —”","Jun Linyuan gave her a look and said, “You’ll be in charge.”","Feng Wu asked, “What do you mean?”","She had a feeling that something good was going to happen.","Jun Linyuan snorted and said, “The old man is concerned, and he doesn’t have that many capable men around him. In the end, it’ll become your assignment. I need to cultivate and won’t have time for this. You’ll be in charge.”","Feng Wu said, “Are you saying that... All the people on the revival list...”","“Kill them all!” The crown prince’s eyes shone.","Feng Wu was over the moon.","The thing Jun Linyuan wanted her to do was essentially the same as the tenth trial!","Feng Wu had been worrying about how she was going to catch all the lurking ninjas on her own.","However, Jun Linyuan had just given her the perfect opportunity! She was going to be in charge!","“But there are at least 70 people on that list,” said Feng Wu. “Six of them are dead, and we’ve caught one, but there are still 63 left. If they’re all working solo, it’ll be impossible to catch them all.”","Jun Linyuan glanced at her and said, “They all have to report to their superiors.”","Feng Wu said, “Are you saying that... That’s right. All seven teams must have a general leader. If we catch him, we’ll learn where the six teams are.”","Jun Linyuan gave Feng Wu an appreciative look.","Feng Wu rubbed her chin and murmured, “The most important thing now is to catch that leader, but who and where is he?”","She had no idea at all.","If they couldn’t catch the leader, they would have to catch the members one by one.","But there were over 60 of them, and they were likely scattered all over the empire. It would be like finding a needle in a haystack.","Feng Wu told Feng, “Bring me that ninja.”","She was going to interrogate him more carefully.","Feng nodded and left.","He returned in a short while with some bad news. “His Majesty is interrogating the prisoner himself.”","Feng Wu frowned. “Bring him here once His Majesty is done, then.”","Because of what Jun Linyuan said, Gongshu Ji didn’t take the ninja away, but that didn’t mean that Emperor Wu couldn’t interrogate him.","Feng Wu rubbed her nose. It seemed that Emperor Wu was paying a lot of attention to this as well.","While they were waiting, Jun Linyuan gave Feng Wu a thick book.","Feng Wu took it with both hands.","Jun Linyuan sat cross-legged without speaking.","But when Feng Wu saw the title of the book, she glanced at Jun Linyuan and smiled.","It was a book on the Dongsang Kingdom.","To be honest, Feng Wu didn’t know much about the kingdom.","Because the Junwu Empire suffered great losses in the war 13 years ago, almost everything about the culture of the Dongsang Kingdom was eliminated from the books.","Feng Wu hadn’t been able to find any books.","And she didn’t know much about ninjas either.","This book was very helpful.","Jun Linyuan..."]},{"number":2128,"title":"Chapter 2128 - What to Do","paragraphs":["After reading the book, Feng Wu had a better understanding of the Dongsang Kingdom.","Emperor Wu had cut all ties with Dongsang for the past decade. As a result, most commoners didn’t know much about that kingdom.","The Dongsang Kingdom was to the northeast of the Junwu Empire. Between them was the vast Peace Grassland.","The Dongsang Kingdom was less than one-tenth the size of the Junwu Empire. It was surrounded by the ocean on three sides apart from the grassland.","The kingdom had too little land for too many people, and its economy was quite advanced.","Its population consisted of a single ethnicity. Because of that, they were a very united people.","They had a great military force, and they were brave and good at fighting.","They were quick learners.","They valued martial prowess above all else and weren’t afraid of death.","When they set their sights on a target, they would do everything they could to fulfill it, even at the cost of their own lives. It was also the reason why the Junwu Empire lost so miserably 13 years ago.","Had it not been for Master Linghu, the entire Junwu Empire would have been turned into a wasteland.","Feng Wu closed her eyes when she finished the book.","She could still see every word in her mind.","When she opened her eyes again, she had fully remembered the behavioral patterns of the Dongsang people.","Just then, she heard a voice outside. “Your Royal Highness.”","“Yes?” Feng Wu raised her eyebrows. “Feng, come in.”","If Feng was here to alert her to something, it had to be serious.","Feng came in and looked from Feng Wu to Jun Linyuan. He then said, “His Majesty went to interrogate the ninja.”","Feng Wu nodded. “You’ve told me that already.”","“The prisoner is... dead.” Feng smiled wryly.","“What?” Feng Wu frowned. “How did that happen?”","Feng went on smiling wryly. “His Majesty is coming this way. Your Royal Highness can ask His Majesty yourself.”","Then, footsteps came from outside.","Emperor Wu had indeed arrived.","The door was slammed open.","The emperor walked in.","Feng Wu frowned.","Thump!","The dead body was tossed onto the ground.","Feng Wu checked the log in her head, and it said that the Saturn Team task was 70% completed.","That was to say, the prisoner was really dead.","Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan looked at each other, and both seemed displeased.","Feng Wu stared at Emperor Wu.","Jun Linyuan almost got himself killed in the process of catching this man, but the emperor killed him!","Emperor Wu had been quite intimidating at first, but the look in Feng Wu’s eyes made him uneasy.","He cleared his throat. “He’s dead already. Are you going to blame me now?”","Feng Wu stared at Emperor Wu. “I caught this prisoner.”","Emperor Wu waved him off. “That was why I interrogated him myself. You hurt him too badly. I only used a little force, but his bones broke and he dropped dead. Why did you have to injure him so badly?”","Feng Wu looked at him in resignation.","“Your Majesty, are you saying that you don’t need to take any responsibility at all?","“And I’m the one to blame?”","Emperor Wu said, “Why do you care about the result so much? He’s dead now. What do you think we should do?”","Why do you care about the result so much? ?Feng Wu couldn’t believe that question. Was the emperor joking?","“I didn’t kill him. How should I know what to do?” Feng Wu smirked."]},{"number":2129,"title":"Chapter 2129 - Inheritance Jade Ring","paragraphs":["Emperor Wu said, “If you hadn’t injured him so badly, he wouldn’t have died. So in the end, you’re the one who killed him. You need to take responsibility!”","Feng Wu didn’t say anything.","Why was the emperor so unreasonable? She hadn’t even blamed him for killing the prisoner yet!","After all, Feng Wu wasn’t Jun Linyuan.","Jun Linyuan would have stormed off by now, but Feng Wu only looked at Emperor Wu in resignation and asked, “What do you want?”","What?","Emperor Wu looked at the “crown prince” in amazement.","He was sure that his son would tell him off, which was why he had blamed “Jun Linyuan” first. Since when was the boy so mild?","“Take care of it!” Emperor Wu smirked. “How dare they try to assassinate me?! Find me the leader in ten days. Otherwise, I’ll hold you responsible!”","After that, Emperor Wu turned to leave.","Ten days? He had to be joking!","Feng Wu immediately said, “No.”","But Emperor Wu wouldn’t take no for an answer. He headed for the door without looking at Feng Wu.","“Father.”","Just then, the second prince arrived.","Emperor Wu could have left the room, but the second prince blocked his way.","The prince then knelt down on one knee and said, “Father, please give me a chance!”","Emperor Wu was so frustrated.","Why would this silly boy block his way now? It was the worst timing!","The second prince had no idea what his father was thinking. He said loudly, “Father, please let me find out who’s behind the assassination!”","Why would someone want that task? Feng Wu couldn’t help but look at the second prince.","Emperor Wu also looked at him in resignation.","How stupid could he get? He had given the task to Jun Linyuan, so of course, it would be a very difficult one.","Undercover agents were the most difficult to find.","Therefore, he stared at the second prince and asked, “What did you say?”","The second prince said solemnly, “Father, please give the task to me! I’ll do my best and uncover the truth! I’ll find the culprit in ten days!”","Feng Wu gave the second prince a strange look.","If she couldn’t be that sure, how could he? Didn’t he know how difficult the task was?","“He can have it.” Feng Wu smiled.","“No!” Emperor Wu glared at Feng Wu.","Although the “defiant son” often upset him, he had to admit that Jun Linyuan was very capable.","The second prince might be an obedient son, but he was nothing compared with Jun Linyuan.","“Father—” The second prince gave Emperor Wu a pleading look.","Growing impatient, Emperor Wu waved his hand. “The two of you will work on it. You’ll have time until we reach the imperial capital. The first one to solve the case will win, and the winner...”","He played with the jade ring on his thumb and smiled. “I’ll give him the Inheritance Jade Ring!”","The second prince was surprised.","It wasn’t just any ring. Without it, even if a prince could take the throne, he wouldn’t be considered the right and proper heir."]},{"number":2130,"title":"Chapter 2130 - Untitled","paragraphs":["The Inheritance Jade Ring?","The second prince’s stomach lurched.","If he could have it, the chance of him inheriting the throne would be...","At that thought, the second prince immediately bowed and said, “Yes, father.”","Emperor Wu glanced at “Jun Linyuan.” “Although you’re the crown prince, don’t think that you’re bound to become the next emperor!”","Jun Linyuan didn’t say anything.","But Feng Wu frowned.","Jun Linyuan was quite willful, but that didn’t mean that Emperor Wu couldn’t do anything about it.","Emperor Wu had been indulging Jun Linyuan because he felt sorry for Jun Linyuan’s late mother and for not being around when Jun Linyuan was little.","Had it not been for that, no matter how talented Jun Linyuan was, Emperor Wu would never allow Jun Linyuan to challenge his authority.","Jun Linyuan wouldn’t be able to behave in such a reckless way.","“The throne is mine right now. It’ll be yours only if I give it to you. Don’t blame me if I give it to someone else.” Emperor Wu gave “Jun Linyuan” one last look before he turned around and left.","Seeing this, the second prince couldn’t hide his excitement.","After Emperor Wu left, he stared at “Jun Linyuan” and smiled. “My dear brother, the throne will only be yours if our father gives it to you.”","He left after that.","Once they were gone, Feng Wu asked unhappily, “What did Emperor Wu mean? Was he not going to let you inherit the throne?”","This whole time, Jun Linyuan had been sitting cross-legged on the ground and repairing Feng Wu’s body.","“The damage is too severe.” Jun Linyuan didn’t answer her question.","Feng Wu sat down in front of him and looked distressed. “Forget about cultivating already! You may not be the crown prince anymore!”","Other people would have been so worried.","But Jun Linyuan...","He didn’t even open his eyes.","Not only that, he was also breathing normally, and only nodded indifferently.","Feng Wu was anxious. “Didn’t you hear that? Your father is encouraging your brother to compete with you!”","Although the second prince had asked to be part of the investigation, if Emperor Wu hadn’t given his tacit agreement, the second prince wouldn’t have shown up at that moment!","“Him?” Jun Linyuan only smiled indifferently.","Feng Wu clenched her fists and said, “I know you don’t like the second prince and feel that he’s not good enough to be your rival, but Jun Linyuan, you’re too proud!”","Jun Linyuan went on cultivating as if he didn’t hear her.","Feng Wu said grumpily, “If you’re Emperor Wu’s only child, no matter how willful you are, you’ll still be his only choice.","“But that’s not the case. You still have other brothers!” Feng Wu stared at him. “Yes, they’re not as talented or smart as you are, but they’ll follow your father’s orders.","“If you’re an emperor, which son will you choose? An obedient but mediocre one, or a talented but arrogant one?”","“The latter,” Jun Linyuan said without hesitation.","That almost rendered Feng Wu speechless. She took a deep breath and said, “That’s because you’re a wise ruler. What about your father? He’s not as subjective as you are. He likes whoever makes him happy.”"]},{"number":2131,"title":"Chapter 2131 - Untitled","paragraphs":["“Did you just call him an unwise ruler?” Jun Linyuan glanced at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu said, “Well... I didn’t say that.”","Jun Linyuan said, “You’re right. He’s not wise at all.”","Feng Wu said, “Well...”","Jun Linyuan said, “The thing that you’re worried about, it won’t happen.”","Feng Wu asked, “What thing?”","Jun Linyuan said, “About losing the right to the throne.”","Feng Wu said, “Jun Linyuan, aren’t you too confident in yourself?”","Jun Linyuan smiled. “I’m not confident in myself. It’s Master Linghu whom I have faith in.”","“Master Linghu? As in the monk of Wandering Temple in the mountain behind Imperial College?” Feng Wu looked at Jun Linyuan suspiciously.","Jun Linyuan nodded. “Yes. Do you know why I became the crown prince?”","Feng Wu asked, “Weren’t you born to be the crown prince?”","Jun Linyuan looked at her in resignation.","Feng Wu asked, “Was it because of Master Linghu?”","Jun Linyuan nodded. “Master Linghu forced the general of the Dongsang Kingdom to commit suicide. When he chased the army out of our empire, he told my father something.","“He said that he had repaid the favor to the Junwu Empire and owed us nothing after that. If the empire and the Dongsang Kingdom went to war again, only Jun Linyuan would be able to bring back peace.”","Jun Linyuan then glanced at Feng Wu. “I became the crown prince on that day.”","Feng Wu said, “So, Master Linghu is your patron. That explains it.”","The crown prince nodded. “Master Linghu has taught me a few things. He’s like half a master to me.”","Feng Wu was curious. “Master Linghu doesn’t seem to like anyone except you. Even Feng Xun isn’t allowed to enter his place.”","Jun Linyuan nodded. “I’ve been there a couple of times in the past decade, but Feng Xun could only wait in the gatehouse.”","Feng Wu asked, “Has Master Linghu never agreed to see him?”","Jun Linyuan nodded.","Feng Wu scratched her head and wondered why Master Linghu had agreed to see her last time. Moreover, he had been very nice to her.","The crown prince then added, “Master Linghu never meets people he doesn’t know.”","Feng Wu asked, “Is that true? Does he never meet strangers?”","The crown prince nodded. “Even my grandmother can’t see him just because she wants to. She’ll be lucky if she can meet him once every three or five years.”","Feng Wu asked curiously, “Why does the empress dowager want to meet Master Linghu?”","Jun Linyuan looked at Feng Wu in confusion.","That look made Feng Wu even more confused. “Did I ask the wrong question?”","Jun Linyuan asked, “Do you not know?”","Feng Wu asked, “Know what?”","Jun Linyuan asked, “Don’t you know that Master Linghu has a blessing power?”","Feng Wu asked, “What’s that?”","Jun Linyuan was perplexed, but he still answered, “He can give all sorts of blessings, from longevity and health to virility and romance.”","“Wait!” Feng Wu suddenly had a bad feeling. She cut Jun Linyuan off and asked, “What did you say? What do you mean by romance?”","The crown prince said, “I’ve never asked for one. How should I know?”","Feng Wu said, “By the sound of it, does it have something to do with one’s romantic relationship?”","The crown prince said, “Something like that.”","Feng Wu was astonished!","Romance... She clenched her fists.","Was it possible that she hadn’t picked the 12 Trials of Love by accident? Had Master Linghu tricked her into picking it?","The more she thought about it, the more frustrated she became. She almost wanted to go to Master Linghu now and get an answer from him."]},{"number":2132,"title":"Chapter 2132 - Untitled","paragraphs":["“Why are you upset?” Jun Linyuan gave Feng Wu a suspicious look.","“I... I’m not telling you!” Feng Wu snorted.","Jun Linyuan didn’t press her.","Feng Wu asked, “What should I do now?”","The crown prince asked, “What do you mean?”","Feng Wu said, “About the case. What do you think we should do about the undercover agents of the Dongsang Kingdom?”","Jun Linyuan said, “If you don’t want to do anything, just forget about it.”","Feng Wu said, “Of course I can’t do that!”","That was her tenth trial. If she couldn’t finish it, what about her beautiful master? She needed to finish the 12 Trials of Love to obtain the broken star piece!","Jun Linyuan gave Feng Wu a perplexed look. “Do you want to find out who they are?”","Feng Wu didn’t say anything.","Jun Linyuan said, “Why bother? It’s none of your business.”","Feng Wu didn’t say anything.","He was right. It really wasn’t her business.","“But it’s yours. If the second prince uncovers the truth first, he’ll have the ring and become a more powerful rival. I don’t think you want that to happen.”","Jun Linyuan glanced at Feng Wu and said casually, “It’s none of my business.”","Feng Wu said, “But I’m you now, and God knows when our bodies will swap back. It’ll be me who will be humiliated!”","Jun Linyuan said, “If you want to investigate, go ahead.”","Feng Wu said, “But I don’t know where to begin. The only lead we had was killed by your father. What should I do now?”","Jun Linyuan looked at her. “Do you not have a clue at all?”","Feng Wu said, “No!”","Jun Linyuan glanced at her before he went back to repairing her body.","Having worked on her body for half the night, he had repaired 25% of it. It wouldn’t take him much longer to fix everything.","Seeing how calm Jun Linyuan was, Feng Wu knew that he must have a lead.","But what was it?","Rubbing her chin, Feng Wu recalled the details of Feng Xun’s interrogation, but she couldn’t find anything useful.","There was no way that Jun Linyuan could see it when she couldn’t.","Leaning against the wall, Feng Wu closed her eyes and searched her memory.","What was the lead?","Her gaze then landed on the book.","Could it be in the book?","Feng Wu flipped through the book from the first page to the last, then in reverse.","But there was nothing.","She then picked up the interrogation record which Feng Xun had left behind and checked it carefully.","She suddenly asked Feng, “Did you hear from His Majesty?”","Feng said, “They’ve searched the camp. No one is missing.”","That was what Feng Wu had expected.","All those seven ninjas were assassins that hadn’t been hiding among the soldiers. Otherwise, someone would have noticed that seven men were missing.","Feng Wu checked the log in her mind.","It said that 70% of the Saturn Team was gone, but why was there a thick red bar behind it? What did that mean?","Was that some kind of red alert?","Was that a warning that the remaining three were different from the seven dead ones? Were they more dangerous?","“If the surviving members are on the same team as the seven, why didn’t they take action together?”"]},{"number":2133,"title":"Chapter 2133 - Untitled","paragraphs":["“If ten people take action together, they’ll have a much bigger chance of succeeding. Why didn’t they do that?","“The signal which the Saturn Team leader sent was obviously for the other three.","“But the three people aren’t together. Where can they be hiding?”","Feng Xun entered the room and was dumbfounded to see Feng Wu.","Feng Wu was lost in her own world. She murmured, “No one went in or out of these mountains. Therefore, the only possible place... is...","“This courier station!”","Feng Wu stared at Feng Xun and said coldly, “The other three men are all here in the courier station!”","Feng Xun asked, “Are you sure?”","Feng Wu said, “If we eliminate the impossible, then no matter how incredible the remaining option looks, it has to be the right answer. Yes, they’re hiding in this place!”","Feng Xun frowned. “That’s tricky. His Majesty has a large entourage. Although some families have gone back in advance, most of them are still here. How are we going to screen them all?”","Feng Wu said, “We can rule out the common soldiers. Those men are part of the revival plan, and after 13 years, they can’t remain at such a low level.”","Feng Xun nodded.","Feng Wu said, “They’ll try to gain power. Focus on the key divisions that are related to intelligence.”","Feng Xun nodded again.","Feng Wu went on, “They will be very careful as well, and they may look a little sneaky. Keep that in mind!","“Since they’ve settled down, they would want to climb higher and gather more information. Pay attention to the wives. Don’t limit yourself to the daughters of famous families. See whose father-in-law or brother-in-law has real power!”","Feng Xun nodded.","He was amazed by how perceptive “Boss Jun” was.","Feng Wu nodded and said, “People of the Dongsang Kingdom are known for their small stature, and they have unique personalities and cultivation skills as well. They won’t be using special skills, because it’ll draw too much attention to them. The ninjas are expert assassins. They aren’t very strong, but they’re very fast.”","Feng Xun said happily, “Boss Jun, don’t worry. With so many hints, we’ll soon uncover them.”","Feng Xun looked at “Feng Wu,” who was sitting in the corner and repairing her body. He clenched his fists and said, “They injured Xiao Wu! I’ll find them all!”","He then turned to leave.","Feng Wu said, “Don’t alert them!”","Feng Xun waved at her without looking back.","He thought he was smart enough for such an easy task.","But soon, he was frustrated.","Because...","“Boss Jun...” Feng Xun came back with a long face. “Things have gotten a bit tricky.”","Feng Wu was perplexed. “What? Couldn’t you find them?”","Feng Xun said, “I found them, but too many people fit the description... There are 15 of them. Can we have that many undercover agents in our team?”","Feng Wu asked, “Are all of them members of the guard?”"]},{"number":2134,"title":"Chapter 2134 - Untitled","paragraphs":["“Are all of them members of the guards?” Feng Wu asked.","Feng Xun said, “Yes. I found all 15 of them among the guards. What should we do now?”","Feng Wu gave it some thought and raised her eyebrows. “There’s a way.”","Feng Xun’s eyes lit up.","He knew that he could always count on “Boss Jun”!","So he asked, “What should we do?”","Feng Wu said, “Since they’re all part of the revival plan, they have to be from the Dongsang Kingdom, right?”","Feng Xun said, “Of course.”","Feng Wu asked, “What are they known for?”","Feng Xun asked, “Their pettiness?”","Feng Wu said in resignation, “Their patriotism.”","Feng Xun thought about it and realized that she was right.","“The Dongsang Kingdom is a small place. They comprise a single ethnic group. They love their kingdom to a fault and won’t allow anyone to say bad things about it.”","Feng Xun smacked his forehead, and his eyes sparkled. “I see! I see! You’re saying that we should insult the Dongsang Kingdom in front of these 15 people and watch their reactions, right?”","Feng Wu glanced at him.","That look gave Feng Xun the creeps.","He suddenly felt silly.","“Am I not right?” He didn’t sound as confident this time.","Feng Wu shook her head in resignation. “You can write some insulting words about the Dongsang Kingdom and have them take turns reading it out loud. Observe their reactions.”","Feng Xun smacked his thigh. “That’s right! They’ll have to say those words on their own! Haha! Their cover will be blown!”","Feng Wu glanced at him and went on, “They can fake their facial expressions, but they can’t fake their heartbeats.","“Therefore, monitor their heartbeats. If it speeds up, you’ve found your man.”","“That’s right! Why didn’t I think of that? Boss Jun, you’re so smart! This is a brilliant idea! I’ll go uncover the spies!” said Feng Xun.","He quickly went to interrogate the suspects.","Feng Wu shook her head. She hadn’t finished speaking yet. Feng Xun might not succeed in one go.","Jun Linyuan had been sitting in the corner and repairing Feng Wu’s body.","He was also refining the Seed of the Spirit Source for her.","The seed was like an onion that contained ten layers.","One would rise to the next cultivation level when they refined each layer of the seed.","However...","Every time Jun Linyuan was about to rise to the next level, he would suppress it. Instead of making a breakthrough, he went on enhancing the body.","Even Feng Wu didn’t notice what he was doing.","15 minutes later.","Feng Xun rushed back holding a man.","The man was a lord and an advanced cultivator. Now, however, he was covered with wounds, especially his head, which was a bloody mess. He was already unconscious.","Thump!","Feng Xun tossed the man to the ground.","“He’s a spy of the Dongsang Kingdom!” Feng Xun gloated. “Boss Jun, you’re amazing.”","Feng Wu gave him a suspicious look.","Feng Xun said, “I didn’t believe you at first and thought that my way would work as well, so I insulted the Dongsang Kingdom in front of them.”"]},{"number":2135,"title":"Chapter 2135 - Hes Dead!","paragraphs":["Feng Xun pointed at the lord on the floor and smirked. “Lord Wu here is playing dead. He did a pretty good job back there. He didn’t let his face betray him, and it almost fooled me.","“I looked at all 15 of them, but no one seemed affected. How was that possible?","“Therefore, I had to use your way, but I didn’t write it down for them. I just told them to improvise and curse the Dongsang Kingdom however they wanted.","“The Dongsang Kingdom is our archenemy. They’ve killed so many of our people, and no one can forgive them for that. Therefore, it’s only natural that we should hate them!","“Once one starts cursing them, they can go on and on,” said Feng Xun. “That was what everyone did, but Lord Wu here tried to bluff his way through it. It was so obvious!”","Feng Wu nodded. “Yes.”","Feng Xun said, “So, I picked him out and told him to curse the Dongsang Kingdom. Not only wouldn’t he do it, he also tried to change the subject. In the end, he was forced to start cursing, but I recognized the look in his eyes too well. They were filled with hatred, and I heard his heartbeat. It was very fast. So —","“He has to be a spy of the Dongsang Kingdom,” Feng Xun said affirmatively.","But Feng Wu frowned a little.","Feng Xun was perplexed. “Boss Jun, don’t you believe me?”","Feng Wu looked at him in resignation.","The look made Feng Xun uneasy. “What’s wrong?”","Just then, footsteps came from outside.","They were quite loud.","It was none other than the second prince.","“Why are you here?” Feng Xun wasn’t happy to see the second prince here.","The prince had been asking questions nonstop when he brought the spy here, which was very annoying.","Putting his hands behind his back, the second prince smiled. “I heard that you caught a spy, so I thought I should pop in. Brother, you don’t mind, do you?”","Jun Linyuan usually just ignored the second prince.","But Feng Wu glanced at the second prince and casually said, “Actually, I do.”","What?","That greatly embarrassed the second prince.","Feng Xun threw a dirty look at the second prince and said, “Hear that? His Royal Highness doesn’t like it. Are you still going to stay here?”","That wasn’t very polite.","And the second prince felt even more embarrassed.","Master Dugu had arrived with him, and stepped forward to mediate.","He smiled and said, “We were taking a walk after lunch and just happened to pass by. We heard that Miss Feng Wu was sick, so we thought we should visit her.”","After saying that, he felt that “Jun Linyuan” couldn’t tell them to leave anymore.","Feng Wu ignored him and only asked Feng Xun, “Why did you bring the dead man here? Are you trying to ruin my floor with blood?”","“Dead?” Feng Xun stared at Feng Wu in disbelief.","Feng Wu glanced at the man on the floor and said, “See for yourself.”","Feng Xun grew anxious. Yes, he had beaten up the man, but why was he dead?","At that thought, he checked his pulse.","And it was a good thing he did!","There was no pulse."]},{"number":2136,"title":"Chapter 2136 - Untitled","paragraphs":["“What...” Feng Xun’s eyes widened. “How can this have happened? I didn’t even use that much force!”","He knew the man was a spy, so he had kept him alive and brought him here. But why...","“Did you kill Lord Wu?”","The second prince stared at Feng Xun in disbelief. “You killed Lord Wu for no reason!”","Feng Xun glared at him. “He’s a spy from the Dongsang Kingdom!”","The second prince smirked. “Do you have any proof of that?”","Feng Xun said, “I...”","In fact, he hadn’t found any yet.","He had spotted the man by using Feng Wu’s method.","However, it would only work when Lord Wu was alive. Now that he was dead, Feng Xun couldn’t prove that his heartbeat had been abnormal.","On guard, Feng Wu narrowed her eyes.","So, this was what the second prince was waiting for.","Feng Wu checked the task log,","The 70% for the Saturn Team had become 80%. That was to say, the dead man was indeed a spy of the Dongsang Kingdom.","The question rendered Feng Xun speechless.","“He was a spy, no matter what you say!” Feng Xun said angrily.","The second prince smirked and asked Master Dugu, “What’s the punishment for killing a military officer?”","“It’s punishable by death,” Master Dugu said indifferently.","Feng Xun was so frustrated. He couldn’t understand what was happening.","Feng Wu said indifferently, “My brother wants to compete with me because the first one to catch the spy will obtain my father’s Inheritance Jade Ring.”","Feng Xun realized what this was about!","He stared at the second prince and said, “That was why you kept following me! This is what you want! Lord Wu’s death was your doing!”","The second prince smirked. “Young Lord Feng, that’s a reckless thing to say.”","Feng Xun said, “Lord Wu was alive until you came around and walked up next to him! How bold! You killed a man in broad daylight!”","The second prince ignored Feng Xun’s accusation and only asked Master Dugu, “What’s the punishment for slandering a prince?”","Master Dugu’s reply remained unchanged. “It’s punishable by death!”","The second prince glanced at Feng Xun and said, “I don’t need him to die, but he’ll probably lose his job.”","What a threat!","It was obviously a threat.","The second prince made it clear that if Feng Xun didn’t resign from his post as the leader of the execution team, he would tell the public that Feng Xun had killed Lord Wu.","Frustrated, Feng Xun shouted at the second prince, “Damn you!”","But he didn’t have any proof...","Feng Wu looked at Feng Xun in resignation. “You idiot.”","Feng Xun said, “Huh?”","Feng Wu beckoned him over and whispered something in his ear.","Feng Xun’s eyes immediately lit up.","“That’s right! Why didn’t I think of that?” He smacked his own head.","When he turned to leave, Feng Wu shook her head and said, “Let Xuan Yi do it.”","“Sure.” The next second, Feng Xun dashed off.","The second prince was dumbfounded.","What had “Jun Linyuan” said to Feng Xun? He suddenly had a bad feeling."]},{"number":2137,"title":"Chapter 2137 - Untitled","paragraphs":["“Your Royal Highness, are you covering for Young Lord Feng, the murderer?” The second prince narrowed his eyes.","Feng Wu gave the second prince a half-smile.","Her eyes were cold and piercing, and the look she gave him reminded him of a sharp blade.","It made the second prince uneasy.","By then, Feng Xun had come back. He stood behind Feng Wu with his chin raised. He gave the second prince a contemptuous glance.","With “Boss Jun” behind him, there was nothing the second prince could do!","The second prince smirked. “If you don’t have any proof, Young Lord Feng, you’ll have to come with me!”","Feng Xun looked at “Boss Jun.”","Feng Wu narrowed her eyes. “No proof? Says who?”","“Really? Then, my dear brother, where is your proof?” The second prince gloated.","He had indeed been the culprit behind Lord Wu’s death, but the wound was so small that no one would ever spot it. He was sure that his “brother” was only bluffing.","Feng Wu ignored the second prince and only told Feng Xun, “Bring the other 14 men here.”","Although Feng Xun was perplexed, he still did as he was told.","The second prince stared at Feng Wu and wondered how “Jun Linyuan” would prove it.","The 14 men were soon brought in.","Feng Wu looked from one face to the next, and her piercing eyes gave them the creeps.","She tried to figure out what to do next as she studied the 14 men.","There were two more spies among them, but since the previous method didn’t work, the only possibility was —","The remaining two spies were men of the Junwu Empire who had defected to the other side.","That thought made Feng Wu’s face darken.","She flipped through the files in her hands.","The 14 files were from Feng Xun, and they included everything about these men, from their family backgrounds to their connections.","Nice job, Feng Xun.","Feng Xun looked at Feng Wu in confusion.","The second prince was equally perplexed.","Even Jun Linyuan, who was sitting in the corner, couldn’t help but glance at Feng Wu, but he soon closed his eyes and went back to his cultivation.","He didn’t know if Feng Wu could really find the spies. If she could, he would acknowledge her intelligence.","If not, that would mean that she wasn’t as smart as she looked.","The first of the 14 men was Xi Lie, the second son of the Minister of Public Works.","The second man was Mo Haolin, an officer who had started off as just a common soldier only.","The third was Zuo Ziyan, a distant relative of the Zuo family","The fourth was...","Suddenly, Feng Wu’s gaze landed on Zuo Ziyan.","A member of the Zuo family. How interesting.","She glanced at Zuo Ziyan and saw the jade pendant at his waist. Her eyes glinted, but she didn’t say anything. She walked past Zuo Ziyan and stopped in front of Mo Haolin.","“I smell Cherry Flower on him,” said the fairy.","Feng Wu raised her eyebrows. “I didn’t know you could smell that.”","The fairy said, “I’m a Peach Blossom Fairy, and I can detect the energy of a Cherry Flower Fairy! It’s very faint, but it can’t escape my nose!”"]},{"number":2138,"title":"Chapter 2138 - Untitled.","paragraphs":["The Cherry Flower was the national flower of the Dongsang Kingdom. So, Mo Haolin...","Feng Wu frowned. “Is it possible that someone smeared it on him on purpose?”","The fairy shook her head. “It’s been there for a very long time. That’s the only way that it’ll smell like that...”","Feng Wu frowned.","Her eyes met Mo Haolin’s.","The next second, Mo Haolin bolted.","He was unbelievably fast!","Before Feng Wu said anything, Feng Xun dashed off like a cheetah.","Thump!","He threw a punch at Mo Haolin and knocked him to the ground.","Mo Haolin didn’t dare linger. He climbed back up and continued running.","Feng Xun shouted, “I told you not to run! Stop!”","The second prince’s face darkened.","Even an idiot could tell that there was something wrong with Mo Haolin.","He was impressed. “Jun Linyuan” only glanced at those men, and “he” spotted the spy right away. The second prince himself had no clue at all.","He knew that he would be at a disadvantage if Mo Haolin was caught.","At that moment, Mo Haolin charged at him.","Feng Xun shouted, “Stop him!”","However, the second prince and Master Dugu exchanged a look, and both men stepped aside. Master Dugu shouted, “Guard the prince!”","Whoosh!","All the guards of the second prince gathered around him, separating Feng Xun from Mo Haolin.","Feng Xun couldn’t believe it!","He had made a mistake already when he let Lord Wu die. If Mo Haolin got away, he wouldn’t know what to do!","Feng Xun threw a dirty look at the second prince and jumped over their heads.","However, when he looked again, Mo Haolin was nowhere to be found.","He looked around, but no one knew where Mo Haolin had gone.","Feng Xun turned around and glared at the second prince. “You did that on purpose!”","Master Dugu frowned. “Young Lord Feng, what do you mean? Are you saying that a common officer’s life is more important than the second prince’s?”","The second prince gloated. Yes, he had done it on purpose, but there was nothing Feng Xun could do.","Feng Xun shouted, “I’ll make you answer for it after I find Mo Haolin!”","The second prince smirked. “Young Lord Feng, are you trying to run away?”","His guards then surrounded Feng Xun.","Feng Xun glared at him.","“You’re still a suspect in Lord Wu’s death. Murder is punishable by death.” The second prince sounded very pleased.","Feng Xun was furious.","Just then, they heard a thump, and something dropped on the ground.","Everyone looked in that direction, and the second prince was dumbfounded. Feng Xun, on the other hand, laughed loudly.","It was Jun Linyun, the prince who had a crush on Feng Wu. He was also the son of Empress Dugu.","As for the thump... He had just tossed Mo Haolin onto the ground.","Jun Linyun then turned to Feng Xun. “You were shouting about stopping someone. Who? Let me help you.”","Feng Xun was rendered speechless.","The second prince was speechless.","Jun Linyun was perplexed. “Why are you looking at me like that?”"]},{"number":2139,"title":"Chapter 2139 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Feng Xun pointed at Mo Haolin.","Jun Linyun nodded. “Right, him. He was running wildly and bumped into me, which was unbelievable. So, I dragged him here for you guys to see. Who’s this man? He needs to be punished for what he did!”","Feng Xun was rendered speechless.","The second prince was speechless.","Mo Haolin suddenly tried to jump to his feet.","However, Feng Xun struck him down before he could get up.","Mo Haolin crumpled and almost passed out.","Feng Xun grabbed his chin and dislocated his jaw.","Jun Linyun watched in astonishment. “Brother Feng, you care about me so much...”","The second prince threw a dirty look at his younger brother.","If he could, he wanted to slap Jun Linyun.","Feng Xun stuck his hand into Mo Haolin’s mouth and took out a small white pill. “You’re not getting out of it that easily!”","Jun Linyun had to be a real idiot if he still didn’t realize what was going on.","“Brother Feng, he...”","Feng Xun rose to his feet. He kept his gaze on Mo Haolin while talking to Jun Linyun. “He’s the one I was trying to catch.”","“Holy crap!” Jun Linyun cried out. “I’m amazing!”","Feng Xun rolled his eyes at him and was amazed by his dumb luck.","He then turned all his attention to Mo Haolin.","“Who are you? Answer me!” Feng Xun started the interrogation.","Mo Haolin snorted and looked away.","Feng Xun smirked. “Fine. Keep your silence. I have a hundred ways to make you talk.”","After that, a dagger appeared in his hand.","Mo Haolin snorted.","He had never been afraid of death.","Feng Xun snorted. “Do you think I’m going to kill you? No. It won’t be that easy!”","After that, Feng Xun tied him up and started with his face.","By the time Mo Haolin realized it, a slice of flesh had been peeled off his face.","It was a very thin piece, but it was so painful that he almost passed out.","Mo Haolin’s forehead was covered with cold sweat, and he glared at Feng Xun.","Feng Xun only smiled at him. “I know you can take it. I’d like to see how long you can last.”","With that, he sliced another piece off his face.","“Ah —” Mo Haolin almost burst into tears.","Feng Xun said, “I’m just getting started. I have all the time in the world. It’s not like I’m in pain, right?”","After that, he sliced off another piece of flesh.","Mo Haolin was in tears now.","He had been trained to endure pain, but this pain seemed never-ending.","He would be able to stand it if he knew when it would stop, but Feng Xun had made it clear that if he kept his silence, this would go on and on.","Mo Haolin was about to break.","While everyone was watching Mo Haolin, Feng Wu was observing the other 13 men."]},{"number":2140,"title":"Chapter 2140 - Untitled","paragraphs":["This was why Feng Wu had let Feng Xun carry out the interrogation in public.","No one could stay calm when their companions were being tortured.","They would feel enraged, and they would feel fear. It was human nature.","Even if they could keep their faces straight, they wouldn’t be able to control their heartbeats.","With one glance, Feng Wu found what she was looking for.","The pain seemed to go on and on.","Mo Haolin began to break.","In the end —","“Stop...”","He panted and said, “I... I’ll confess...”","Someone in the crowd stiffened.","The second prince also stared at Mo Haolin.","Mo Haolin started talking.","He admitted that he was a spy that had been stealing information about the Junwu Empire.","“You’re all going to die! My kingdom has gathered a lot more information than you can imagine! The war will soon break out, and you’re all going to die!”","“How many of you are out there?” Feng Xun grabbed him by the neck.","“How many? Hahaha, you’ve killed off my team, but don’t worry. My friends from the other teams are still safe. You’ll never find them!”","He was already in a frantic state.","Feng Wu smiled. “Start with his wife.”","Mo Haolin stiffened and glared at Feng Wu. The next second, he charged at her like a bull.","However, his real target was the second prince.","He took out his weapon as he ran at the prince.","“How dare you?!”","The second prince pointed his sword at Mo Haolin.","Poof!","To his surprise, Mo Haolin ran right into the blade.","It seemed that he was trying to get himself killed!","The blade went right through him.","The second prince was astonished.","So was Master Dugu.","Jun Linyun was the first to react. He stared at the second prince and said, “Brother, that man is a spy. How could you kill him? Why did you do that?!”","The second prince was dumbfounded.","“No... I didn’t...” The second prince tried to explain, but he couldn’t find anything to say. “I... I thought he wanted to kill me! It was self-defense! Self-defense!”","Feng Xun was furious. “That was what he wanted, and you gave it to him! Are you their leader?!”","That was a serious crime!","Of course, the second prince wouldn’t admit it.","He pointed at Feng Xun in frustration. “You’re the spy! You killed Lord Wu!”","Feng Wu looked at the second prince silently, but there was no warmth in her eyes.","“No! It’s not me! Jun Linyuan, I’m warning you! You can’t incriminate me just because I’m your rival!","“I’m telling you, Feng Xun is still a suspect in Lord Wu’s murder!”","Feng Wu suddenly smiled. She moved closer and whispered something in his ear.","The second prince’s face paled."]},{"number":2141,"title":"Chapter 2141 - Untitled","paragraphs":["The second prince glared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu smiled at him while she tried to decide what to do with this man, who always tried to sabotage her plans.","She needed to be very subtle.","What would Jun Linyuan do?","Feng Xun looked curiously at Feng Wu.","He wondered what “Boss Jun” had said. Why was the second prince so frightened?","“Take him down and lock him up,” Jun Linyuan, who was still cultivating in the corner, said casually.","The second prince almost jumped to his feet.","He pointed at “Feng Wu” and shouted, “Who do you think you are?! Shut up!”","Feng Wu found his question idiotic.","The person in the corner was the real Jun Linyuan!","However, she was happy to hear that she could lock the second prince up. She immediately told Feng, “Do it.”","Infuriated, the second prince pointed at Feng Wu. “Jun Linyuan, how dare you?!”","Feng Wu crossed her hands behind her back and snorted.","She didn’t dare, but Jun Linyuan did.","Feng always followed Jun Linyuan’s orders because he only had this one master. No one else could order him around.","Hence...","“Yes.”","Feng walked up to the second prince and gave him a nod. “Your Royal Highness, please come with me.”","The second prince stomped his foot.","He shouted at Feng, “You have no right to do this!”","Feng gave him an indifferent look and repeated, “Your Royal Highness, please come with me.”","“What if I say no?” The second prince was furious.","Would a steward defy him?","Feng didn’t say another word. He put his right hand on the prince’s shoulder, and the next second, he picked up the second prince as if he were made of straw.","The second prince was astonished.","He was the son of Empress Dugu. How dare this servant do such a thing?","“How dare you humiliate me like this?! I’m going to kill you!” the second prince shouted.","But he failed to notice something.","He didn’t even know Feng’s name.","Master Dugu was shocked as well. Before he could scold Feng, Feng had walked away.","Fearing that Feng would harm the second prince, Master Dugu quickly followed him out.","Feng Xun gave Feng Wu a thumbs up. “Boss Jun, you’re amazing!”","Feng Wu rolled her eyes at him and looked at the person in the corner.","That person was the amazing one. She was just following orders.","“By the way...” Feng Xun moved closer and whispered, “Boss Jun, what did you tell the second prince? Why was he so scared? And about Lord Wu... Am I off the hook?”","Feng Wu glared at him. “How could you be so stupid? You had that man, but you still let the second prince kill him!”","Feng Xun said, “How was I supposed to know that a prince would do such a despicable thing?”","Just then, they heard hasty footsteps outside.","Thump!","Emperor Wu kicked the door open."]},{"number":2142,"title":"Chapter 2142 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Feng Wu frowned.","“Did you lock your brother up?” Emperor Wu shouted at her.","Empress Dugu was with him. It seemed that Emperor Wu had arrived so quickly because he had received the news from his wife.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","As the ruler of the empire, shouldn’t Emperor Wu have better judgement than this? Why couldn’t he keep out of it?","However, the emperor didn’t feel that there was anything wrong with what he was doing.","He pointed at Feng Wu and shouted, “Jun Linyuan, is it true that you locked up your brother?!”","Feng Wu stole a glance at Jun Linyuan.","After all, it was the royal family’s business, and she couldn’t make reckless decisions.","Jun Linyuan gave her a nod, which meant that she could do whatever she wanted.","Feng Wu’s eyes widened. Really? Could she really do whatever she wanted?","Jun Linyuan nodded a little before closing his eyes and going back to his cultivation.","He had reached the critical point and couldn’t afford to be disturbed.","Meanwhile, Emperor Wu was lashing out at Feng Wu.","“Jun Linyuan! Have you forgotten what I said? The first one to solve the case can have the ring. And what did you do? You locked up your brother! You!”","Emperor Wu looked like he was going to pass out with rage.","Seeing this, Empress Dugu rushed over and steadied Emperor Wu. She cried out, “Your Majesty, are you alright? Your Majesty!”","While supporting Emperor Wu, Empress Dugu turned to Feng Wu and said, “Your Royal Highness, you’ve upset your father! What if something happens to His Majesty?!”","Feng Wu thought about it and decided that the real Jun Linyuan would ignore the empress.","She needed to mimic Jun Linyuan now.","Therefore, she put her hands behind her back and looked very proud.","Emperor Wu pushed Empress Dugu away. He walked up to Jun Linyuan and shouted, “You defiant son!”","However, Feng Wu cut him off before he could go on.","“Father, my brother didn’t tell you why he was locked up, did he?”","Empress Dugu tried to intervene. “Your Royal Highness, you have no right to...”","Feng Wu waved her off. “If Empress Dugu knows why I locked up my brother, she probably wouldn’t have urged my father to create such a scene.”","Such a scene? Emperor Wu was furious.","It sounded as if he was making a fool of himself. He was the ruler of this empire!","If... If that person were here, would Jun Linyuan do this? That thought frustrated Emperor Wu even more.","Feng Wu shook her head and said, “Jun Linshen killed a man.”","Jun Linshen was the second prince’s name.","Emperor Wu smirked. “You sound as if you haven’t taken lives before.”","Feng Wu smiled. “He killed a spy to shut him up.”","The emperor stared at her. “What?!”","Empress Dugu glared at her. “That’s a lie!”","Feng Wu said, “Actually, he’s killed more than one spy.”","Jun Linshen was brought back, and with his parents’ support, he shouted, “I killed the spies? Says who?! Can you prove that Lord Wu was a spy?!”","Feng Wu smiled at him. “So... Are you admitting that Lord Wu worked for you?”"]},{"number":2143,"title":"Chapter 2143 - Untitled","paragraphs":["“I...” Only then did Jun Linshen realize that he had been tricked by “Jun Linyuan.” He shouted, “I... I...”","Seeing that Emperor Wu was watching him, Jun Linshen found courage again. “Why are you saying that I killed Lord Wu? You have no proof! This is pure speculation!”","Feng Wu put her hands behind her back and said proudly, “It’s natural that you should ask for proof. Since we have you as the witness, of course, we have material evidence as well.”","Jun Linshen wanted to retort but fought back his words.","He smirked at “Jun Linyuan” and wondered what proof “he” could provide.","“If you can’t prove that I killed him, then Feng Xun is the murderer! He has to pay with his own life!” Jun Linshen snorted.","Feng Xun also looked nervous. If “Boss Jun” couldn’t prove it, he would be killed...","“Take his clothes off.” Feng Wu stared at Jun Linshen, but she was talking about the dead body.","Jun Linshen’s pupils contracted.","But Feng Wu was still staring at him, so he couldn’t let her suspect anything.","By then, Master Chu, the royal physician, had arrived.","Feng Wu looked at Emperor Wu and asked, “I’ll have Master Chu examine the body. Will everyone trust his conclusion?”","Master Chu was the head of the royal physicians, and Emperor Wu trusted him a lot.","Emperor Wu would trust Master Chu’s conclusion.","“Yes,” Emperor Wu said coldly.","Feng Wu told Master Chu, “Examine Lord Wu’s body and find the cause of his death.”","“Yes,” replied Master Chu after he realized what was going on.","Jun Linshen and Master Dugu looked at each other. The latter nodded, reassuring him.","Immediately, all eyes were on Lord Wu’s body.","At that moment, someone tried to get into the room.","The eunuchs at the door tried their best to stop the person.","However, the person struggled hysterically and couldn’t be stopped.","The eunuchs were all knocked to the ground, and the person ran into the room.","It was none other than Mrs. Wu, Lord Wu’s wife.","She had just received the news. As soon as she entered the room, she saw the dead body on the ground and almost fainted.","“My lord!” She burst into tears.","“Why is he... How did this happen?!” Mrs. Wu glared at everyone with bloodshot eyes.","Jun Linshen said, “Feng Xun killed him!”","Mrs. Wu stared at Feng Xun. No one could scare her now.","What a fierce woman. She didn’t look like the wife of a mere low-level lord at all. Feng Xun glanced at a young eunuch next to him.","The eunuch explained to him in a low voice, “This is Lord Wu’s wife. She’s the daughter of Master Wu, the Master of Ceremonies.”","Feng Xun nodded and didn’t think much of it.","The young eunuch smiled bitterly and went on. “She’s also the goddaughter of Master Eunuch Wu.”","“Who’s Master Eunuch Wu?”","That sounded like someone important.","The young eunuch lowered his voice even more. “He’s the head eunuch and the Royal Horse Supervisor.”","The young eunuch pointed at the sky.","That was to say, Master Eunuch Wu was a big boss to the eunuchs.","Feng Xun’s face darkened a little."]},{"number":2144,"title":"Chapter 2144 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Master Eunuch Wu, the Royal Horse Supervisor?","That could be problematic.","Eunuchs could be great cultivation masters as well. For instance, the 12 head eunuchs in the royal palace were all capable warriors.","The Royal Horse Supervisor was the keeper of the commander’s seal for the emperor and could deploy the imperial guards in the capital city. He was definitely an important person.","Feng Xun’s family background aside, he was only a junior officer.","At his age, he was only a team leader in the intelligence department. Master Eunuch Wu was of a much higher rank.","Only his father was senior enough to be Master Eunuch Wu’s equal.","That old eunuch had even challenged his father before.","That thought gave Feng Xun a bigger headache.","Jun Linshen still wouldn’t give in. “Feng Xun killed him! It has nothing to do with me!”","Feng Xun was so mad!","He wanted to punch Jun Linshen in the face.","But Feng Wu shook her head at him.","Feng Xun snorted.","If it wasn’t for “Boss Jun,” he would have beaten up Jun Linshen.","But Feng Xun had made up his mind. He would find a quiet spot, blindfold Jun Linshen and kick him around to vent his frustration.","Feng Wu told Feng Xun, “Tell everyone what happened.”","Feng Xun nodded. He then explained Feng Wu’s method of identifying the spies and pointed out Lord Wu’s strange behavior.","He said that was why he had wanted to bring Lord Wu here.","Hearing his description, Emperor Wu couldn’t help but glance at Feng Wu.","He thought, “Jun Linyuan is indeed very smart, but he’s too arrogant. If only he can be as obedient as his brother...”","Feng Xun went on, “With Boss Jun’s method, I spotted Lord Wu because he cared too much about the Dongsang Kingdom. Over a dozen people were there, and they’re all my witnesses!”","The people that had been taken away were brought back now.","Because they needed to recreate the scene.","Emperor Wu glanced at the crowd.","Everyone nodded, confirming what Feng Xun had said.","Feng Xun said, “So, we’re almost certain that he’s a spy of the Dongsang Kingdom.”","“Nonsense!”","Mrs. Wu jumped up from the ground and charged at Feng Xun. She shouted at him, “You have no witness or physical evidence! This is pure speculation! My husband isn’t a spy!”","She would never accept that conclusion because it would be a heavy blow to her family, her future, and the force behind her.","Therefore, she tried her best to deny it.","Feng Xun frowned. “They’re all my witnesses.”","Mrs. Wu smirked. “So what? Where’s your physical evidence? Show me! Otherwise —”","“Here it is.”","Someone spoke calmly from the doorway.","It was Xuan Yi.","After Mo Haolin died, Feng Wu sent him away to take care of something, and now, he was back.","“Here is the physical evidence.” Xuan Yi waved the object in his hand.","Emperor Wu glanced at Eunuch Gao, who quickly took the object and handed it to Emperor Wu.","Emperor Wu took a look, and his face darkened.","Mrs. Wu’s heart sank.","What was going on?","Emperor Wu was furious. “That Lord Wu really was a spy of the Dongsang Kingdom! Stop trying to deny it!”","He glared at Mrs. Wu with angry red eyes."]},{"number":2145,"title":"Chapter 2145 - Untitled.","paragraphs":["Everyone looked at Emperor Wu.","They wondered what Xuan Yi had handed to him and why he was so angry.","Xuan Yi had been sent off by “Jun Linyuan.” Did that mean that the “crown prince” had planned it from the beginning? That was amazing!","Emperor Wu didn’t show the others what was in his hand. He only summoned Mrs. Wu to his side.","Mrs. Wu almost fainted when she saw what it was.","“Get her out of here! Find out everything about her family!” Emperor Wu was furious.","Feng Xun was relieved and said, “So, we have reached the conclusion that Lord Wu was a spy of the Dongsang Kingdom, right?”","Emperor Wu nodded.","Jun Linshen nodded reluctantly.","He had tried to set Feng Xun’s family against Master Eunuch Wu, the head eunuch. If he succeeded, he would be able to remove Feng Xun from his position.","But now, it didn’t seem like that would happen.","Once Feng Xun identified Lord Wu as a spy, Jun Linshen became his next target.","“I was bringing Lord Wu to Boss Jun, when Prince Jun Linshen approached me.”","Feng Xun looked at Jun Linshen and went on, “The prince usually ignores me and will proudly look away whenever we run into each other. This time, however, he tried to strike up a conversation with me.”","Jun Linshen glared at Feng Xun. “Why would I try to do that? You’re just a young lord. Feng...”","“Shut up!” Emperor Wu glared at Jun Linshen before telling Feng Xun to go on.","Jun Linshen could only vent his frustration inwardly.","Feng Xun said, “The prince said that carrying Lord Wu was such a tiresome job, and he wanted to carry him for me.”","Jun Linshen glowered. “No, I didn’t!”","Feng Xun smirked. “The courier station is a very small place, and many people were watching. Do I really need to find someone to back me up?”","Jun Linshen said, “I was only trying to help you. Feng Xun, how ungrateful you are!”","Feng Xun said angrily, “Why should I be grateful at all?!”","Seeing that Jun Linshen was trying to change the subject again, Feng Wu had to intervene. She gave Feng Xun a warning glance.","Taking the hint, Feng Xun got to the point. He cleared his throat and said, “Your Royal Highness, you admit that you took Lord Wu from me?”","Jun Linshen gritted his teeth and snorted.","Feng Xun smirked. “With His Majesty here, are you still not going to give me a straight answer? Do you think you can fool His Majesty?!”","Jun Linshen glared at Feng Xun. Since when was Feng Xun so clever?","If he didn’t give a straight answer, the emperor would think that he was trying to fool him. That would be a serious crime.","Jun Linshen was infuriated, but Emperor Wu was glaring at him, and he had to admit what he did. “Sure, I took Lord Wu. So what?”","Feng Xun chuckled. “We wouldn’t have to go through so much trouble if you had admitted it in the beginning.”","Jun Linshen said angrily, “How can you prove that I killed Lord Wu? Show me!”","Feng Xun shrugged. “I don’t know.”","What?","Everyone was dumbfounded.","The young lord had been so intimidating when he confronted the prince, but now, he said he didn’t know what to do next."]},{"number":2146,"title":"Chapter 2146 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Jun Linshen smirked. “Why are you saying that I killed him?”","It was obvious that he was trying to trick Feng Xun.","Despite knowing it, Feng Xun still replied, “Because you did. You killed Lord Wu!”","Jun Linshen laughed. “Young Lord Feng, you better know what you’re talking about. I’m a prince. Why would I kill a low-level lord?”","Feng Xun said, “There’s no use trying to deny it. You did it.”","Jun Linshen laughed despite his rage. “Fine, if you say so. But in the end, if you can’t prove that I killed him, you’ve just slandered a prince!”","Feng Xun smirked. “If I did, you can take my head!”","He put his life on the line!","They spoke very quickly, and by the time Emperor Wu tried to stop them, he was too late.","Jun Linshen said, “Fine! If you can prove that I did it, I’ll admit to my crime, like a commoner!”","Feng Xun said, “Great!”","“So, how are you going to prove it?” Jun Linshen smirked.","Feng Xun shrugged and grinned. “I have no idea, but Boss Jun knows what to do.”","All eyes fell on Feng Wu.","To the others, she was Jun Linyuan.","Feng Wu didn’t answer Feng Xun. Instead, she turned to Master Chu and asked, “What did you find?”","Master Chu smiled bitterly. “I’ve examined every part of his body, including the bottom of his feet, but nothing is out of place. It seems that Lord Wu...”","Jun Linshen smiled and asked, “Master Chu, what do you think was the cause of Lord Wu’s death?”","Everyone looked at Master Chu.","Even Emperor Wu said, “Tell us what you know.”","Master Chu gave Feng Wu and Feng Xun an apologetic look, cleared his throat, and said, “My examination shows that Lord Wu had a weak heart. I found no external injuries, nor is there any sign of him being poisoned. I think we can conclude that Lord Wu had a heart attack and was killed by fear and panic.”","Emperor Wu frowned. “Are you saying that he was frightened to death?”","Master Chu nodded. “That seems to be the case.”","Jun Linshen gloated at Feng Xun.","That was in his favor.","He couldn’t wait to see Feng Xun dead.","But Feng Xun wasn’t worried at all, because “Boss Jun” would be there to help him.","He had a lot of confidence in “Boss Jun.”","Feng Wu found Feng Xun a bit too trusting.","Since Feng Xun’s life was on the line, Feng Wu had to take it seriously. She asked Master Chu, “Did you examine the entire body?”","Master Chu nodded and said seriously, “Yes, Your Royal Highness.”","“What about his groin?” Feng Wu glanced at Jun Linshen when she asked the question.","Jun Linshen turned around and glared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu ignored him.","Master Chu seemed surprised. “His groin? I don’t think there’s any injury there.”","Master Chu was very thorough, and he hadn’t missed the private parts.","Feng Wu shook her head. “The skin there is darker than elsewhere. Did you examine it closely?”"]},{"number":2147,"title":"Chapter 2147 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Master Chu’s pupils contracted a little. The “crown prince” was saying that...","“I’ll examine it again.”","He flipped Lord Wu’s dead body over and looked closely at the spot that Feng Wu had mentioned. Seeing this, Jun Linshen’s hands started to shake.","“There’s a tiny needle mark.” Master Chu reached the conclusion after examining the dead body more closely.","“So what? What does that prove?” Jun Linshen tried to remain calm.","Feng Wu smirked. “We’ll see what it can prove once the dead body is dissected.”","Master Chu asked for Emperor Wu’s permission.","Normally, people wouldn’t agree to have the body of their family member cut up, but Mrs. Wu had been taken away already...","Feng Wu said, “All men of the Dongsang Kingdom are marked on the bone. If I’m guessing correctly, so is Lord Wu.”","Marked on the bone? Where did that come from? No one had heard of it before.","Emperor Wu looked at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu nodded and said, “They write ‘Soul of Dongsang’ on their bones along with a number.”","Emperor Wu asked, “Why do you know that?”","Feng Wu said, “I extracted that information from the interrogation earlier, but I hadn’t verified it yet.”","Emperor Wu glanced at Feng Wu and wondered how much information “his son” had kept from him.","He then turned to Master Chu and said, “Dissect him.”","Knowing how serious this was, Master Chu started immediately.","Seeing that Master Chu was aiming at Lord Wu’s rib, Feng Wu added, “The mark can be anywhere. It doesn’t necessarily have to be on the rib.”","Master Chu stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu smiled and said, “That way, it won’t be exposed so easily.”","Feng Wu was telling him that he should uncover Lord Wu’s cause of death first. The mark could wait.","Master Chu took the hint, so he cut up Lord Wu’s leg first.","Soon, blood was extracted, and it had a trace of green.","“What’s that?”","Emperor Wu didn’t know what that meant.","By then, Master Chu was covered with sweat.","He had been so sure a moment ago that Lord Wu had been frightened to death. But now, the evidence suggested otherwise.","“It’s Thousand Silk!” Master Chu’s face darkened.","Emperor Wu was perplexed. “What’s that?”","Master Chu heaved a sigh. “It’s a potent liquid poison that can excite a person exceedingly in a short period of time. It can easily kill someone with a weak heart.”","Hearing that, everyone looked at Lord Wu.","Wasn’t that what had killed Lord Wu, a weak heart?","That was exactly as Master Chu had described.","Master Chu smiled bitterly and said, “The poison dissolves in the blood. I wouldn’t have noticed without dissecting the body. The murderer is really good. The poison was injected with a tiny needle and the needle was removed afterward.","“Normally, I wouldn’t check the groin for a needle mark. Moreover, just like what His Royal Highness said, the skin there is darker, which makes it harder to spot any mark. I would have missed it, had it not been for His Royal Highness’s reminder.”","Everyone looked at Jun Linshen now.","Jun Linshen was frustrated. “Why are you looking at me? Even if you can prove that Lord Wu was killed with Thousand Silk, how does that have anything to do with me?!”"]},{"number":2148,"title":"Chapter 2148 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Feng Xun smirked and said, “You made contact with Lord Wu.”","Jun Linshen was even more furious. “So did you! Why am I the killer?!”","Feng Xun smirked. “I was trying to catch a spy. Why would I kill him? Use your brain! I have no motive!”","Jun Linshen said, “Are you saying that I have a motive?”","Feng Xun didn’t know what to say.","Feng Wu smiled and said, “You do.”","Jun Linshen stared at Feng Wu. “Brother, are you trying to get me killed so that no one can challenge your position as the crown prince?”","Feng Wu smiled and said calmly, “First of all, this is a competition between you and me. The first one to solve the case will get that jade ring.”","Jun Linshen tried to interject, but Feng Wu went on. “Seeing that I’ve been doing so well, naturally, you would want to kill Lord Wu to sabotage my plan.”","Jun Linshen stared at Feng Wu and said stubbornly, “No, I didn’t do it.”","Feng Wu wouldn’t listen to his excuse. “Secondly, if other people believe that Feng Xun killed Lord Wu, Master Eunuch Wu, the head eunuch, would hold a grudge against him.","“Jun Linshen, you’ve always been so petty.” Feng Wu shook her head.","With his plan exposed, Jun Linshen’s face turned red with frustration. He shouted, “No! I didn’t do it! You can’t force me to admit to something that I didn’t do!”","Feng Wu smiled and turned to Xuan Yi. “Although Thousand Silk is said to be odorless and neither humans nor dogs can smell it, a type of dog with pink fur has especially acute senses. They can smell it. Now, bring me that pink dog.”","She then glanced at Jun Linshen. “The killer can’t remove the smell of Thousand Silk on his hands. The dog will soon tell us who he is!”","Jun Linshen stared at Feng Wu in terror.","Feng Wu ignored him and turned to look at Master Chu.","While they were talking, Master Chu had been dissecting Lord Wu. Soon, all the flesh was removed, and there was only a skeleton left.","On the bone...","“Look! There’s something written on it!” Feng Xun cried out.","Whoosh!","Everyone looked at the bone.","Feng Xun was right. There was something carved into one of the bones on the arm.","“Soul of Dongsang. Serial number: Saturn 0003.” Feng Xun read it out loud. “I know what ‘Soul of Dongsang’ is. What does that number mean?”","Feng Wu said, “That’s easy.”","All eyes were on Feng Wu.","Feng Wu glanced at the 13 suspects. Four of them were guards.","Emperor Wu ordered all of them to leave the room.","Soon, there were only a few people left.","Feng Wu looked at Emperor Wu and said, “Master Linghu chased the Dongsang Kingdom out of our empire 13 years ago, but they wouldn’t have any of it. So, they left something behind.","“That ‘something’ is officially known as the revival list of the Dongsang Kingdom.","“There are 77 people in total. They’re divided into seven 10-man teams.","“The number on Lord Wu means that he was No. 3 in the Saturn team.”","...","The others were all astonished.","Emperor Wu was shocked because there was such a revival group hiding in the Junwu Empire.","Jun Linshen was shocked because “Jun Linyuan” had pretty much figured out everything when he still knew next to nothing.","He was filled with despair."]},{"number":2149,"title":"Chapter 2149 - Thousand Silk","paragraphs":["Emperor Wu stared at Feng Wu. “Are you sure about that?”","Feng Wu showed Emperor Wu the confession.","Feng Xun had learned quite a few things during his interrogation.","Emperor Wu grew furious as he read the confession.","Damn it!","It was abominable!","He had always thought that the Junwu Empire was the most powerful empire on the continent and that nothing could be kept from him. However, what he was reading now felt like a slap to his face.","“I’m going to interrogate them myself!” Emperor Wu said angrily.","Feng Wu looked at Emperor Wu in resignation. “Are you sure about that?”","Emperor Wu said, “Yes.”","Feng Wu nodded and said, “Your Majesty, you killed the first spy when you interrogated him.”","Emperor Wu didn’t know what to say.","Feng Wu went on. “Then, he killed the second one.”","She pointed at Jun Linshen.","Jun Linshen said, “No, I didn’t!”","Feng Wu asked, “Are you saying that you didn’t kill Mo Haolin?”","Jun Linshen said, “That’s because he tried to kill me first, so I...”","Feng Wu nodded and said to Emperor Wu, “So, he killed the second spy.”","“As for the third one...” Feng Wu pointed at Lord Wu’s skeleton. “As the third member of the Saturn team, he should have been able to tell us a lot of things, but you killed him.”","“I didn’t kill him! I didn’t!” Jun Linshen insisted.","Feng Wu smiled and ignored him. Just then, Xuan Yi came in with a pink dog.","Feng Wu asked Emperor Wu, “Your Majesty, shall we start the inspection with you?”","Emperor Wu glared at her. “How dare you suspect me?!”","Feng Wu shook her head. “I’m not suspecting anything, but if Your Majesty refuses, a certain someone will say that he’s too important to be inspected.”","Everyone knew whom she was referring to.","Emperor Wu wanted to know the truth as well, so he nodded and said, “Fine. Everyone should be inspected. I must know who’s behind all this!”","Feng Wu glanced at Xuan Yi, who then walked the dog from the left to the right so that it could sniff at everyone, including Feng Wu.","Jun Linshen smirked. “What if it can’t find anything?”","Feng Wu said casually, “Then Feng Xun is the killer.”","Jun Linshen laughed. “Great!”","The dog sniffed at everyone in the room, but in the end —","It only stared at the skeleton and blood...","The process was repeated.","But the dog still didn’t find anything.","Everyone gave Feng Wu strange looks.","They believed that “Jun Linyuan” could do anything and would never be defeated. Was “he” going to fail this time?","Feng Xun grew anxious.","Why wouldn’t the dog bark at Jun Linshen?","Was it possible that Jun Linshen hadn’t killed the man?","“Hahaha —”","Jun Linshen guffawed. “Jun Linyuan, I never thought that I would see the day you would fail a task!”","Feng Wu frowned.","Jun Linshen shouted, “Jun Linyuan, you’ve just gotten Feng Xun killed!”","Feng Wu smiled. “Jun Linshen, are you really that stupid?”","That made Jun Linshen stop laughing. He then stared at Feng Wu, looking surprised.","Feng Wu said, “Show us your right hand.”","Jun Linshen hesitated.","“What do you want?” He stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu said, “I lied to you when I said that the dog could smell the poison.”","What?"]},{"number":2150,"title":"Chapter 2150 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Everyone stared at her.","Feng Wu said, “Apparently, someone believed it, so he’s been rubbing his hand, trying to get rid of the ‘smell.’ His hand must be swollen by now.”","Jun Linshen glared at Feng Wu.","Feng Xun reacted quickly. Before Jun Linshen could do anything, Feng Xun ran up to him and grabbed his right hand.","Feng Wu was right. Jun Linshen’s right hand was red and raw.","Everyone stared at Jun Linshen.","Jun Linshen panicked.","So did Empress Dugu.","Master Dugu was shocked as well.","If they could, they would kill Jun Linshen right now.","What an idiot! He rubbed his hand just because “Jun Linyuan” said that the dog could smell the poison. He had given himself away!","Jun Linshen wanted to kill himself.","He had used up all his excuses. What could he say now?","Would the others believe it if he said that his hand felt itchy?","Frustrated, Emperor Wu glared at him. “What do you have to say now?!”","Recalling the bet, Jun Linshen burst into tears. “Father... Father...”","Emperor Wu kicked his son with all his might.","Jun Linshen was kicked away.","Empress Dugu knelt and pleaded, “Your Majesty, please forgive him. He didn’t mean to... That man was a spy. He deserved to be killed...”","Seeing the weeping mother and son, Feng Wu shook her head in resignation.","Emperor Wu was very forgiving when it came to his other sons. Hearing their cries, he couldn’t bring himself to scold Jun Linshen anymore.","After all, he liked Empress Dugu very much, and Jun Linshen was almost his favorite son.","Poor Jun Linyuan...","Feng Wu wouldn’t give Empress Dugu and Jun Linshen what they wanted.","She mimicked Jun Linyuan’s tone and said casually, “So, you won’t keep your agreement. Is that it?”","Emperor Wu glared at Jun Linyuan.","Why would he want to see his younger brother in a predicament?","Feng Wu shrugged and gave Emperor Wu a contemptuous glance. “He lost the bet, and has to live with the outcome. Isn’t that the most basic principle in life? If he can’t keep his promise, how can he be worthy of the throne?”","“Jun Linyuan!” Emperor Wu shouted at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu sighed and shrugged. “Is this idiot all you can find to hone my ambition? You really don’t have many good sons to choose from, do you?”","In the corner of the room, Jun Linyuan gave Feng Wu a quick glance before closing his eyes again.","It happened so quickly that Feng Wu didn’t see it.","Since Feng Wu was Jun Linyuan now, she could say whatever she wanted to Emperor Wu.","If she revered Emperor Wu now, she wouldn’t look like Jun Linyuan.","What she said was very mean.","Emperor Wu was furious.","“Neither of you shows me any respect!” Emperor Wu kicked Jun Linshen again. “You betted on your reputation as a prince, right? If you don’t respect that title, you can leave the royal family now!”","Emperor Wu stormed off after that.","Had Jun Linshen been banished from the royal family? Empress Dugu burst into tears, and Jun Linshen was so frightened that he fainted.","That news was a thunderclap over his head!"]},{"number":2151,"title":"Chapter 2151 - Untitled","paragraphs":["“Your Majesty, Princess Jun Wuxia has woken up!” Yulian, the maid who had been looking after Jun Wuxia, ran into the room and shouted.","Shouting was actually against the rules.","But...","Jun Wuxia had been in a coma ever since she was injured in the tombs. Everyone had thought that she would stay that way forever, but now, she had woken up. Yulian was thrilled.","Empress Dugu was over the moon.","She gave Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan a fierce look before leaving with Jun Linshen.","They soon all left the room, leaving only a few people behind.","However, Feng Wu frowned.","Because Jun Wuxia had woken up.","She had seen Feng Wu kill Zuo Qingyu, and her injury was caused by Feng Wu as well. If she told other people about it, Feng Wu would be in trouble.","Although Feng Wu wasn’t afraid of her, she still wanted to avoid all the fuss.","Feng Xun didn’t realize the significance. He moved closer and asked, “Boss Jun, do you think Jun Linshen has really been banished from the royal family?”","Feng Wu didn’t speak.","Feng Xun went on. “Is he going to come back? I mean... Is he still going to be a prince?”","Feng Wu found his question idiotic. “What do you think?”","That...","Feng Xun smacked his head and looked disappointed. “Why did I even make that bet with him? It was useless.”","Feng Wu said, “How so? At least we got him kicked out.”","Feng Xun said, “Huh?”","Feng Wu smirked. “His Majesty didn’t think much of this case before, so he tried to use Jun Linshen to motivate me. However, now that he knows that the revival plan is real, of course he can’t let Jun Linshen mess it up.”","Feng Xun nodded.","Jun Linshen hadn’t taken this matter seriously at all.","“So, he will...” said Feng Xun.","“He’ll be locked up, at least until we get back to the capital. He won’t bother us for a while.”","Feng Xun said, “Good. I’ll mock him every time I see him from now on. I’d like to see how arrogant he can be.”","Before, Jun Linshen had been quite rude toward Feng Xun, but now, Feng Xun could finally get back at him.","Feng Wu nodded. “But our top priority now is to solve the case. Otherwise, the Junwu Empire will be in big trouble.”","Feng Xun and Xun Yi became serious as well.","Although they usually looked quite undisciplined, deep down, they believed that it was their duty to defend the empire and protect the people.","Feng Wu told Xuan Yi, “You should leave immediately. Go back to the capital and investigate Mo Haolin’s woman.”","Mo Haolin’s woman? Xuan Yi didn’t understand.","Feng Wu said, “If I’ve guessed it correctly, Mo Haolin’s woman is the real spy of the Dongsang Kingdom. She’s the one who turned him.”","Feng Xun was astonished. “Really?!”","Feng Wu nodded. “Yup.”","Feng Xun scratched his head. He had been with “Boss Jun” when he interrogated Mo Haolin, but why didn’t he know anything about the woman?","But Feng Xun couldn’t figure it out no matter how he thought about it.","On second thought, he realized that he shouldn’t be surprised that “Boss Jun” was smarter than he was.","What he didn’t know was that the real Jun Linyuan was in the corner.","He gave Feng Wu a strange look.","Just then —","Master Gao, the eunuch, came in with a smile."]},{"number":2152,"title":"Chapter 2152 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Feng Xun rubbed his chin. That was quick.","Master Gao said with a smile, “His Majesty wants Your Royal Highness to solve the case as soon as possible and catch everyone on the revival list.”","Feng Wu frowned. “What if I can’t?”","Master Gao said, “His Majesty says that if Your Royal Highness can finish the task within a month, he’ll grant you what you wanted.”","What did he want? Had Jun Linyuan reached some sort of agreement with Emperor Wu before? However, Feng Wu couldn’t ask right now.","She tried to make up an excuse. “I don’t have anyone I can use. Plus, one month is too soon...”","Gao took out an iron token and handed it to Feng Wu. “His Majesty has made you the head of the intelligence department. After we return to the capital city, you’ll be able to give them instructions.”","The intelligence department?","Feng Xun’s eyes lit up.","He kept giving Feng Wu warning glances, hoping that she would say yes.","Feng Wu didn’t have much idea about that department, so she looked at Jun Linyuan.","He had to make the call.","Jun Linyuan gave her a little nod.","Feng Wu took the token and nodded at Gao. “Alright, I’ll do it, but I can’t guarantee that I can do it in a month.”","Gao said with a smile, “I’m sure Your Royal Highness won’t disappoint His Majesty.”","After Gao left, Feng Xun grabbed the token and played with it.","Feng Wu glanced at him. “Why are you so excited over such a little thing? You’re a young lord, for god’s sake.”","Feng Xun gloated. “You don’t understand, do you?”","Feng Wu raised her eyebrows. “What?”","Feng Xun asked, “Do you know what the intelligence department is?”","Feng Wu thought about it and said, “It’s a department of the Ministry of War, isn’t it?”","Feng Xun shook his head. “Nope. That’s military intelligence. Their head is the minister of the Ministry of War.”","Feng Wu asked, “What about the intelligence department?”","Feng Xun said proudly, “It’s a different thing. It’s above military intelligence and answers only to the emperor. That is to say, it only follows the emperor’s orders!","“Military intelligence is only one division. If the intelligence department wants, they can use any information or personnel of military intelligence.","“Military intelligence mainly collects information about the armies of other countries.","“However, the intelligence department also has secret agents who are in charge of catching spies and sabotaging the intelligence work of other forces.","“Also...” Feng Xun glanced at Feng Wu. “The department keeps an eye on government officials to prevent corruption. Boss Jun, that question was too easy for me.”","Feng Wu almost forgot that she was Jun Linyuan now. Jun Linyuan would never ask such an easy question.","She cleared her throat. “That was the correct answer.”","Feng Xun grinned. He then frowned and asked, “Boss Jun, now that the spies are all dead, we don’t have any leads. What should we do?”"]},{"number":2153,"title":"Chapter 2153 - Granny Qin","paragraphs":["“Lord Wu is dead, and so is Mo Haolin. Suffice to say, Jun Linshen killed them both. Is he our top suspect?”","Feng Wu rolled her eyes at him. “Pay attention to Zhao Jia after we leave.”","Feng Xun had summoned the dozen or so people here with the excuse that Jun Linyuan was recruiting guards. In the end, Feng Xun had indeed kept four of them.","Zhao Jia was one of the four.","“Zhao Jia? Not Zuo Ziyan?” Feng Xun had thought that “Boss Jun” suspected Zuo Ziyan.","“It’s Zhao Jia,” Feng Wu said affirmatively.","Feng Xun nodded and became serious.","He was usually a free spirit, but when he put his mind to something, he could be very serious.","After Feng Xun left, Feng Wu rubbed her chin and walked around the room.","She was doing the ninth and tenth trials together, which was quite a lot of pressure. And there was also Jun Wuxia waking up and the revival list...","Just then, Jun Linyuan finished cultivating and opened his eyes.","“You’re awake!” Feng Wu moved closer. “How do you feel?”","Jun Linyuan glanced at her. “Are you in a rush?”","Feng Wu said, “Of course I am. I really hope that we can get our own bodies back now.”","Jun Linyuan looked at her with a frown. Did she hate his body so much?","Feng Wu murmured, “Things are so complicated and dangerous. We’ll only be able to get through it if you can get your body back.”","Jun Linyuan asked, “Is it that serious?”","Feng Wu glanced at him. “Have you forgotten? They sent the message that you, the crown prince of the Junwu Empire, aren’t as capable as you’re said to be and that you’ve been injured... Wouldn’t they take this chance to kill you?”","Feng Wu grew anxious. “The truth is that I can’t exert your full power, although I’m using your body now. What shall we do if some great master attacks us?”","She looked expectantly at Jun Linyuan, but he only raised his eyebrows. “That’s a great idea.”","Feng Wu said, “What?”","Jun Linyuan asked, “What leads do we have now?”","Feng Wu said calmly, “There are two leads. One is Mo Haolin’s woman, but since Mo Haolin died in public, someone may leak the information. If that happens, Xuan Yi won’t be able to find the woman in the imperial capital.","“The second lead is Zhao Jia,” Feng Wu said solemnly. “His reaction was the most obvious when Master Chu dissected Lord Wu. That was very suspicious.","“And this.” Feng Wu showed Jun Linyuan the token Gao gave her. “Is this a token for military intelligence? I didn’t quite understand Feng Xun’s explanation.”","Jun Linyuan took the token. He smirked a little when he saw the mark on it. “That’s generous of him.”","“Who?” Feng Wu asked curiously.","“My father,” Jun Linyuan said casually. “He’s in total control of military intelligence. Do you know who the minister is?”","Feng Wu asked, “Who?”","Jun Linyuan said, “Do you know who the second most influential old lady in the royal palace is?”","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up. “Who’s that?”","Jun Linyuan said, “My father’s old nanny, Granny Qin.”","Feng Wu said, “Really?”","Jun Linyuan nodded. “The empress dowager was too busy competing with other women at the time to look after him, so Granny Qin brought him up like her own son. It’s no wonder that he treats Granny Qin well.”"]},{"number":2154,"title":"Chapter 2154 - You Have My Permission (1)","paragraphs":["Feng Wu nodded.","Jun Linyuan said, “Granny Qin then moved on to look after my oldest aunt... Well, we don’t need to talk about that now. Her greatest achievement isn’t becoming the emperor’s nanny, but having her son.”","Feng Wu’s eyes widened a little. “Really?”","Jun Linyuan said, “Yes. His name is Qin Mo. He doesn’t talk much, but he’s extremely talented. He reached the Spiritual Overlord stage all by himself.”","“What’s a Spiritual Overlord like?” Feng Wu looked eagerly at Jun Linyuan.","Jun Linyuan said, “You’re a Spiritual Elder now, right?”","Feng Wu nodded.","Jun Linyuan said, “After the Spiritual Elder stage, you have the Spiritual Lord stage. Zuo Qingluan is a Level 8 Spiritual Lord now.”","Feng Wu said, “What?! Wasn’t she Level 7 only two days ago? Why is she Level 8 already? How do you know that? Do you keep in touch with her or something?”","Jun Linyuan ignored her questions and went on. “After the Spiritual Lord stage, there’s the Spiritual King stage. Feng Xun’s father is a Spiritual King. With that cultivation level, one is qualified to become a lord.”","Feng Wu was astonished!","Jun Linyuan glanced at Feng Wu and said, “Above the Spiritual King stage is the Spiritual Overlord stage.”","Feng Wu was astonished!","Jun Linyuan nodded to affirm his own words.","Feng Wu said, “How many Spiritual Overlords do we have?”","Jun Linyuan gave it some thought and said, “I really can’t say.”","Feng Wu asked, “Why?”","Jun Linyuan said, “Not everything is aboveboard. Some extremely capable masters hide their real abilities, so no one knows the exact number, but there can’t be too many of them.”","Feng Wu had a rough idea now.","A Spiritual Overlord had to be extremely capable.","Feng Wu glanced at Jun Linyuan and asked, “Are you a Spiritual Overlord?”","Jun Linyuan looked up at her and raised his eyebrows. “Do you want to know?”","Seeing his attitude, Feng Wu snorted. “No, I don’t.”","Jun Linyuan smiled a little.","It wasn’t that he didn’t want to tell her, but doing so wouldn’t help her cultivation at all.","Because the great gap would only fill her with despair.","“By the way, you were talking about Qin Mo.” Feng Wu tried to resume the subject.","Jun Linyuan glanced at Feng Wu.","She was the only girl that he would be so patient with.","“Qin Mo is the Minister of Military Intelligence,” Jun Linyuan said solemnly. “He reports only to the emperor and follows the emperor’s orders.","“The intelligence department includes several divisions, and Qin Mo is head over all of them. My father has never suspected him. If he trusts anyone, it’s Qin Mo.”","Jun Linyuan looked at Feng Wu and said seriously, “I’d rather you mess with the emperor than with him.”","What kind of person would make Jun Linyuan feel threatened...","Feng Wu made a mental note of that name, although she wouldn’t need to deal with someone like Qin Mo just yet.","She nodded and said, “I’ll remember that.","“By the way, what does this token do?” Feng Wu showed Jun Linyuan the token which Gao had brought over.","Jun Linyuan looked at the token and narrowed his eyes. “It’s the token for the espionage department.”"]},{"number":2155,"title":"Chapter 2155 - You Have My Permission (2)","paragraphs":["Feng Wu exclaimed, “Are you saying that the head can control the espionage information of the entire empire?”","Jun Linyuan said, “What else?”","Feng Wu said, “That’s a very important position!”","She did some calculations and realized that Qin Mo would have been a lieutenant general in her previous life.","However, Jun Linyuan only smirked and tossed the token to Feng Wu. He then said casually, “One day, I’ll have the entire intelligence department.”","Feng Wu snorted. “I think you’ll have a higher chance of becoming the emperor than replacing Qin Mo.”","However, Jun Linyuan only glanced at her. “You think too little of the throne and the emperor.”","Feng Wu said, “Am I wrong? You show the emperor no respect and shout at him whenever you get the chance. I don’t see why he should let you inherit the throne.”","Jun Linyuan looked at her and shook his head. “That’s because he’s not what you think he is.”","What?","Feng Wu was confused.","What did that mean? What else could Emperor Wu be? She looked at Jun Linyuan in bewilderment.","Jun Linyuan patted her head. “Kiddo, you know nothing. With your current status and cultivation level, you can only see the tip of the iceberg. The empire is much stronger than you think. Show it some respect, alright?”","Feng Wu said, “I don’t see you showing it any respect.”","Jun Linyuan said, “Because I’m already one step away from reaching the top, but you...”","He shook his head.","Feng Wu retorted, “What?”","Jun Linyuan looked Feng Wu’s body up and down before he shook his head.","He then gave her a “you know what I mean” look.","Feng Wu was so mad that she wanted to slap him.","Jun Linyuan said, “I’m only saying this because I feel sorry for you. Otherwise...”","Feng Wu looked away and wouldn’t talk to him.","Jun Linyuan’s eyes flickered. When he spoke again, it was as if he was talking to both of them.","He said seriously, “Feng Wu, you have my permission to share my glory.”","Those words set Feng Wu off.","“Don’t make me laugh. I have your permission? What permission? I don’t need such a thing! Your glory means nothing to me!”","Feng Wu rose to her feet and rolled her eyes at Jun Linyuan. “You can have all the glory you want! I won’t have anything to do with it!”","She then turned to leave.","However, she only took a few steps before she realized a very serious problem.","She couldn’t leave!","The ninth trial wasn’t finished yet. If she left now, she would fail the trial. If that happened, she wouldn’t find the broken star piece, and her beautiful master wouldn’t wake up. That would be the worst.","Therefore, Feng Wu paused and didn’t know what to do. She looked utterly embarrassed.","What Jun Linyuan had said was unacceptable.","He was still angry, when he saw Feng Wu stop walking and hesitate. That immediately appeased him greatly."]},{"number":2156,"title":"Chapter 2156 - Has a Powerful Master Shown Up?","paragraphs":["“Aren’t you going to bed?” Jun Linyuan asked.","Feng Wu snorted and went to bed. She wrapped the blanket around herself, looking like an ostrich hiding its head in the sand.","She turned her back to Jun Linyuan, trying to show that she was really angry.","Seeing this, Jun Linyuan was no longer angry and only found her amusing.","Feng Wu was angry at first, but she was too sleepy to stay awake.","She snored slightly.","Seeing that the girl had fallen asleep almost immediately, Jun Linyuan didn’t know what to say.","What a girl... He didn’t know if he should laugh or cry.","After watching her for a while, he shook his head and went back to his cultivation.","He had no idea how big his smile was.","Feng Wu was woken by a loud voice the following morning.","She rubbed her sleepy eyes and sat up.","An unfamiliar voice rang out. “His Royal Highness is still asleep and can’t be disturbed. Please leave.”","Feng Wu recognized that voice. It was Zhao Jia.","Soon, an elderly voice rang out. “I’m not here to see His Royal Highness. Her Majesty the empress wants to see Miss Feng Wu.”","That was Granny Cheng, Empress Dugu’s maid.","Feng Wu frowned.","Zhao Jia said coldly, “Granny Cheng, His Royal Highness doesn’t like to be disturbed when he’s asleep. There will be consequences.”","Jun Linyuan’s name indeed intimidated Granny Cheng.","But she still said, “Someone else will be here soon!”","Feng Wu then heard her leave.","She rubbed her forehead. It was said that Jun Wuxia had woken up, and judging from Granny Cheng’s demeanor, Jun Wuxia must have told them what happened.","Feng Wu had killed Zuo Qingyu in the tomb.","The feud between her and the Zuo family meant that only one side could survive in the end. Otherwise, she wouldn’t have done it in the tombs.","Jun Wuxia herself wasn’t a problem, but the force she represented would give Feng Wu a lot of trouble.","She wasn’t worried about her own safety, but her mother and younger brother...","If someone could protect her mother and brother, she would have nothing to fear.","“Are you worried about your family?”","Jun Linyuan, who had been cultivating in the corner, suddenly opened his eyes.","He didn’t like to see the girl worry.","He liked to see her fighting fearlessly.","“How did you know?” Feng Wu was bewildered.","Jun Linyuan flicked his finger and said, “Come out.”","What?","Feng Wu looked around in bewilderment. Who was he talking to?","Just then, the pendant on her waist jolted, and thin smoke rose from it.","Feng Wu could sense the air around her fluctuate.","The power felt quite familiar to her.","Was some great master going to show up?"]},{"number":2157,"title":"Chapter 2157 - White Fairy","paragraphs":["The smoke grew heavier, and soon, Feng Wu couldn’t see anything. It made her narrow her eyes. Then, there was a blinding light.","When the smoke dissipated...","She saw a familiar figure.","She didn’t expect to see this person at all, and was stunned.","She was...","“Sister White Fairy?! Why are you here?!”","Feng Wu was genuinely surprised.","The white fairy was part of the tombs and one of the three ghost kings. How could she get out? Moreover, had she remained inside Jun Linyuan’s jade pendant this whole time?","Feng Wu was astonished.","The white fairy was as proud as ever.","She looked at Feng Wu and shook her head. “This is incredible. The two of you switched bodies.”","Feng Wu walked closer and studied the white fairy.","It really was her!","“How come you’re here? You...” Feng Wu asked.","“It’s a long story.” The white fairy was about to explain everything to Feng Wu. However —","“Cut the crap.” Jun Linyuan gave the white fairy a warning glance.","The white fairy’s stomach lurched.","He was so intimidating...","The white fairy recalled the portrait of this teenager that Feng Wu had drawn on the wall when they first met. Back then, the white fairy hadn’t thought much of him.","She had no idea that he would be so terrifying.","A few days after that, she was at his service...","“Yes, master.” The white fairy was very proud around Feng Wu, but when Jun Linyuan spoke, she immediately stood at attention and lowered her head.","Feng Wu stared at her in amazement.","Seriously?!","She knew that the white fairy used to be a princess of an ancient dynasty, but when Jun Linyuan spoke, she was as obedient as a maid.","Feng Wu didn’t say anything.","Jun Linyuan had a solemn look on his face when he talked to the white fairy, which was quite different from his attitude toward Feng Wu.","“You’ll be under her command from now on,” Jun Linyuan told the white fairy.","The white fairy frowned and was about to speak, but Jun Linyuan waved her off. “I’ll give you what you want.”","The white fairy pondered for a moment before she said, “I’ll serve her for ten years.”","Jun Linyuan nodded. “Alright.”","The white fairy walked up to Feng Wu and smiled at her. “Kiddo, who do you want to kill? Just tell me.”","Feng Wu looked baffled.","Jun Linyuan told Feng Wu, “She’ll work for you for the next ten years and do whatever you order her to. If she won’t obey you, just let me know.”","Feng Wu cleared her throat uneasily.","Jun Linyuan was treating the white fairy as if she was a common maid.","So, ten years.","Feng Wu had confidence in the white fairy’s capability, and if she really was going to serve her, it would be...","“I need to cultivate, and once I start, I’ll become quite immobile.” The white fairy glanced at Feng Wu arrogantly and put her hands behind her back. “I can protect you if you stay within one kilometer of me. So, don’t go too far, and you’ll be fine.”"]},{"number":2158,"title":"Chapter 2158 - Affectionate Look","paragraphs":["Feng Wu suddenly had an idea. “I don’t need you to protect me. You can just stay at my home and protect my family. Will you do that?”","Her mother and Feng Xiaoqi were her soft spot. If she could make sure that they stayed safe, she would be free to do anything.","At that thought, Feng Wu clenched her fists in excitement.","The white fairy looked at Feng Wu and said, “Don’t blame me when you get killed out there.”","The white fairy was obviously talking to Jun Linyuan.","Because Jun Linyuan was the one she was making the deal with.","Feng Wu said, “Of course!”","The white fairy glanced at her. Obviously, her response didn’t count. Jun Linyuan was the only one who could make the call.","Therefore, the white fairy stared at Jun Linyuan and waited for his reply.","The crown prince, on the other hand, was staring angrily at Feng Wu.","He was mad because she cared more about other people than herself.","“Jun Linyuan, Jun Linyuan...” Feng Wu knew that if Jun Linyuan didn’t agree, the white fairy would never say yes.","Feng Wu ran to sit next to Jun Linyuan and held his arm. “I need to put myself in danger to train myself. Protecting me all the time won’t help me. Plus, you’re here. You’ll keep me safe, right?”","Jun Linyuan rolled his eyes at her.","Feng Wu grinned at him.","Jun Linyuan was speechless.","He had let the white fairy out so that she could protect Feng Wu’s family. That was the only way to free Feng Wu from her worries. She could then do whatever she wanted.","Otherwise, the girl would be restrained by her responsibility toward her family.","If she couldn’t be a free spirit, how could she defeat her enemies?","Jun Linyuan gave her an affectionate look and nodded in resignation.","“Wow!”","Feng Wu was thrilled. She took Jun Linyuan’s arm and swayed it in excitement.","Just then, footsteps approached from outside again.","This time, it was Gao, the eunuch.","Zhao Jia still stopped him, but when Jun Linyuan heard the voice, he snorted and said, “Let him in.”","When Gao saw Feng Wu, he smiled wryly and said, “Your Royal Highness, I didn’t mean to disturb you, but Princess Jun Wuxia has woken up, and His Majesty wants to see Miss Feng Wu.”","Before, Feng Wu was worried, but now that her family was protected, she had nothing to worry about.","She had to deal with Jun Wuxia as soon as possible.","Jun Linyuan thought the same, and they both rose to their feet.","Seeing that “Jun Linyuan” was going as well, Gao tried to stop “him.” “Your Royal Highness, His Majesty summoned Miss Feng Wu only...”","Feng Wu rolled her eyes in her head.","In Gao’s eyes, Feng Wu was Jun Linyuan. He was worried that “Jun Linyuan” would enrage the emperor.","But because of the ninth trial, she had to stay within ten steps of Jun Linyuan.","She had about two weeks to go.","Therefore, she walked out of the room without looking at Gao.","She was getting better and better at imitating Jun Linyuan.","Of course, Gao didn’t dare stop the “crown prince.”"]},{"number":2159,"title":"Chapter 2159 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The crown prince might seem harmless now, but he could explode with rage at any minute, and when he did that, he might try to kill someone...","As expected, Gao took them to Empress Dugu’s place.","Jun Linyuan stepped into the room first.","Emperor Wu’s face darkened when he saw “Feng Wu” come in.","The mood in the room became very suppressed.","Seeing the “girl” raise her chin and stare right into his eyes, he was enraged by her lack of respect.","“You!” When he was about to start, “Jun Linyuan” walked into the room.","His arrival immediately silenced Emperor Wu.","Jun Wuxia had been sleeping soundly in bed, but she suddenly looked up and spotted “Feng Wu.” Her ear-splitting scream then filled the air.","“Ah!” Frightened, Jun Wuxia wrapped her arms around her head and shouted, “It was her! It was her! She tried to kill me! Kill her now!”","She struggled so violently that the others couldn’t keep her still.","When Mrs Zuo ran to her side, Jun Wuxia grabbed her hand and shouted, “She killed Zuo Qingyu! It was her! I saw it with my own eyes! Feng Wu killed Zuo Qingyu! I saw it, so she wanted to silence me!”","In fact, she was telling the truth.","Mrs Zuo was stunned.","She and her husband had speculated that Feng Wu was the killer, but they had no evidence.","But Jun Wuxia had said it, so it had to be true.","“Go get Master Zuo.”","Realizing how serious it was, Granny Cheng, who worked for Empress Dugu, whispered to a maid next to her. “And bring Master Dugu and Her Majesty the empress dowager as well. Find as many people as you can.”","This was a great opportunity to take Feng Wu down!","Maybe this was going to be their chance to kill Feng Wu!","With enough people here, even if “His Royal Highness” didn’t like it, he still couldn’t turn against the majority.","The maid immediately left the room.","By then, Mrs Zuo had returned to herself. She stared at “Feng Wu” as if she wanted to kill “her” with her eyes.","“Did you kill my daughter?” Mrs Zuo felt too weak to move.","She stumbled toward “Feng Wu” with bloodshot eyes.","Jun Linyuan narrowed his eyes and was displeased.","Feng Wu decided that as long as he didn’t do anything outrageous, she would let him be.","Seeing that “Feng Wu” wouldn’t speak, Mrs Zuo grabbed “her” by the shoulder and shook “her” violently. She screamed, “Did you kill Qingyu?! Did you kill my daughter?! I’m going to kill you!”","She wanted to bite “Feng Wu.”","However, this “Feng Wu” was actually Jun Linyuan, who was a neat freak. He couldn’t stand to be touched.","The next second!","Thump!","He pushed Mrs Zuo away.","Thump!","Mrs Zuo flew backward and smashed into the wall, which then fell apart, and the debris buried her.","Everyone was dumbfounded.","Even Emperor Wu was shocked.","He had anticipated that “Feng Wu” would deny it, but he didn’t expect “her” to be so bold!"]},{"number":2160,"title":"Chapter 2160","paragraphs":["“Mrs Zuo!”","“Sister!”","Once everyone realized what had happened, they panicked and tried to dig Mrs Zuo out.","Jun Wuxia watched this in disbelief.","She didn’t understand why “Feng Wu” could be so conceited. She was genuinely frightened.","But soon, she could think straight again.","This wasn’t right. She was supposed to run the show here. Behind her was her mother Empress Dugu and her father Emperor Wu, and all around her were her family members!","How dare “Feng Wu” behave so arrogantly here?!","Jun Wuxia’s eyes lit up. She felt that she had found a way to kill Feng Wu.","Since “Feng Wu” had lost her temper, she would provoke “her” and make her angrier.","At that thought, Jun Wuxia pushed Granny Yue and Yulian away, and charged at “Feng Wu.”","However, she didn’t know that this “Feng Wu” was actually the person she feared the most.","Ignorance could make one fearless. Thus, Jun Wuxia felt very brave right now.","She pointed at “Feng Wu” and ranted, “Feng Wu, you killed Zuo Qingyu, and you wanted to kill me! I saw it with my own eyes! You’re going to pay for what you did!”","Clang!","Jun Wuxia took a dagger out of her sleeve and tried to stab “Feng Wu” in the heart.","She wanted to kill “Feng Wu” to get revenge herself.","Neither Emperor Wu nor Empress Dugu tried to stop her.","Jun Linyuan’s eyes flickered.","He was furious.","It wasn’t because Jun Wuxia had disrespected him but because of how they treated Feng Wu.","What would they do if he wasn’t here?","Seeing that “Feng Wu” was angry, Jun Wuxia smirked. “You’re a murderer! You have no right to be angry! Die!”","As she spoke, she struck at Jun Linyuan’s chest with her dagger.","Jun Linyuan didn’t try to parry. Instead, he raised his arm.","“Hm...”","Before Jun Wuxia realized it, her neck was in Jun Linyuan’s hands.","His grip then tightened, and Jun Wuxia almost couldn’t breathe.","“Stop!”","Everyone was shocked.","Empress Dugu and Emperor Wu cried out together.","Even Feng Wu was frightened.","She knew that Jun Linyuan was angry, but she didn’t expect that he would try to kill someone. Jun Wuxia was the emperor’s daughter and a princess of the empire. He couldn’t kill her in front of everyone!","She kept giving Jun Linyuan warning glances, but Jun Linyuan simply ignored her.","“Feng Wu has lost her mind! Help! Help the princess!”","Empress Dugu watched as “Feng Wu” lifted Jun Wuxia by the neck.","The grip around Jun Wuxia’s neck was so tight that Jun Wuxia was about to pass out.","She struggled involuntarily.","Soon, her face turned purple.","Empress Dugu almost fainted.","Seeing this, the guards rushed over to kill “Feng Wu.”","Feng Wu frowned.","Jun Linyuan was using her body now and only had limited capability. If he was injured, she would be the one to suffer the injury in the end."]},{"number":2161,"title":"Chapter 2161","paragraphs":["At that thought, Feng Wu activated her spiritual essence and struck out.","Thump!","The dozen or so guards who were charging at “Feng Wu” flew backward, as if they had run into a wall.","Feng Wu couldn’t control all of Jun Linyuan’s power and had overdone it slightly...","The entire courtyard almost collapsed, and all the guards were knocked out.","Emperor Wu was furious.","He had no idea that things would get out of hand.","Without thinking, Emperor Wu grabbed “Feng Wu’s” arm and injected his spiritual essence into “her” body.","He wanted to damage her energy channels and make her implode.","Although Emperor Wu wasn’t as capable as Jun Linyuan was, he was much more powerful than Feng Wu.","Therefore, when he put his hand on Jun Linyuan’s arm, Feng Wu walked to his side and put a hand on his arm.","It was a blatant threat.","Feng Wu made it very clear that if Emperor Wu injured Jun Linyuan, there would be consequences.","Emperor Wu glared at Feng Wu. “Jun Linyuan, how dare you?!”","Feng Wu smirked. “Why are you so surprised?”","It was obvious that Emperor Wu was trying to kill “Feng Wu”; of course, Feng Wu wouldn’t let him.","Emperor Wu was furious.","“Jun Linyuan, have you lost your mind? Why are you still protecting her? She wanted to kill your sister!”","Feng Wu smirked. “Anyone would feel angry when they’re wronged; she’s only overreacting a little. Your Majesty, don’t be so upset.”","Emperor Wu was infuriated.","Overreacting a little?","“She” had tried to kill a princess!","Emperor Wu had never felt so confused before.","“Jun Linyuan! You’ve lost your mind! Let go of me!” Emperor Wu bellowed.","Feng Wu snorted. “I won’t let anyone touch her, not even Your Majesty. Plus, she was wronged!”","That was a very straightforward statement.","She had her own plan, since she had a feeling that she and Jun Linyuan would soon switch back to their own bodies. When that happened, it wouldn’t be that easy for her to play tricks.","Therefore, she had to let everyone know that Feng Wu was under Jun Linyuan’s protection. That way, the others would have to think twice before they tried to do something to Feng Wu.","She didn’t notice that when she said that, the crown prince glanced at her.","Emperor Wu was too furious to notice it either.","He snorted. “She was wronged? By whom? How? Explain it to me!","“She has to release your sister first! If anything happens to Wuxia, I’ll kill the entire Feng clan!”","Feng Wu’s stomach lurched.","She couldn’t care less about Feng Yanfeng and his family, but her mother and brother were at home as well. She didn’t want them to become fugitives."]},{"number":2162,"title":"Chapter 2162","paragraphs":["At that thought, Feng Wu let go of Emperor Wu.","Emperor Wu let go of Jun Linyuan as well.","Feng Wu tugged at Jun Linyuan’s sleeve, trying to give him a hint that it was time for her to take over.","Jun Linyuan took the hint and let her do the rest.","Thump!","Without warning, Jun Linyuan dropped his sister.","Caught off guard, Jun Wuxia fell on her bottom, and the pain brought tears to her eyes.","Before she realized it, Feng Wu was by her side. “Jun Wuxia, did you really see Feng Wu kill Zuo Qingyu?”","Jun Wuxia gasped for air. For a moment, she thought she was going to die.","But before she could breathe normally, her “brother” was questioning her.","That was the longest sentence “he” had ever said to her.","Therefore, Jun Wuxia was frightened once more.","She knew that the crown prince was on Feng Wu’s side, which made her want to cry, but she was too scared to cry...","“Speak!” Feng Wu stared at her.","Jun Linyuan’s grim face was one of the scariest images in Jun Wuxia’s memory, and that fear hadn’t faded as she grew older.","“I...” Jun Wuxia didn’t dare stall. She rubbed her neck and said in a hoarse voice, “Yes... I saw Feng Wu kill Zuo Qingyu with my own eyes. I’m not lying!”","No one knew that better than Feng Wu.","She looked around and saw that more and more people had arrived.","Master Dugu, Master Zuo, and Lord Mu were all here. Even the empress dowager was here.","With them looking on, Feng Wu would never admit that she was the one who killed Zuo Qingyu. She needed to exonerate herself.","Only four people were there. Zuo Qingyu was dead, and Qiuling was on her side. All she needed to do was prove that Jun Wuxia was lying.","Feng Wu racked her brain. Suddenly, her eyes lit up.","She stared at Jun Wuxia. “What did Zuo Qingyu or you do to make Feng Wu want to kill you?”","Feng Wu knew that given Jun Wuxia’s personality, she would try to completely absolve herself.","She would never admit that they had wanted to kill Qiuling.","And that was the trap Feng Wu set for Jun Wuxia.","She was right!","As Feng Wu expected, Jun Wuxia did exactly that. She shrugged and said innocently, “I didn’t do anything. I don’t know why Feng Wu was mad at us.”","Feng Wu smiled. “If that’s true, then why did she want to kill you?”","Jun Wuxia said, “Feng Wu and Zuo Qingyu had grudges against each other. When Feng Wu found an opportunity in the tombs, of course, she would grab it.”","Feng Wu frowned. “Are you sure that you did nothing wrong?”","Jun Wuxia gave Jun Linyuan a terrified glance."]},{"number":2163,"title":"Chapter 2163","paragraphs":["Jun Wuxia couldn’t tell them that she had tried to kill Qiuling. She had been insisting that she hadn’t done anything wrong. If she admitted it now, they would think that she had been lying.","At that thought, Jun Wuxia shook her head solemnly. “No, we didn’t do anything.”","Feng Wu smirked. “Jun Wuxia, do you know that I can see what you did and what you’re going to do in the future?”","Jun Wuxia said, “What?”","Feng Wu pulled a hair off Jun Wuxia’s head and pretended to listen to it.","Jun Wuxia was dumbfounded.","What was her “brother” doing?","Everyone else was as perplexed as she was. No one understood what “Jun Linyuan” was doing.","Feng Wu smirked and said, “You bullied a girl in a green dress, didn’t you?”","What?","Jun Wuxia stared at her in disbelief.","How did “he” know that?","Was “he” clairvoyant?","Jun Wuxia was frightened.","She suddenly recalled what “Jun Linyuan” said earlier about “him” being able to see what she had done before. So, did “he” see how she and Zuo Qingyu had abused Qiuling?","Seeing that she couldn’t keep up her lie, Jun Wuxia said anxiously, “I... I lied. You’re right. We bullied Qiuling...”","“As in Feng Wu’s maid.” Feng Wu snorted.","Jun Wuxia said, “Yes, she’s Feng Wu’s maid.”","Feng Wu asked, “Was that all you did?”","Jun Wuxia was even more shocked.","Was “he” even human? Why did “he” know everything?","Jun Wuxia was capable of lying to anyone except for Jun Linyuan, because he made her nervous.","Therefore, she said uneasily, “Yes... We did that, but it was mainly Zuo Qingyu. She hated Feng Wu, so when she saw that Feng Wu’s maid was alone, she wanted to kill her.”","Everyone looked at Jun Wuxia in surprise.","So, it was true. They had started it.","Empress Dugu pressed her hand to her chest. “Did you really try to kill Qiuling?!”","Jun Wuxia muttered, “She’s just a maid. So what if we killed her?”","Everyone found her statement idiotic.","Qiuling was no longer an ordinary maid now.","“Do you know...” Empress Dugu stared at Jun Wuxia. “Do you know what Qiuling is like now? After she left the tombs, she rose over ten levels in a day. Right now, she’s already a Level 5 Spiritual Elder!”","Someone said gingerly, “She made more breakthroughs already; she’s a Level 7 Spiritual Elder now.”","Ssss!","Everyone drew in their breaths.","Jun Wuxia was the most astonished of them all.","“What?!” Jun Wuxia looked like she had been electrocuted. She stared at Empress Dugu and asked, “Mother, what did you say?”","“You heard me correctly. Qiuling now has an Ultimate Yin Body, and that’s extremely rare. She’s been making such fast progress that... ”","Empress Dugu pointed at Feng Wu. “Qiuling is about as capable as her master now. Many forces want to take her in, but she’s being a fool, and won’t leave Feng Wu.”","But Jun Wuxia didn’t hear her.","All she could hear was that Qiuling was a Level 7 Spiritual Elder now.","“She was only a Level 9 Spiritual Master when I met her. Why so sudden...” Jun Wuxia had gained nothing in the tombs, and she was filled with despair."]},{"number":2164,"title":"Chapter 2164","paragraphs":["Feng Wu was happy that people were praising Qiuling, but her top priority now was still setting Jun Wuxia up.","Therefore, she resumed the subject.","She stared at Jun Wuxia and said, “So, you were lying when you said that Feng Wu tried to kill you for no reason.”","Jun Wuxia said, “I...”","Feng Wu wouldn’t give her any chance to explain herself. “Your lie proves that you’re not trustworthy. Why should anyone believe you?”","Jun Wuxia felt wronged. “But Feng Wu really killed Zuo Qingyu.”","She ran to Mr. and Mrs. Zuo and said loudly, “I swear it! I saw it with my own eyes!”","The couple nodded and glared at “Feng Wu.”","Feng Wu smiled. “Did you say that you saw it with your own eyes?”","Jun Wuxia nodded.","Feng Wu asked, “How capable is Feng Wu?”","Jun Wuxia didn’t want to say nice things about Feng Wu, so she said, “She’s just a little bit better than me.”","Feng Wu asked, “How far were you from Zuo Qingyu?”","Jun Wuxia thought about it and said, “Not very far. She was a little over ten meters away.”","Feng Wu smirked. “If that’s the case, then why didn’t you help Zuo Qingyu?”","Immediately, everyone gave Jun Wuxia strange looks.","That was right. Jun Wuxia and Zuo Qingyu went everywhere together like real sisters. Did Jun Wuxia abandon Zuo Qingyu when she was in danger?","Mr. and Mrs. Zuo also looked surprised.","Jun Wuxia was dumbfounded.","She just didn’t want to admit that Feng Wu was a capable cultivator. Why did it become her fault now?","Jun Wuxia panicked a little.","She said, “My leg was injured. I couldn’t run fast enough to help her!”","Feng Wu nodded. Jun Wuxia had just walked into another trap.","Feng Wu smiled. “So, you were injured.”","Jun Wuxia nodded.","Feng Wu asked, “Tell me what stances Feng Wu used! Now!”","Jun Wuxia was too scared of Jun Linyuan to stall. She searched her memory and said, “Feng Wu... She killed Zuo Qingyu with a single punch.”","Feng Wu didn’t give Jun Wuxia any time to hesitate. She quickly asked, “How fast was she?”","Jun Wuxia had to answer the question. “One second.”","Feng Wu said, “You’re lying!”","Jun Wuxia shouted, “I’m not!”","Feng Wu said, “You said that Feng Wu is only slightly faster than you. How could she kill Zuo Qingyu with a single punch?”","Jun Wuxia said, “I... ”","Jun Wuxia panicked under the pressure.","She was very frustrated.","Had she known that she would have to cover one lie with more lies, she would have told the truth from the very beginning.","She said, “I... Feng Wu probably wasn’t that fast... I feel dizzy... I don’t know what I’m talking about.”","Feng Wu shouted, “You’re lying!”","Jun Wuxia’s stomach lurched. “Why do you say that? I’m not lying.”","Feng Wu smirked. “Is Feng Wu a lot more capable than you or just a little?”","Jun Wuxia became more and more confused."]},{"number":2165,"title":"Chapter 2165","paragraphs":["Feng Wu spoke too fast for Jun Wuxia to follow.","Jun Wuxia was so frustrated.","She couldn’t understand what all the fuss was about. No one had questioned her like this before. If it was someone else asking her such questions, she would have lost her temper already. However, looking at “Jun Linyuan’s” frightening face, she didn’t dare object.","Jun Wuxia flinched and made up her mind. “Feng Wu is about as capable as we are. She chased Zuo Qingyu for a while before she killed her.”","Feng Wu nodded. “Alright, I’ll believe you for now. Tell me. Why didn’t she kill you after she killed Zuo Qingyu?”","That rendered Jun Wuxia speechless.","Empress Dugu realized that if “Jun Linyuan” went on pressing Jun Wuxia like this, the girl might break down.","“I object. His Royal Highness is pushing too hard.” Empress Dugu tried to intervene.","“Your...”","Emperor Wu only managed to utter one word before Feng Wu cut him off.","“Overruled!” Feng Wu cast a stern look at Empress Dugu and ignored her. She then went back to questioning Jun Wuxia.","Emperor Wu didn’t know what to say.","Feng Wu asked, “Which of your legs was injured?”","Jun Wuxia said, “My left leg...”","Under Feng Wu’s stare, Jun Wuxia looked as helpless as a bunny. She then said, “No, it was my right leg.”","Feng Wu looked at her in resignation. “Which one was it? Left or right?”","Jun Wuxia shuddered and said, “L- Left.”","Feng Wu then turned to Granny Lan, the empress dowager’s maid. “Granny Lan, please examine the princess’s left leg. See if she’s really injured.”","Jun Wuxia immediately paled.","She had lied again!","There was no injury on her leg.","She forced a smile and said, “That won’t be necessary. I’ve recovered fully already.”","Feng Wu smirked. “If there’s no injury, that means that you’ve lied to us again.”","Jun Wuxia was speechless.","Empress Dugu looked at Jun Wuxia in disappointment.","This was such a great opportunity, but Jun Wuxia had ruined it.","She couldn’t understand how her daughter could be so stupid.","Granny Lan walked to Jun Wuxia’s side and said, “Your Royal Highness, please follow me.”","Jun Wuxia couldn’t let Granny Lan examine her, but “Jun Linyuan” was watching, so she couldn’t throw a tantrum. In the end, she lowered her head and said weakly, “I... I made it up. My leg wasn’t injured.”","Everyone gave her strange looks.","She had revoked her statements so many times that everyone now doubted everything she said.","“But Feng Wu really killed Zuo Qingyu! She tried to kill me, too! I’m not lying!” Jun Wuxia was almost in tears.","She was telling the truth.","That was exactly what happened.","Somehow, her “brother,” who could see the past, wouldn’t believe her. Jun Wuxia felt helpless.","Feng Wu looked at Jun Wuxia and said coldly, “If Feng Wu could kill you, why didn’t she?”","Jun Wuxia said angrily, “She wanted to, but she didn’t have time! She ran away when she heard the footsteps of my brother and Zuo Qingxian!”"]},{"number":2166,"title":"Chapter 2166","paragraphs":["Feng Wu laughed. “Didn’t you just say that she’s a lot more capable than you? She should still have enough time to run away after killing you.”","Jun Wuxia said, “She’s not a lot more capable than me! She’s just slightly better.”","“Are you sure?”","Jun Wuxia said, “I’ll take responsibility for everything I say! My brother can be my witness!”","Feng Wu said, “Bring Jun Linshen here!”","Gao glanced at Emperor Wu.","Emperor Wu nodded, and Gao left in a hurry.","Jun Linshen had been locked up after he made a fool of himself in front of the “crown prince.”","The real Jun Linyuan glanced at Feng Wu and looked pleased.","He didn’t expect the girl to be so bold.","She had been so intimidating when she questioned Jun Wuxia and had successfully carried Empress Dugu and Emperor Wu away with her logic.","Not everyone could do that.","“She knows what she’s doing,” Jun Linyuan thought.","Feng Wu had no idea what Jun Linyuan was thinking. All she wanted to do was convince everyone that Jun Wuxia was a liar. That way, no one would believe anything she said.","She had been quite successful so far. After all the questioning, Jun Wuxia had pretty much lost her credibility.","Jun Linshen soon arrived.","“Jun Linyuan’s” presence both infuriated and intimidated him.","Feng Wu asked him, “Did you see with your own eyes Feng Wu kill Zuo Qingyu in the tombs?”","On any other day, Jun Linshen would have said yes, but what happened the day before had taught him a lesson. He shook his head and said, “No, I didn’t.”","Feng Wu said, “Tell us what you saw.”","Jun Linshen felt like a prisoner and wanted to retort, but when he saw the eager look in everyone’s eyes, he knew he couldn’t stall.","He felt speechless.","He was also the emperor’s son, but why was he being questioned by Jun Linyuan? Why did people think that was the natural way of things?","Although he didn’t like it, there was nothing he could do. He had to answer the question if he still wanted to be a prince.","In order not to enrage Jun Linyuan, Jun Linshen had to fight back his frustration, and he described what he had seen.","He concluded, “My sister was unconscious when Zuo Qingxian and I arrived, and the culprit was gone. We didn’t see who it was.”","Jun Wuxia shouted, “It was Feng Wu! I saw it!”","Jun Linshen gave it some thought, then shook his head. “Not necessarily.”","Jun Wuxia stared at him. “Why won’t you take my side?”","Jun Linshen wanted to, but he couldn’t afford to make any more mistakes. Otherwise, he wouldn’t just be imprisoned; he might actually be expelled from the royal family.","This time, Empress Dugu supported Jun Linshen.","After all, he was a son, while Jun Wuxia was only a daughter.","“Wuxia, be reasonable.” Empress Dugu gave Jun Wuxia a stern look.","Jun Wuxia bit her lower lip and was speechless.","She felt that the world had turned upside down."]},{"number":2167,"title":"Chapter 2167","paragraphs":["Would Feng Wu stop there? Of course not.","She asked Jun Linshen, “Are you saying that neither you nor Zuo Qingxian could catch up to the killer?”","Jun Linshen nodded.","Feng Wu smiled. “We all know that Feng Wu is a Level 7 Spiritual Elder. Do you think it could have been her?”","That was the million-dollar question.","Jun Linshen’s cultivation level was much more advanced",", not to mention that Zuo Qingxian had been with him. If neither of them could catch up to the killer, how could that person be a mere Level 7 Spiritual Elder?","“It couldn’t have been Feng Wu.” Jun Linshen shook his head. “That person was very fast and almost as capable as we are.”","Poor Jun Linshen. He didn’t know that Feng Wu had had the white fairy as her guide.","“Brother!” Jun Wuxia cried out and stared at Jun Linshen in disbelief.","Jun Linshen didn’t feel guilty at all.","He was only telling the truth. Moreover, why shouldn’t he protect his own reputation?","But what he said confirmed Feng Wu’s claim that Jun Wuxia was a liar. No one would believe anything she said anymore.","Since that was the case, her accusation of Feng Wu killing Zuo Qingyu and trying to kill her would no longer hold.","But Jun Wuxia wouldn’t give up. She stared at Feng Wu and asked, “If Feng Wu wasn’t the killer, then who killed Zuo Qingyu? Who was the person who tried to kill me?”","Immediately, all eyes were on Feng Wu.","Feng Wu said calmly, “He was a spy of the Dongsang Kingdom.”","“What?” Jun Wuxia was dumbfounded.","She knew nothing about such spies.","She shook her head. “No, there was no spy. It had to be Feng Wu! I swear!”","But Feng Wu ignored her because no one would listen to Jun Wuxia anymore.","Feng Wu said, “The information on the spies of the Dongsang Kingdom is classified, but with everything that has happened, I have to tell you: There were Dongsang spies in the tombs.”","Emperor Wu stared at her. “How can you be so sure?”","Feng Wu said, “Because of the Seed of the Spirit Source.”","Emperor Wu asked, “Who has it now?”","Feng Wu glanced at him and said, “I do.”","Everyone stared at her.","So, it was the crown prince. That wasn’t unexpected. With the crown prince in the tombs, of course, no one else would be able to find it.","Feng Wu said, “But that seed was poisoned.”","Jun Wuxia was furious. She decided that the crown prince was talking nonsense. There was no Seed of the Spirit Source.","She summoned up her courage and gave Feng Wu a shove. “Don’t you know how to read the past? Take my hair and watch again! I’m not lying!”","However —","The impact made Feng Wu cough loudly.","She went on coughing.","In the end, she spat out a mouthful of blood.","The coughing brought color to her cheeks, making “Jun Linyuan” look rather vulnerable..."]},{"number":2168,"title":"Chapter 2168","paragraphs":["She looked like she was about to die, and didn’t look as intimidating as before.","Emperor Wu was shocked.","He had never thought that there would be a day when “Jun Linyuan” would look so weak.","“What’s wrong with you?” Emperor Wu wasn’t used to seeing his son like this, and his voice was full of concern.","Jun Wuxia was stunned, and she looked at her hands in disbelief.","Did she do that to her brother?","The empress dowager was the most worried of them all.","She had been watching on the side, but somehow, things began to go wrong.","She threw away the praying beads in her hands and nervously ran toward Feng Wu. “Junjun! What’s wrong, Junjun?! You’re scaring me! Talk to me!”","“Grandma, I...” Jun Wuxia wanted to explain, but the empress dowager glared at her.","“Take her down!” the empress dowager ordered.","She held Feng Wu in her arms, fearing that her “grandson” was going to die.","Feng Wu sighed inwardly. The old lady was really biased toward Jun Linyuan, and she wasn’t afraid to show it.","She didn’t want to mislead the old lady, but Jun Linyuan told her to do it, so what choice did she have?","She had to play her part.","“ Ahem ... I’m fine. I just need some rest.” Feng Wu’s face was flushed from all the coughing.","“Bring Master Chu here!” the empress dowager shouted.","Soon, Master Chu arrived.","Everyone watched Master Chu eagerly and wondered what was wrong with the crown prince. Why was he suddenly so fragile? What happened to that formidable crown prince?","No one knew what was going on.","When the empress dowager turned around to see that all the officials were still here, she frowned.","“Jun Linyuan’s” condition had been exposed by Jun Wuxia, which already frustrated the empress dowager. However, these people showed no consideration and were still hovering around.","The empress dowager said angrily, “What are you waiting for? A dinner invitation?”","Master Dugu and Master Zuo looked at each other with bitter smiles, and they left after that.","With the two leaders gone, the rest of them didn’t dare to stay either, so they scattered as well.","However, were they really gone?","Would that stop the news from spreading?","The empress dowager didn’t have time to think about anything else. All she cared about was “Jun Linyuan.”","“Master Chu, you’re a great doctor. What’s wrong with Junjun?” the empress dowager asked nervously.","Emperor Wu didn’t ask any questions, but he listened intently as well, fearing that he might miss out on some important information.","Master Chu frowned after he checked “Jun Linyuan’s” pulse. “I think it’s the effect of poison, but I’m not very sure... Hold on!”","Even Master Chu could barely detect the poison, and he couldn’t understand why it had such a strong effect on the “crown prince.”","So, he decided to give that task to Feng Wu.","“Miss Feng Wu, you’re an amazing doctor. How about you take a look?” Master Chu smiled at “Feng Wu.”","The empress dowager frowned when she saw that “Feng Wu” was also here."]},{"number":2169,"title":"Chapter 2169","paragraphs":["If she could, she would tell “Feng Wu” to go away, but she needed “her” now.","Did the empress dowager trust Feng Wu’s medical skills? In fact, she did, more than anyone else, because the girl had cured her difficult medical condition with a single diagnosis.","But she simply didn’t like the girl around her grandson, nor did she want her Junjun to pay too much attention to one woman.","He was going to be the emperor one day. He needed to focus on the big picture!","Her late husband used to say that if Jun Linyuan became the emperor one day, he would unify the entire continent and become the greatest ruler ever.","That was one of the reasons why the empress dowager doted on Jun Linyuan.","She stared at “Feng Wu” and frowned.","But “Feng Wu” was really Jun Linyuan, and it was the first time that he realized what Feng Wu had to endure.","No one liked her, from the royal family to her own family members. The Zuo family couldn’t wait to kill her.","She didn’t do anything, but all these people wanted her dead.","She also had to protect her mother, her brother, her maids, and her servants...","She was too young to shoulder all the pressure.","The crown prince wasn’t the sympathetic sort, but he felt sorry for Feng Wu at that moment. He pursed his lips and decided that he would pick on the girl less often in the future.","“Feng Wu?!” The empress dowager called “Feng Wu” several times, but “she” didn’t respond, which upset the empress dowager.","Jun Linyuan heard her this time and looked up.","He shifted his gaze and looked at the old lady with cold eyes.","The empress dowager felt a chill run down her spine.","She couldn’t understand why the “girl” looked so intimidating.","That look almost reminded her of her grandson.","Jun Linyuan walked up to Feng Wu, quickly checked her pulse, and said, “She’s been poisoned by the Magic Soul Vine.”","The empress dowager wasn’t impressed. How could “Feng Wu” look so careless?","She was about to scold “Feng Wu,” when Master Chu said, “That’s right! Yes! That’s why it felt so familiar! Why didn’t I think of that? It’s the poison of the Magic Soul Vine!”","The empress dowager frowned and stared at Master Chu. “Are you sure?”","Emperor Wu frowned. “The closest military town of the Dongsang Kingdom to us is called Magic Soul Vine City! The Magic Soul Vine is the plant that protects the city.","“It’s a very powerful plant. The entire city is under its protection.","“It’s also highly poisonous, and it’s a neurotoxin as well. One can’t just shake it off.","“Once it invades a person’s body, it can turn one into an idiot or kill them!”","Emperor Wu stared at Feng Wu and asked in a trembling voice, “Is that true? Were you really poisoned by the Magic Soul Vine?”","This was also Feng Wu’s first time hearing of the Magic Soul Vine’s origin. Why hadn’t Jun Linyuan told her more about it?","“Am I going to die?” Feng Wu frowned.","Jun Linyuan said grumpily, “Only the stupid will die. You’ll live.”","With that, Feng Wu felt reassured.","But not Emperor Wu!","Although he usually just shouted at Jun Linyuan, and neither of them would give in..."]},{"number":2170,"title":"Chapter 2170","paragraphs":["If Emperor Wu had to be honest, Jun Linyuan was the son he was the most proud of.","At that thought, Emperor Wu asked Jun Linyuan, “Can you treat him?”","Jun Linyuan said, “I can try.”","Emperor Wu suddenly said, “If you can cure the crown prince, I’ll let him marry you!”","What?","Before Jun Linyuan could say anything, Feng Wu was stunned.","Marriage?","Between her and Jun Linyuan?!","She had no intention to do that at all!","“That’s wonderful news! They’ll be a lovely couple!” Master Chu laughed.","Feng Wu rolled her eyes. No, there would be no couple whatsoever.","Before she could protest, the empress dowager said impatiently, “We don’t have time for this! Get on with the treatment already!”","Feng Wu said, “That’s right.”","The empress dowager patted Feng Wu and was pleased that her “grandson” was with her.","Jun Linyuan glanced at Feng Wu with a meaningful look in his eyes.","“How do you treat that poison?” the empress dowager asked Jun Linyuan.","Jun Linyuan said directly, “Your Majesty, please don’t worry. I’ll cure her.”","After that, he took Feng Wu’s hand and tried to lead her away.","“You disrespectful girl!” The empress dowager was furious, and she complained to Emperor Wu, “I intervened in her marriage, and she’s giving me attitude now! I’ll never let Junjun marry her!”","Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan could still hear the empress dowager’s angry complaint as they walked away.","Feng Wu didn’t say anything.","Jun Linyuan looked unhappy when they returned to his place.","But Feng Wu failed to notice it.","Not only that, she also said happily, “Can you tell me now why you wanted me to pretend that I’m sick? My body is the one that was poisoned. Did you expose yourself on purpose so that people could come to kill you?”","She shrugged. “To be honest with you, I can’t master your spiritual essence yet, and I’m terrible at exerting it. I can’t do any stances, nor can I carry your Sky Destroyer...”","She couldn’t stop complaining.","She felt like a three-year-old in front of an open vault. Although it was filled with treasure, she couldn’t carry any away with her.","She didn’t realize how unhappy Jun Linyuan was and was lost in her imagination. “You let out the news deliberately. Aren’t you worried that people from the Dongsang Kingdom will try to kill you?","“Everyone knows that you’re like the Chosen One and will unify the continent one day. If you really become the emperor, how desperate would the Dongsang Kingdom feel?","“Therefore, compared with killing your father, they would rather assassinate you. With you dead, the Junwu Empire won’t have a future.","“If I were from the Dongsang Kingdom, I’d try my best to kill you!","“Now that I’m in your body, I want to hide from as many people as possible, but you’re trying to tell people that you’re weak... Do you have a death wish?”","The crown prince glanced at Feng Wu and snorted.","That made Feng Wu angry."]},{"number":2171,"title":"Chapter 2171","paragraphs":["“I’m only analyzing the situation for you. Why are you angry? Jun Linyuan, I didn’t know that you were so petty.”","Jun Linyuan’s face darkened, and he rose to his feet.","That wouldn’t do!","But Feng Wu felt that begging him all the time was too humiliating.","Therefore, Feng Wu stopped trying. She let Jun Linyuan walk away, and followed him like his tail.","As long as there were less than ten steps between them, things would be fine.","Jun Linyuan walked angrily in the front, and Feng Wu casually followed him.","But that wasn’t how Jun Linyuan felt.","He was so angry that he wanted to kick the girl in the butt.","However, the cool breeze cleared his head. Turning around, he saw his little tail.","When he quickened his pace, she jogged behind him.","When he slowed down, she strolled casually.","They were exactly ten steps apart.","Was she worried that he would run off?","At that thought, the crown prince didn’t feel frustrated anymore.","He slowed down so that she could catch up to him.","As expected —","The girl quickly ran to his side. If she had a tail, she would be wagging it now.","He was right!","As soon as Jun Linyuan stopped, Feng Wu quickly ran to his side and grinned at him.","Jun Linyuan wanted to squeeze her cheeks, but when he raised his hands...","He realized that he was looking at his own face.","Seeing that adorable look on his face...","The proud crown prince couldn’t stand it.","“I have to get my body back as soon as possible,” Jun Linyuan thought.","They headed south.","It was an uneventful journey, almost as if Jun Linyuan hadn’t revealed anything important to his enemies.","But Feng Wu knew that it was only the calm before the storm.","For her, the most important thing right now was finding the spies, since they were almost back at the imperial capital.","The ninth trial was almost over.","Feng Wu was so excited that she thought her heart was going to jump out of her chest.","However, Jun Linyuan didn’t know that. Otherwise, he would probably want to kill her.","“We’re almost back at the capital. Why aren’t they making any moves yet?” Feng Wu pouted and looked at Jun Linyuan.","“We’ve entered Jingyang Province now,” Jun Linyuan said. “This is the Zuo family’s territory, so we have to be very careful from now on.”","“The Zuo family?” Feng Wu was confused. “Aren’t they in the imperial capital?”","Jun Linyuan shook his head. “The empire consists of 13 provinces, which are secretly controlled by nine major clans and four forces respectively. The Zuo family is in charge of Jingyang.”","Feng Wu said, “Is the Zuo family that powerful?”","Jun Linyuan nodded. “What you see in the capital is just the tip of the iceberg. The real Zuo family is well-connected beyond your imagination.","“Of course, the provinces are still controlled by the empire, but the big families have been developing their power in the provinces over so many generations that they have fingers in every pie through marriage. The Zuo family is one such family.”","Feng Wu asked, “What about the other 12 provinces?”"]},{"number":2172,"title":"Chapter 2172","paragraphs":["Jun Linyuan nodded.","Feng Wu asked, “And His Majesty just let their power grow?”","Jun Linyuan said, “Old habits die hard.”","Feng Wu knew that when Jun Linyuan became the emperor, things would change for the big families.","Jun Linyuan said, “You’ll have time to find out more about that. We’re about to reach One Line Cliff. It’s a dangerous spot because there are mountains on both sides, and the ravine is only wide enough for a single carriage to go through. If someone stands on top of the mountains and throws big rocks down at us, it’ll be very dangerous.”","The look on Feng Wu’s face turned serious.","Jun Linyuan said, “I think someone is going to take the bait.”","Hearing that they would be expecting a battle, Feng Wu clenched her fists.","Seeing this, Jun Linyuan smiled. “What? Are you scared?”","Feng Wu rolled her eyes at him. “Of course I am. If an assassination is really going to happen, I’m the one they’re going to attack. I can’t fight like you, and they’ll kill me!”","Jun Linyuan studied her face. Suddenly, he pulled her to his side and whispered, “If we hadn’t swapped bodies, would you have stayed by my side?”","Thinking of the ninth trial, Feng Wu immediately said, “Yes, I would.”","“Good.”","Jun Linyuan leaned closer and kissed her gently on the mouth.","Feng Wu’s head spun. Then —","Wait!","She looked down at her hands and saw that they were fair and soft. They were her own hands!","Wow!","She immediately took out her mirror.","The face she saw in the mirror was that of a pretty girl.","Feng Wu was thrilled. She was herself again!","She didn’t know how to describe her excitement.","Roar —","She wanted to run out of the carriage to celebrate her “recovery.”","But she couldn’t.","She was still on the ninth trial.","She had to stay within ten steps of Jun Linyuan.","No one knew how much she had to endure because of that.","But today was her lucky day.","Ding —","The fairy said, “The ninth trial is over.”","Wow!","Feng Wu was over the moon.","Ahhh —","Hearing that, Feng Wu ran out of the carriage, jumped onto Feng Xun’s horse, and dashed off.","The wind chilled her to the bone, but she still opened her arms in excitement.","This was what freedom felt like.","Without the ninth trial, Feng Wu felt that the sky was her limit.","She had never been an extrovert, but being forced to stay close to Jun Linyuan was still more than she could take.","This entire time, she didn’t have time to go back to her own tent, and had no idea how Chaoge and Qiuling were doing.","Because Jun Linyuan was the crown prince, his carriage was at the front.","Feng Wu’s carriage was near the back of the convoy.","She wanted to see Chaoge now, but the road was too narrow for her to go through. In the end, she had to get off the horse and go back to Jun Linyuan’s carriage."]},{"number":2173,"title":"Chapter 2173","paragraphs":["Jun Linyuan looked into Feng Wu’s eyes and poked her head. “You lazy butt. Why didn’t you want to run around before?”","Feng Wu glared at Jun Linyuan. “Who are you calling a lazy butt?”","Jun Linyuan found her amusing. “Aren’t I right? You hardly ever left the carriage.”","Feng Wu wanted to smack Jun Linyuan on the head.","Why did he think that happened? He had been cultivating in the carriage all the time. With the ninth trial still running, where could she possibly go?","But she couldn’t tell him that.","Jun Linyuan looked at the pouting girl and was pleased. “You’ve been following me everywhere. Anyone would think that you really are my maid.”","Just then, the carriage stopped moving.","Feng Wu stuck out her head and saw that they had reached a clearing that was suitable to make camp.","Emperor Wu seemed to have noticed that the journey was getting dangerous, and wanted to slow down.","Feng Wu didn’t care about that. She immediately started packing.","She had accumulated quite a few things here, since she had lived with Jun Linyuan for many days.","The crown prince was surprised when he saw the girl start putting things into a bundle. “What are you doing?”","Feng Wu tied up the bundle, threw it over her shoulder, and raised her chin. She waved goodbye at Jun Linyuan and walked away without looking back at him.","The crown prince was shocked.","Was she really leaving?","Jun Linyuan shook his head. No, she had done this before, but she always ran back to him before she took ten steps. Therefore, he decided that she wouldn’t leave him.","At that thought, he went on reading his book and didn’t try to stop her.","Five, four, three, two, one!","She must have returned!","But when he looked up, Feng Wu was nowhere to be seen!","He was usually a calm man, but he was shocked.","“Wow, Boss Jun, I saw little Feng Wu run away with a bundle. Did you have a fight?”","Feng Xun came to Jun Linyuan as soon as he got off his horse.","No matter how hard Feng Wu tried to mimic Jun Linyuan, she still wasn’t him, and people would notice the difference.","Feng Xun thought that “Boss Jun” had been much more friendly recently and wasn’t as easily offended.","Therefore, he took every chance to strike up a conversation.","But today...","As soon as he stepped into the tent, he realized that something had changed.","That serious and strict Boss Jun was back.","As expected, the first thing Jun Linyuan said was —","“Feng Xun, do you want to get your ass kicked?”","Feng Xun cleared his throat and dashed off. “I’ll go find us some fruit!”","While Feng Xun fled from Jun Linyuan, Feng Wu went back to her own tent.","People had already started gossiping.","“Look, Feng Wu has moved out of His Royal Highness’s tent.”","“That should teach you a lesson. Don’t be a second Feng Wu.”","“What do you mean?”","“The Feng clan doesn’t know how to properly bring up their children. That girl has been following His Royal Highness around without permission. That’ll only ruin her reputation!”"]},{"number":2174,"title":"Chapter 2174 - Untitled","paragraphs":["“I heard that she accompanied His Royal Highness around the clock, even at night.”","“If she keeps doing that, she might get pregnant soon.”","“She can’t do that! His Royal Highness doesn’t have a wife yet! A maid can’t give His Royal Highness his first child!”","Feng Wu frowned as she listened.","“Shut up, all of you!”","Chaoge ran out of her tent with a sword in her hand. She then threatened the gossiping women. “If I hear one more word out of your mouth, I’m going to kill you!”","Of course, these women were only maids and servants. The noble ladies wouldn’t have worded it so explicitly.","Everyone seemed to know how fearless Chaoge was. When she came out with the sword, those people scattered immediately.","“Stop! Stop right there! I’m going to kill you!” Duan Chaoge stomped her foot.","Hahaha...","Feng Wu saw this from behind a tree and laughed loudly.","“Who’s there?!” Chaoge looked in her direction.","She was excited to see Feng Wu at first, but when Feng Wu wanted to run to her side, Chaoge snorted, threw the sword over her shoulder, and stormed off.","Shocked, Feng Wu ran after her.","Chaoge only picked up speed.","Feng Wu grabbed her sleeve and said, “Duan Chaoge, what are you doing?”","Chaoge brushed her hand off and walked even faster.","Feng Wu didn’t say anything.","It seemed that Chaoge was really angry.","And she had every reason to be.","To finish the ninth trial, Feng Wu had been staying with Jun Linyuan the whole time and hadn’t seen Chaoge even once. Even if she did see her, she had to follow Jun Linyuan when he walked away.","Feng Wu didn’t like how Jun Linyuan acted.","And she understood why Chaoge was angry at her.","However, Chaoge still cared about her. Otherwise, she wouldn’t have defended her.","At that thought, Feng Wu smiled and quickly followed her. “Hey, Chaoge, are you really mad at me?”","Chaoge didn’t answer.","Feng Wu quietly tied their sleeves together.","When Chaoge tried to throw her off again, she saw that their sleeves had been tied together, and was frustrated.","Glaring at Feng Wu, she wanted to cut off her sleeve.","Feng Wu said, “Do that and we won’t be friends anymore!”","Hearing that, Chaoge glared at Feng Wu and grunted.","Feng Wu smiled. She knew that Chaoge wasn’t really angry. She was only being grumpy.","“I had a hard time as well.” Feng Wu tried to explain to Chaoge. “You know, I don’t like Jun Linyuan...”","“You don’t?” Chaoge smirked. “Then why were you following him around and staying with him? You didn’t even come back here!”","She poked Feng Wu’s forehead. “You’re a decent girl! Do you want to ruin your reputation?”"]},{"number":2175,"title":"Chapter 2175 - Untitled","paragraphs":["“Yes, you’re engaged, and that marriage agreement still counts, but can’t you tell that no one from the royal family approves of it? I don’t think your uncle will let it happen either.","“As for His Royal Highness, do you think he’ll treat you like this if he really thinks of you as his future wife? He doesn’t respect you at all!”","...","Feng Wu couldn’t retort and could only listen to Chaoge in silence.","Because she knew that Chaoge only said those things because she cared about her.","Chaoge lowered her voice when she finally got tired from talking. Feng Wu took out a bottle of water and put it in her hand. “Here, have some water.”","Chaoge was still angry, but Feng Wu ignored her frustration. She unplugged the bottle and made Chaoge drink it, splashing water everywhere.","“I can drink the water on my own.”","Chaoge didn’t know what to do with Feng Wu when she was like this. No matter what she said, Feng Wu would only smile at her. She couldn’t stay mad at Feng Wu and had said all she needed to say.","Feng Wu took Chaoge’s hand and said seriously, “Don’t worry. I know what I’m doing. Right now, I need Jun Linyuan’s help.”","Duan Chaoge said, “Really?”","Feng Wu chuckled. “We grew up together. You know me. I never force myself to do things I don’t want to.”","Chaoge tilted her head and realized that Feng Wu was right.","Feng Wu had been a smart girl since she was little, and no one had ever been able to make her do things against her will. People often didn’t know what she was up to, but in the end, she would always surprise everyone.","Was she cooking up her own plan again?","Seeing that Feng Wu wasn’t being forced to do anything, Chaoge was pleased. “I know you won’t let me down!”","Feng Wu patted her on the head and said, “Let’s go see Qiuling. I’d like to check your cultivation level.”","Qiuling didn’t lose her temper like Chaoge had.","That was because she knew Feng Wu better and had been with her for much longer. Therefore, she knew that Feng Wu would only follow her own rules.","But that didn’t stop her from worrying. “Miss Wu, please send a message next time. Otherwise, we’ll be so worried.”","Feng Wu scratched her head. She had been so busy with the revival list that she had forgotten to do so.","She told Qiuling about it.","“So, that was why you were with the crown prince: to solve the case!” Chaoge looked enlightened. “You should have told us earlier. That way, I wouldn’t have been mad at you.”","Feng Wu cleared her throat. Solving the case was the tenth trial, and staying by Jun Linyuan’s side was the ninth trial. She blamed the fairy, no, Master Linghu, for everything that had happened.","Feng Wu said, “After its retreat, the Dongsang Kingdom left behind a revival list. Everyone on that list is extremely dangerous. You’re all my friends, so be careful. I may not have time to look after you.”","Chaoge patted her chest proudly. “You don’t need to. I can do a lot of things now. Guess what level I am now?”"]},{"number":2176,"title":"Chapter 2176 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Both Chaoge and Qiuling had made great achievements in the tombs, almost as great as finding the Seed of the Spirit Source.","Feng Wu was surprised by what she saw as well.","Qiuling was a Level 8 Spiritual Elder, and so was Chaoge!","They had made such great progress!","Feng Wu herself was only a Level 7 Spiritual Elder.","Duan Chaoge said, “Xiao Wu, why are you still Level 7? I’m Level 8 already.”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","“Miss, please don’t worry...” Qiuling tried to comfort her.","Feng Wu examined her body and smiled. “No, I’m not worried at all.”","Jun Linyuan hadn’t been wasting time.","Not only did he repair her body, he had also refined the Seed of the Spirit Source for her.","There were several sealed white balls in Feng Wu’s dantian.","There were ten in total.","She knew better than anyone else that everything was ready. All she needed to do was find some time to sit down and absorb those balls.","To Feng Wu’s surprise, she found a sapling in her mind. It wasn’t much bigger than a bud and she couldn’t tell what it was.","But she had a feeling that it would turn into a pleasant surprise for her.","She just knew it.","She wanted to say something, but she heard footsteps outside.","“Miss Feng Wu, His Royal Highness urgently wants to see you.” It was Zhao Jia, the guard whom Jun Linyuan had just recruited.","Feng Wu would have refused to go if Jun Linyuan had sent another guard, but Zhao Jia...","She rose to her feet and told the two girls, “I’m off. We’ll talk after we get back to the imperial capital. I’ll have a surprise for you.”","The surprise was none other than the white fairy.","With the white fairy guarding her home, Feng Wu would have nothing to worry about.","Jun Linyuan’s tent was set up on the third nicest spot in the campsite.","Emperor Wu had the best spot at first, but he gave it to the empress dowager and chose the next best instead.","As the crown prince, Jun Linyuan was next in line in terms of priority.","When Feng Wu returned, Jun Linyuan was reading a book, and the person next to him was absent-mindedly flipping through a book as well.","“Your Majesty?”","Feng Wu was surprised to see Emperor Wu.","He frowned when he saw Feng Wu. He then ignored her and turned to Jun Linyuan. “About what you said earlier, is it true?”","Jun Linyuan gave an indifferent nod.","That almost made Emperor Wu lose his temper.","“Jun Linyuan, have you lost your mind? Do you know what that token symbolizes?” he bellowed.","He had felt sorry for Jun Linyuan for a while because of his injury, but this defiant son soon got on his nerves again.","Feng Wu didn’t want to get involved, so she kept her distance and tried not to get noticed.","When Emperor Wu saw Feng Wu, he lost his temper again.","He wanted to leave the tent, but he only took two steps before he turned around and shouted at Jun Linyuan, “That position is the head of the espionage department! Is that not good enough for you?!”"]},{"number":2177,"title":"Chapter 2177 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Jun Linyuan looked up from his book and glanced at Emperor Wu. “The espionage department? Is that supposed to be impressive?”","Emperor Wu was furious. “How dare you belittle the espionage department?!”","Jun Linyuan smirked.","Emperor Wu stared at him. “Don’t tell me you want Qin Mo’s job!”","Jun Linyuan said indifferently, “Qin Mo’s job?”","Emperor Wu shouted, “What? Do you want my throne, then?!”","Jun Linyuan rolled his eyes at him. “That’s the toughest job in the world. Feel free to keep it. I don’t want it.”","Emperor Wu bellowed, “You!”","Jun Linyuan looked at him helplessly. “You’ll get mad at me if I say that I’m interested, but you’re still angry when I tell you that I’m not. Father, what answer do you want to hear?”","That rendered Emperor Wu speechless.","However, he wouldn’t admit his defeat. Instead, he stared at Jun Linyuan and shouted even more loudly, “Where’s the token? Did you lose it?!”","Jun Linyuan darted an indifferent look at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu took the hint and immediately handed the token to Emperor Wu.","Emperor Wu looked from Jun Linyuan to Feng Wu and back to Jun Linyuan. “Did you give the token to the girl?!”","Jun Linyuan said, “You gave it to me, so I think I can decide whom I can give it to. Father, please don’t worry.”","“Don’t worry? If I don’t worry, you’ll give the entire empire away!” Emperor Wu shouted.","He realized that whenever he quarreled with Jun Linyuan, he would end up throwing a tantrum while Jun Linyuan remained perfectly calm.","Emperor Wu rubbed his forehead. “What do you want?”","Jun Linyuan frowned and glanced at him. “Isn’t it obvious?”","Emperor Wu said, “Don’t tell me that you want to give that job to this girl!","“You do realize that the head of the espionage department is equivalent to a lieutenant general in the army. This girl hasn’t even graduated from Imperial College yet. Even if she can get into the Ministry of War one day, she’ll start as a captain and work her way up, but you’re going to make her a general now. Are you kidding me?!”","Hearing that, Feng Wu didn’t like the token in her hands too much.","Jun Linyuan said indifferently, “It’s not time for that yet. I only gave her the token so that she can work on the case more easily.”","“What?!” Emperor Wu couldn’t believe his ears. “What do you mean by ‘yet’? Are you saying that given time, you’ll make her a general?!”","Jun Linyuan shrugged. So what? The girl had more than enough talent for that job.","But he omitted that part so that his father wouldn’t pass out from rage.","“And did you say something about her working on the case?” Emperor Wu glared at Jun Linyuan. “Are you going to let her solve the case?”","Jun Linyuan nodded matter-of-factly.","Emperor Wu thought he was going to pass out. He pointed at Jun Linyuan and shouted, “Do you know how threatening the Dongsang Kingdom’s plan is to us?!”"]},{"number":2178,"title":"Chapter 2178 - Untitled","paragraphs":["“If anything goes wrong, you’ll alert them, and they’ll go into hiding. When that happens, it’ll be next to impossible to catch them again! I can’t bear the thought of having those rats crawling around in my empire.”","Jun Linyuan said, “That’s why we must lure them out.”","Emperor Wu asked, “What do you mean?”","Jun Linyuan said, “You’ll see when the spies are caught.”","When the spies were caught? Emperor Wu snorted. It wasn’t that he hadn’t run investigations; in fact, he had borrowed Qin Mo’s men already. However, the lengthy investigation turned up nothing in the end.","Seeing that Jun Linyuan wouldn’t tell him anything, Emperor Wu became even more frustrated.","He threw a dirty look at Feng Wu. “If you don’t know what to do, don’t get in the way. Just because you have the token doesn’t mean you get to order people around. Without my recognition, you’re just a common girl!”","He then turned to leave.","His maids and eunuchs quickly followed him.","Emperor Wu mumbled, “Even heroes fall for beauties. Jun Linyuan, you’re no exception.”","Once Emperor Wu was gone, Feng Wu handed Jun Linyuan the token and said grumpily, “Take it. It’s not like I want it.”","“With it, you won’t need to kneel when you meet other government officials,” Jun Linyuan said indifferently.","That was very appealing. Feng Wu was intrigued, but such an occasion wouldn’t happen very often, and she might not need to use it after all.","Therefore, Feng Wu still wanted to give the token back.","Jun Linyuan then said something else.","“It’ll protect the people you want to protect, at least on the surface.”","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up.","That was right. The espionage department had a lot of guards, and with this token, she would be able to command them all.","People would fight head over heels for this token.","At that thought, Feng Wu put it into her pocket.","Jun Linyuan smiled a little, but he covered it well and Feng Wu didn’t see it.","When Feng Wu walked out of the tent —","“Miss Feng Wu —”","A voice rang out next to her.","She looked up and saw Zhao Jia.","She remembered this man.","Jun Linyuan had recruited four guards. Three of them were taciturn men that would only speak when they were asked.","But Zhao Jia was different. He was very talkative and would ask Feng Wu for little favors from time to time.","Because of that, Feng Wu knew him well.","“Miss Feng, may I ask for leave?” Zhao Jia asked in a pleading tone.","Feng Wu glanced at him. “What for?”","Zhao Jia said, “I’m from Jingyang Province, and my hometown is nearby. I want to take some time off and pay my family a visit.”","Feng Wu looked up. “You live in this area?”","Zhao Jia said, “Yes. I haven’t been back here in five years, so I thought I could go visit my parents while we’re here.”","Feng Wu frowned. “Aren’t you from the Zhao family? It’s a rather big clan. How come your family lives out here?”","Zhao Jia smiled wryly. “Miss Wu, I’m only from a minor branch of the Zhao family. Because I have some talent, the major branch took me in when I was little. I learned my martial arts there, so people see me as a member of that big clan.”"]},{"number":2179,"title":"Chapter 2179 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Feng Wu nodded. “I see.”","Zhao Jia said, “Then...”","Feng Wu nodded. “If you can come back before we set out tomorrow morning, sure, go ahead.”","Zhao Jia looked pleasantly surprised. “Thank you, my lady!”","Feng Wu waved him off. “Don’t worry about it. By the way, since you grew up here, tell me: what do you do for fun around here?","“This journey has been so exhausting; it would be great if there’s a waterfall nearby.”","Zhao Jia said, “Miss Wu, are you looking for a waterfall? We don’t have that here, but there’s one place that may interest you.”","Feng Wu raised an eyebrow. “Really? Tell me about it.”","Zhao Jia nodded and said, “To the northeast of the cliff is a hot spring. It’s steaming hot all year round and is very beneficial for one’s health.","“Plus, it’s in a great location. It’s right up the cliff, and the water levels off with the side of the cliff so that you can’t see the edge of the spring. You can enjoy the view of everything down below.”","Feng Wu said, “Aren’t you describing an edgeless pool?”","Zhao Jia said, “An edgeless pool?”","He thought about that name and found it very accurate. “Yes, that’s exactly what it is.”","Feng Wu asked, “It’s not easy to find, is it?”","Zhao Jia nodded. “That’s true. If I hadn’t gotten lost in the mountains when I was little, I wouldn’t have found it either.”","Feng Wu rubbed her chin and murmured, “His Royal Highness coughs a lot. Sometimes, the coughing even keeps him awake at night. What if the hot spring can cure him?","“That way, maybe Her Majesty and His Majesty won’t dislike me so much.”","Feng Wu made sure that she was just loud enough for Zhao Jia to hear.","She then waved at Zhao Jia. “I don’t like too much noise. Do you know what I mean?”","Of course, Zhao Jia did. He immediately said, “Would you like me to take you there? I’ll go back home after that. I won’t tell a soul.”","Feng Wu said, “What good will that do? I don’t have any health problems. I need to think of a way to get the crown prince there, but His Royal Highness isn’t easily persuaded... But I know what to do. Wait here.”","Feng Wu then walked into the tent.","The look on Zhao Jia’s face changed immediately. The smile was gone, and he was smirking.","Feng Wu was gone for quite a while.","He was already wondering if Feng Wu had failed, when she came back out.","She waved at Zhao Jia. “Wait for me halfway up the mountain. If Jun Wuxia and Jun Linshen see us, they’ll try to take the hot spring. I don’t want to make a fuss about it.”","Zhao Jia had to follow her orders, so he nodded and quickly went up the mountain.","After he left, Feng Wu turned around and saw Jun Linyuan.","“Come inside.” He then pulled her into the tent.","Feng Wu was perplexed. Why was the crown prince suddenly so serious?","Before she realized it, something cool and soft hit her on the forehead. Feng Wu grabbed it and frowned. “What’s this black thing?”","Jun Linyuan didn’t explain anything. He just ordered, “Take off your clothes.”"]},{"number":2180,"title":"Chapter 2180 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Feng Wu was alarmed and stared at him. “What?”","Jun Linyuan stood up and looked down at her. She looked tiny in comparison.","He shook his head and said grumpily, “What can I possibly do to you? It’s soft armor. Just put it on.”","“Soft armor?” Feng Wu’s eyes lit up. “What exactly is it?”","“Wow!” Just then, she heard someone cry out at the door.","Feng Xun ran into the room and snatched the soft armor out of Feng Wu’s hands. He shouted, “Boss Jun, this isn’t fair!","“You care so much about this armor and won’t even let me touch it. But now, you’re giving it to her! I can’t believe it!” Feng Xun sounded jealous.","Jun Linyuan cast a stern look at Feng Xun. “Shut up!”","Feng Wu examined the soft armor and saw that it was quite small. It was obviously for a woman.","An idea struck her, and she suddenly asked, “Who did this soft armor belong to?”","“Well...” Feng Xun looked up at Jun Linyuan and fell silent.","Feng Wu could feel the temperature around her drop.","She felt that she had said the wrong thing.","But what was it about this soft armor? Did it have something to do with Jun Linyuan’s past?","Somehow, Feng Wu grew curious.","“Put it on!” Jun Linyuan cast a stern look at Feng Xun and gave Feng Wu the order. He then led Feng Xun out of the tent.","Feng Xun asked Jun Linyuan as they walked, “You’re giving the soft armor to her. Are you ready to move on then? Are you finally over it?”","He kept babbling until Jun Linyuan told him to shut up.","Feng Xun said, “Fine...”","Feng Wu didn’t realize how tightly she had clenched her fists. Even her knuckles had turned white.","What was the story behind the armor?","Feng Wu shook her head to get rid of the thought. Her top priority now was to catch the Dongsang spies and finish the tenth trial.","After this, she would only have two tasks left.","Once she finished all twelve tasks, she would have the second broken star piece.","There were only four in total.","She was getting closer to her goal.","Her beautiful master was going to wake up soon, and that should be the happiest thing, but somehow, she felt a heavy weight on her chest and couldn’t smile anymore.","Feng Wu put on the soft armor, rubbed her stiff face, and put on a smile. She then walked out of the tent.","Outside, Jun Linyuan and Feng Xun were ready.","Feng Xun greeted Feng Wu with a smile. “Look after yourself. Don’t get hurt, okay?”","He ran away after that, fearing that Feng Wu might ask him questions.","Feng Wu pretended that she didn’t notice anything and only asked Jun Linyuan, “Does Feng Xun know what he’s doing?”","Jun Linyuan said, “I know what I’m doing. Isn’t that enough?”","Feng Wu chuckled. “You’re right.”","The two of them then walked up the mountain.","Earlier, there had been something inexplicable between them.","But now, Jun Linyuan could tell that something had changed in Feng Wu."]},{"number":2181,"title":"Chapter 2181 - Untitled","paragraphs":["The girl had been very lively and wouldn’t stop asking questions. It felt as if nothing could strike her down.","But now, she was very quiet.","She would still smile back at him, but it wouldn’t be a wholehearted smile. He felt that they were only strangers walking past each other on the street.","He asked her, “Are you nervous?”","Feng Wu looked perplexed.","He wrapped his hand around Feng Wu’s.","“Your hand’s cold.” Jun Linyuan frowned. “What are you worried about? Everything’s been planned out. When the fighting starts, hide behind Feng.”","Feng Wu shook her head. “I’m not nervous.”","Jun Linyuan pinched her nose. “Are you sure?”","Feng Wu beamed at him. “On the contrary, I’m very excited. I can’t wait to see what’s going to happen.”","That was a genuine smile.","Jun Linyuan felt his whole world light up.","He rubbed Feng Wu’s head. “Good! It’s going to be great!”","Zhao Jia was waiting for them halfway up the mountain.","“Your Royal Highness, Miss Wu.” Zhao Jia smiled obsequiously.","Feng Wu looked like she couldn’t suppress her excitement. “Take us there! I want to see the edgeless pool. I’ll sit in the hot spring and enjoy the view! It’s going to be so exciting!”","Zhao Jia smiled and said, “I’m glad that you like the idea. Are you sure this is going to be alright? Shall I bring more guards? We can’t afford to have anything happen to His Royal Highness.”","Feng Wu glared at him. “Nonsense! I’ll kill you if you tell another soul!”","Zhao Jia smiled wryly, “But, my lady...”","Feng Wu waved him off in an arrogant way. “If news gets out, what if His Majesty wants to take a bath? We won’t be able to use the pool then. So, just keep your mouth shut and do as you’re told!”","Zhao Jia had no choice but to say yes.","Feng Wu saw the box he was carrying over his shoulder and asked curiously, “What’s that on your back?”","Zhao Jia whispered, “It’s Red Monkey Wine.”","Feng Wu asked, “What’s that?”","Zhao Jia gloated. “The so-called Monkey Wine comes from the fruit which the monkeys stash away for the winter.","“However, if they have enough food during that season, they’ll forget about all the fruit they stored away.","“The fruit ferments in the tree holes and becomes fruit wine, which is what we call Monkey Wine.","“Red Monkey Wine is made from the fruit collected by red monkeys. They’re the king of the monkeys, and they pick the best fruit. Needless to say, their fruit makes the best wine.","“You can find the normal Monkey Wine in other places, but the Red Monkey Wine is our specialty.”","Zhao Jia patted the wine bottle on his shoulder and chuckled, “You can drink this wine as you sit in the hot spring and enjoy the view. It’ll be wonderful.”","“Wow!” Feng Wu grew very excited. She took Zhao Jia’s hand and said, “I didn’t know that you could be so considerate. I’ll thank you later. I can’t wait to jump into the hot spring.”"]},{"number":2182,"title":"Chapter 2182 - Untitled","paragraphs":["While Feng Wu jumped around in excitement, Jun Linyuan only frowned, as if he was hesitating.","Feng Wu took his arm and smiled at him. “My dear crown prince, just give it a go. If you don’t like it, we can leave right away. How does that sound?”","Jun Linyuan said sternly, “This is the last time.” He then started coughing.","Feng Wu nodded immediately. “Sure, sure.”","The last time? At an angle where no one could see him, Zhao Jia smirked.","Soon, he led them to the hot spring he was talking about.","Feng Wu could see the steam from 100 meters away, and the view was surreal.","She tugged at Jun Linyuan and said in excitement, “Look! Such a hot spring is so wonderful on a cold day like this.”","She was even more excited when they moved closer.","“Zhao Jia, you have great taste!” Feng Wu pointed at the mountains in the distance. “This is perfect!”","Zhao Jia thought, “If you like this place so much, I’m sure you won’t mind being buried here.”","He said hesitantly, “So, I...”","Feng Wu waved him off. “Off you go. You should be with your family now. I won’t keep you any longer.”","Zhao Jia said, “But...”","Feng Wu said, “Stop nagging! Be gone already!”","She finally got rid of Zhao Jia.","She and Jun Linyuan were the only ones left.","Feng Wu really was going to jump into the hot spring, but Jun Linyuan stopped her.","She looked back at Jun Linyuan in bewilderment.","Jun Linyuan gave her a warning wink.","Feng Wu immediately took the hint. She lowered her voice and asked, “Is Zhao Jia still around?”","She had buried her face in Jun Linyuan’s arms so no one could see what she was talking about even if they could read lips.","The crown prince nodded.","Feng Wu asked, “What should we do, then?”","The crown prince asked, “What do you mean?”","Feng Wu gestured between the two of them. “The two of us...”","Jun Linyuan kept his unblinking gaze on her and asked, “Do you want to know if we’re playing a couple?”","Feng Wu mumbled, “I think to him, I’m more like a bed-warming maid.”","Jun Linyuan wanted to laugh, and he had a hard time fighting it back.","“Ahem.” He coughed into his fist and said, “Good. You know what you’re doing.”","Feng Wu shook him in frustration. “Hey!”","Jun Linyuan said, “Since you’re saying that you’re playing a bed-warming maid, what should you do now?”","Feng Wu stared at him. “Are you telling me to play the maid?”","Jun Linyuan shrugged.","Feng Wu said, “Fine. So be it. This is the last time, anyway.”","She was about to take off Jun Linyuan’s belt by force.","He reminded her, “I believe I’m still a patient.”","Feng Wu cleared her throat.","Fine, she would be gentle.","She gently took off his clothes until he only had on his undergarments. She then helped him into the hot spring.","Feng Wu only took off her robe before jumping in."]},{"number":2183,"title":"Chapter 2183 - Untitled","paragraphs":["When Feng Wu got in, the crown prince had already chosen his spot.","He had chosen the perfect spot to savor the view, and all Feng Wu could see was his smooth back.","Feng Wu looked perplexed.","Jun Linyuan looked over his shoulder. “You’re a maid, so do whatever a maid is supposed to do. Do you want him to see through our plan?”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","She suddenly had a feeling that Jun Linyuan wasn’t here to catch Dongsang spies, but to enjoy the experience.","Poor Feng Wu. She had to work as a real maid now.","And that wasn’t all she needed to do.","To her embarrassment, Jun Linyuan grabbed her and pulled her to his side.","Feng Wu slipped and fell face down into the water.","Jun Linyuan didn’t know whether to laugh or to cry. He quickly scooped Feng Wu out of the pool.","“Hey, Jun Linyuan, what are you doing?” Feng Wu stared at him in disbelief.","She had a feeling that he was taking advantage of her.","“Why are you running away?” Jun Linyuan picked her up so that she could face him.","Feng Wu pressed her hands against his chest and stared at him. “Hey, Jun Linyuan, you’ve crossed the line.”","Jun Linyuan shook his head. “Don’t you get it?”","Feng Wu was confused. “What do you mean?”","He said, “Why do you think Zhao Jia and his men are still waiting? They’ve been preparing for this for a very long time.”","Feng Wu asked, “Why?”","Jun Linyuan asked, “Do you think they’re not ready?”","Feng Wu shook her head. “They’ve been working on it for at least a month. This hot spring is newly dug, but they’ve given it a distressed look and put water in it... They’ve gone into so much detail; what more do they need to prepare?”","Jun Linyuan said, “That’s right. So, what are they waiting for?”","As he spoke, he brushed a lock of hair off Feng Wu’s forehead.","Feng Wu had a faint idea, but she found it too ridiculous, so she kept silent.","“What are they waiting for?” She looked innocently at Jun Linyuan.","Jun Linyuan had no idea that Feng Wu wasn’t a real 13-year-old. She had seen pretty much everything in her previous life.","He studied Feng Wu for a while. Suddenly, he blushed.","Feng Wu was pleased to see Jun Linyuan’s ears turning red.","She had thought that Jun Linyuan was an experienced man, but as it turned out, he was an innocent virgin.","Feng Wu looked perfectly innocent as she looked into Jun Linyuan’s eyes. “What do you mean? What are they waiting for?”","Jun Linyuan didn’t say anything.","Feng Wu went on teasing him. “Your Royal Highness, please tell me.”","Jun Linyuan was no saint, not to mention that the girl he liked was in his arms. When Feng Wu realized the danger, he bent down and kissed her on the mouth.","Feng Wu froze on the spot.","At that moment, she felt like smacking her own forehead.","She regretted having teased Jun Linyuan. She had dropped a rock on her own foot.","She could feel Jun Linyuan’s hot breath on her ear. “They’re waiting for us to do this.”","Feng Wu was so frustrated that she flushed from head to toe.","Jun Linyuan said in a hoarse voice, “They believe that we’ll be careless when we do something like this, so that’s when they’ll find their opportunity.”"]},{"number":2184,"title":"Chapter 2184 - Untitled","paragraphs":["As soon as he said that, they heard a whooshing sound.","Arrows rained down on the hot spring.","“They’re here.” Jun Linyuan pulled Feng Wu behind him and grabbed a robe.","He then waved it around so fast that no arrows could touch them.","“They’re quite capable. You won’t be able to take the arrows, and the soft armor can only protect the top half of your body but not the rest.” Jun Linyuan frowned. “Dive into the water and sneak off. Go find Feng.”","Feng Wu knew that Jun Linyuan wasn’t ill, so she nodded and dove into the hot spring.","But right at that moment!","Boom!","An explosion went off nearby!","Feng Wu raised her head and checked the surroundings, but she couldn’t see where that sound came from.","She felt that the danger was very close.","Her life was under threat.","She was still looking for the source when she heard Jun Linyuan say, “It came from beneath the hot spring.”","He then threw her out of the pool.","Feng Wu flew through the air toward Feng.","But at that moment, a man in black came out of nowhere and struck down at Feng.","It was such a terrifying power!","If Ranmil were here, she would have recognized the man. It was none other than the person who had taught her the Fierce Face dance.","Feng Wu had no idea that her plan would draw out the man behind everything.","The mysterious man went on exchanging blows with Feng.","They moved so fast that Feng Wu couldn’t follow their strikes.","But she didn’t have time to worry about other people.","Because she was in danger as well.","Their plan was to have Feng Wu hide behind Feng, which would keep her safe.","The Dongsang spies wouldn’t be able to touch her then.","But things took an unexpected turn.","Feng had to fight the mysterious man, and neither could easily defeat the other.","Jun Linyuan leaped up, trying to get to Feng Wu.","But suddenly!","A masked man attacked Jun Linyuan.","The man was tall, strong, and very capable. Jun Linyuan realized almost immediately that he was facing a tough enemy.","Who was this man? Jun Linyuan frowned.","As soon as Feng Wu landed, she heard the whooshing sound again.","Arrows were coming at her.","She noticed that the men in black seemed to be divided into two groups.","Were there other participants apart from the assassins of the Dongsang Kingdom? Who were they?","But she didn’t have time to figure that out now. She had to run for her life!","Meanwhile!","In the campsite.","Explosions went off one after another, and all hell broke loose.","Luckily, Emperor Wu was very decisive, and things soon settled down.","Half of the guards rushed toward the woods.","Seeing the flames in the mountains, Emperor Wu scowled.","It was the same as 13 years ago. Countless soldiers went to war, but they kept losing, and the Dongsang Kingdom drove into the Junwu Empire like a spear."]},{"number":2185,"title":"Chapter 2185 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","13 years later, the Dongsang Kingdom was trying to overthrow the Junwu Empire again. They had made such a big mess with so few people, not to mention that the Junwu Empire had been prepared for an attack.","“Your Majesty, His Royal Highness isn’t in great shape. What should we do? Will he be able to get out safely?”","Seeing the empress dowager coming their way, Empress Dugu deliberately said those words.","As expected, the empress dowager panicked when she heard those words.","“What are you waiting for? Send someone to help Junjun!” she glared at Emperor Wu.","Emperor Wu smiled wryly.","This was Jun Linyuan’s plan, which he had told Emperor Wu in advance.","But Emperor Wu didn’t expect the fighting to be so fierce.","“Why is Junjun up there? It’s so cold. What’s he doing outside? Who’s with him?” the empress dowager asked hastily.","Of course, some people would use this opportunity to slander Feng Wu.","Mrs. Zuo was one such person. She immediately said, “His Royal Highness’s guard is right outside. He’s kneeling on the ground.”","“Get him in here!” the empress dowager shouted.","It was none other than Zhao Jia, who had told Feng Wu that he was going home.","He told the empress dowager everything before she even asked. “It was Miss Feng Wu. She asked me where she could have some fun around this place, so I had no choice but to tell her about a hot spring on the mountain.","“I didn’t expect her to be so excited. She immediately ran to tell His Royal Highness, and begged him to go into the hot spring with her.","“His Royal Highness didn’t look well. He kept coughing, and his face was very pale.","“He refused at first, but Miss Feng Wu wouldn’t stop nagging.”","Hearing this, the empress dowager was furious.","She hated Feng Wu more than ever.","“How dare she!” she bellowed.","Zhao Jia didn’t dare utter a word.","“Go on!” The empress dowager glared at Zhao Jia.","Zhao Jia seemed frightened and spoke in a trembling voice, “Miss Feng Wu told His Royal Highness that they could enjoy the hot spring while sipping Monkey Wine and talking about life.","“That persuaded His Royal Highness, and they went up the mountain together.”","Zhao Jia burst into tears. “But I never expected that Miss Feng Wu would lead His Royal Highness to his death!","“His Royal Highness is so weak, and the fighting up there is so fierce...”","The empress dowager almost passed out from her rage.","“That Feng Wu accused everyone else of being spies, but as it turned out, she’s the biggest spy!” The empress dowager gritted her teeth. “Bring all her people here! I’m going to chop their heads off!”","The empress dowager had always been a willful person, not to mention that her favorite grandson was concerned. She wanted to kill the entire Feng clan!","Empress Dugu and Mrs. Zuo looked at each other.","This Zhao Jia was really useful.","If Feng Wu could escape the attack, the empress dowager would still kill her!","“Wait. Wait.” Luckily, Jun Linyuan had told Emperor Wu the plan beforehand. Otherwise, he would have believed the slander.","At the same time...","Feng Wu had no idea what was going on at the foot of the mountain. She was in a lot of danger at the moment.","Because even Jun Linyuan didn’t know that some high-ranking official from the Junwu Empire was also involved.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","As soon as she landed, countless arrows flew at her.","She looked up and saw that both Jun Linyuan and Feng were engaged in battle. Even if Feng Xun were here, he wouldn’t be able to help her..."]},{"number":2186,"title":"Chapter 2186 - Unexpected Danger","paragraphs":["Feng Wu didn’t have much time to react.","Another arrow was flying at her.","Without thinking, Feng Wu dodged to one side.","But there were so many arrows.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","An arrow still hit her in the back.","But there was no pain.","Because Jun Linyuan had made her wear the soft armor.","Therefore, none of the arrows were able to injure her.","Rumble!","Explosions kept going off beneath them.","“Run!” Jun Linyuan shouted at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu nodded and dashed off.","According to their plan, if they ran into danger, they would switch to Plan B.","The backup plan was to run down the mountain, since reinforcements would come for them, and Feng Wu would be safe.","And that was what Feng Wu did.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","She ran as fast as her legs could carry her.","“Watch out!” Feng Wu heard a voice.","It was the white fairy.","She said, “That way is dangerous! Turn around now!”","What?","Feng Wu was surprised. That wasn’t her plan...","“You’re in danger!” the white fairy shouted. “Get into the woods!”","At that moment, Feng Wu felt the danger coming from the foot of the mountain.","Someone out there wanted to kill her!","Who could it be?","But she didn’t have time to figure that out now. She needed to run for her life first.","Whoosh!","As the white fairy suggested, Feng Wu dashed into the woods, running so fast that even the white fairy was surprised.","She was right!","Several men followed her into the woods.","Their faces were all covered with black scarves.","With murderous looks in their eyes, they followed Feng Wu, trying to surround her.","Feng Wu wasn’t capable enough to fight them yet, but the white fairy was much more powerful.","Although her cultivation level dropped by a whole stage outside the tombs, she was still a formidable cultivator.","She told Feng Wu, “There are seven of them in total. Six are Spiritual Lords, and one is a Spiritual King.”","Feng Wu almost burst into tears. “Seriously? Since when are there so many Spiritual Lords?!”","The white fairy shook her head. “They’re here specifically to kill you.”","Feng Wu nodded and found that it made sense.","They knew that she was a Level 7 Spiritual Elder, so they sent six Spiritual Lords and a Spiritual King to make sure that she would be killed.","Feng Wu recalled what Jun Linyuan had told her.","He said that if she ran into unexpected danger, stall for five minutes, and he would be there for her!","“That Spiritual King...” Feng Wu gritted her teeth.","“I can lure the Spiritual King away for you, but you need to deal with the Spiritual Lords yourself.” The white fairy gave her a sympathetic look. “I’ve left the tombs, and it’s not dark yet. I’m far from being at full power.”"]},{"number":2187,"title":"Chapter 2187 - Who Are You?!","paragraphs":["Feng Wu nodded.","The seven men were on her heels.","They were silent, fast, and precise, like the real assassins.","They fanned out, trying to eventually surround Feng Wu.","Right now, two of them were directly behind her.","One was the Spiritual King, and the other one a Spiritual Lord.","Feng Wu ran through the woods without uttering a word.","But they were getting closer and closer.","Soon, the Spiritual Lord made his first strike.","He threw a dagger at her from 20 meters away.","“Die!” he shouted.","“He’s a Level 2 Spiritual Lord,” the white fairy warned Feng Wu.","She didn’t have a physical form, so when she stayed inside the jade pendant, even the Spiritual King didn’t notice her.","Feng Wu was only a Level 7 Spiritual Elder and wasn’t capable enough to withstand that strike.","But in a moment like this, if she couldn’t get away, she would be killed!","Therefore, Feng Wu jumped forward, and the dagger brushed past the top of her head.","But because of that, the two men caught up with her.","They were a Spiritual Lord and a Spiritual King.","Their faces were covered by black scarves, and she couldn’t tell who they were, but the Spiritual King somehow looked familiar.","Was he an acquaintance?","Feng Wu narrowed her eyes.","Meanwhile, the Spiritual King crossed his hands behind his back and stared at Feng Wu with his cold eyes, as if she had killed his entire family.","The Spiritual Lord walked toward her with a smirk.","Blades glinted coldly in his hands.","Feng Wu sat on the ground and kept inching away from him.","She could see the hatred in his eyes.","He wanted to kill her with his own hands!","“Do you hate me?” Feng Wu narrowed her eyes.","The Spiritual Lord didn’t reply. He looked at Feng Wu as if she was already dead.","Feng Wu tried her best to relax.","If she could stall for five minutes, Jun Linyuan would come for her.","Buy herself some time. That was all she needed to do now.","“You’re both so much stronger than me, and there’s no way that I can get away from you. I know I’m going to die, so I only have a small request.” Feng Wu stared at the Spiritual Lord. “Who are you, and why do you want to kill me?”","The Spiritual Lord smirked. “Why don’t you think that we’re ninjas of the Dongsang Kingdom?”","Feng Wu said grumpily, “I can see that you can’t wait to kill me in particular, so you’re definitely not from the Dongsang Kingdom.”","The Spiritual Lord looked back at the Spiritual King.","The Spiritual King had his hands behind his back, and the lower hem of his clothes flapped in the wind.","“Don’t I deserve to know why I’m going to die?” Feng Wu added.","The Spiritual King nodded.","The Spiritual Lord had been waiting for a chance to take off his scarf. With a tearing sound, he ripped the scarf off his face.","He looked very ordinary.","If one had to describe him, this man felt more like a subordinate than a leader.","“Have I seen you somewhere before?” Feng Wu searched her memory.","“Of course Miss Feng Wu has seen me before, but I’m simply too lowly to catch your eye.” The Spiritual Lord chuckled."]},{"number":2188,"title":"Chapter 2188 - Untitled","paragraphs":["An idea suddenly struck Feng Wu. “I know who you are!","“You were Zuo Qingyu’s guard!” Feng Wu glared at him. “I saw you by her side when I was little, but you weren’t there when I got older.”","The Spiritual Lord looked enraged. “Shut up! How dare you mention her name?!”","He stepped forward and struck down at Feng Wu’s head.","Other people would have been scared out of their wits, but Feng Wu remained unperturbed. “Were you fired?”","The Spiritual Lord didn’t reply.","Feng Wu said casually, “If you kill me, you’ll never know how Zuo Qingyu died.”","Hearing Zuo Qingyu’s name, the Spiritual Lord shifted, and his fist moved away from her head.","Boom!","The fist brushed past Feng Wu’s ear and landed on a rock nearby.","The impact immediately turned the rock to powder.","“It really was you! You killed Qingyu!” The Spiritual Lord jumped at Feng Wu, trying to grab her by the neck.","Feng Wu shifted to the side to dodge his attack.","“Wait.” She smirked. “Did I say that?”","The Spiritual King suddenly spoke in a cold voice.","“Kill her.”","“Yes.”","The Spiritual Lord drew out his sword.","Feng Wu stared at the Spiritual King and cried out, “Master Zuo!”","She knew that the Spiritual Lord had been Zuo Qingyu’s guard. Since the Spiritual King could order the guard around, who else could he be if not Zuo Qingyu’s father?","“Haha —”","The man laughed coldly, and his eyes were filled with mocking.","He didn’t give a direct answer and only stared at the Spiritual Lord. “What are you waiting for?”","Meanwhile...","Feng Wu took a deep breath.","If she didn’t make a breakthrough now, she wouldn’t have another chance.","The white fairy gave her a nod, hinting that she would hold back the Spiritual King.","Therefore, the moment the Spiritual Lord struck down at Feng Wu —","“Break!”","Feng Wu broke one of the white balls in her dantian.","Jun Linyuan had refined the Seed of the Spirit Source for her.","Not only that, he had also divided the essence of the seed into ten white balls. She could easily crush one and make a breakthrough.","Feng Wu called them advancement eggs!","At that critical moment, Feng Wu crushed an egg.","Poof!","The spiritual essence around Feng Wu all flowed toward her, and she was protected by the law of Nature. Nothing could touch her now!","The Spiritual Lord’s hand froze halfway.","No one could go against the law of Nature.","Therefore, he could only watch as Feng Wu made a breakthrough.","But he could still attack her after the breakthrough was over.","The Spiritual Lord looked at the Spiritual King.","The Spiritual King crossed his hands behind his back and nodded arrogantly.","Thanks to Jun Linyuan’s advancement eggs, Feng Wu could make rapid advancements!","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!"]},{"number":2189,"title":"Chapter 2189 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Feng Wu finished her advancement in a matter of seconds.","She was a Level 8 Spiritual Elder now.","“Congratulations. You’ve managed to rise a level before you die,” the Spiritual Lord said coldly.","“But what’s the difference between a Level 7 and Level 8 Spiritual Elder? They’re all ants to me!","“Die!” The Spiritual Lord raised his hand again and struck down at Feng Wu’s head.","But immediately, he was dumbfounded.","Even the Spiritual King was shocked.","That was because —","Feng Wu broke another advancement egg.","Rumble!","The egg burst open.","And Feng Wu began to make a breakthrough again.","The Spiritual Lord stared at Feng Wu in disbelief.","The Spiritual King narrowed his eyes as well.","They stood there and watched Feng Wu make her breakthrough.","In a few seconds, Feng Wu was a Level 9 Spiritual Elder.","Although he was astonished, the Spiritual Lord still heaved a sigh of relief.","He was glad that Feng Wu was only a Level 9 Spiritual Elder and hadn’t risen directly to the Spiritual Elder stage.","But the next second, he wanted to slap himself.","What was wrong with him? Why did he think that Feng Wu could make two breakthroughs in one go? That was impossible!","“Feng Wu, you’re a Level 9 Spiritual Elder now. Things are finally getting interesting.” The Spiritual Lord smirked and said, “But you still aren’t my match!”","Feng Wu opened her eyes and looked at him. “Are you sure that I’m still not your match?”","The Spiritual Lord snorted. “Fight me if you don’t believe it!”","Feng Wu gave him a startled look. “Although I think I can defeat you...”","After some consideration, she tilted her head and looked at the Spiritual Lord. “But there’s still some risk, so why should I fight you now?”","The Spiritual Lord stared at Feng Wu. “What do you mean?”","Feng Wu said, “I’m saying, why don’t I make another breakthrough so that I can be sure that I’ll win?”","This was the first time that Feng Wu realized how capable Jun Linyuan was.","She had no idea that someone could create advancement eggs that would allow her to make instant breakthroughs.","She didn’t need any enlightenment. It was so easy!","Hearing what Feng Wu said, the Spiritual Lord guffawed. “Hahaha! Feng Wu, do you know how ridiculous you sound?”","Feng Wu asked, “Is it so funny?”","The Spiritual Lord nodded and said solemnly, “Who do you think you are? You can’t make advancements as you like! At our level, do you know how difficult it is for us to make a breakthrough?”","Feng Wu said, “I don’t think it’s that difficult.”","The Spiritual Lord laughed again. “It’s not difficult? If that’s the case, make a breakthrough now. If you can do it, you can take my head!”","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up. “Do you mean it?”","The Spiritual Lord snorted and said, “Of course. Advance now.”","Feng Wu nodded.","She started after that."]},{"number":2190,"title":"Chapter 2190","paragraphs":["Feng Wu nodded.","She started after that.","Spiritual essence flowed toward her, and soon, she was ready for another breakthrough.","Whoosh –","The Spiritual Lord stood there and watched in amazement as this happened.","The spiritual essence began to rush toward her like a tidal wave.","He was astonished.","He stared at Feng Wu and couldn’t believe his eyes.","The look in the Spiritual King’s eyes also changed.","At first, he had looked at Feng Wu as if she was a dead person, but now, he knew that he was looking at a rising genius.","If only she was his daughter...","At that thought, the Spiritual King was filled with rage and reluctance.","But right at that moment, Feng Wu finished her breakthrough.","She looked up and beamed at the Spiritual Lord. “What did you say just then?”","The Spiritual Lord stared at Feng Wu.","He couldn’t believe his eyes. How could she make it look so effortless?","“How... How did you do it? How?! I don’t believe you!”","He couldn’t believe that someone could be so talented.","Feng Wu shrugged. “Is it that hard?”","The Spiritual Lord was speechless.","Was it that hard? It had taken him some painstaking effort before he reached the Spiritual Lord stage at 30 years old.","Right now, he was one of the most capable men in his province.","It nearly cost him his life to reach this stage.","But this girl only sat on the ground and shouted that she was going to make a breakthrough. Then, boom! She did it!","Was she even human?","Feng Wu put her hands on her knees and looked at him with a smile.","The Spiritual Lord didn’t know what to say.","Feng Wu said, “Are you going to go back on your word?”","The Spiritual Lord didn’t know what to say.","He felt cornered.","How awkward...","The Spiritual King frowned and said, “Do it!”","The Spiritual Lord said, “What?”","Do what?","The Spiritual King said, “Are you fond of Qingyu?”","The Spiritual Lord said, “Of course I am!”","“I’ll marry her to you!” said the Spiritual King. “Kill her now!”","Although Zuo Qingyu was dead, the Spiritual Lord was still thrilled that he could be her husband in name.","He nodded, but then realized something.","Why did his boss keep urging him to do it? Why wouldn’t he kill her himself?","However, he only kept that thought to himself. The most important thing now was to kill Feng Wu.","He drew out a dagger.","Feng Wu frowned at him. “Are you going to break your promise?”","The Spiritual Lord smirked. “What promise? You’ve killed my wife! There’s no promise for you! Die!”","Suddenly, Feng Wu, who was a Level 1 Spiritual Lord now, rose to her feet."]},{"number":2191,"title":"Chapter 2191","paragraphs":["With a casual wave of her hand, the dagger in the Spiritual Lord’s hand snapped in two.","The Spiritual Lord stared at Feng Wu in disbelief.","He then looked at the dagger.","It was broken...","Just like that...","“You!”","To his astonishment, Feng Wu waved her hand, and the broken blade flew toward him.","Whoosh!","The blade stabbed him in the eye, and blood gushed out.","The Spiritual Lord was petrified.","“You...”","He only uttered one word before Feng Wu raised her leg.","The Spiritual Lord was shocked.","He saw Feng Wu’s movement and wanted to dodge, but no matter how he tried, he was half a second too slow.","The impact of Feng Wu’s kick sent him flying backward.","Thump!","The Spiritual Lord fell on the ground with blood gushing out of his mouth. His face was ghastly pale.","He stared at Feng Wu in bewilderment and murmured, “How... How...”","Yes, how did this happen?","How could Feng Wu suddenly rise from a Level 7 Spiritual Elder to a Level 1 Spiritual Lord?","Was she even human?!","Feng Wu marched toward him with a smirk on her face.","The Spiritual Lord looked terrified.","But he soon realized something.","Why should he be afraid?","Although he wasn’t Feng Wu’s match, there was a Spiritual King behind him!","When he intervened, Feng Wu would stand no chance even if she was a Level 1 Spiritual Lord.","Therefore, he said sarcastically, “Do you want to kill me?”","Feng Wu said, “You wanted to kill me. Why can’t I do the same?”","The Spiritual Lord smirked. “Yes, a Level 1 Spiritual Lord is capable enough to kill me, but have you forgotten about the person behind me?”","Feng Wu didn’t think much of it. “Who? Do you mean the great Master Zuo?”","The Spiritual Lord stared at Feng Wu. “Do you know who he is?”","Feng Wu shrugged. “Who else could marry the already dead Zuo Qingyu to you?”","The Spiritual Lord couldn’t argue with that.","But he didn’t care. He smirked and said, “Aren’t you afraid of a Spiritual King?!”","“So, you’re waiting for him to save you.” Feng Wu smiled at him. “If that’s the case, you’ll be disappointed. Look.”","Feng Wu pointed at the Spiritual King, aka Master Zuo.","The Spiritual Lord was shocked once more when he saw what Master Zuo was like.","That was because —","“How...”","The Spiritual King stood there like a statue. He kept his hands behind his back and remained motionless.","“Master?” The Spiritual Lord tried to get his master’s attention.","But Master Zuo’s face was blank as he stared into empty air. Although he wasn’t moving, he seemed to be engaged in a fierce battle.","Feng Wu smiled a little.","She knew exactly why Master Zuo was like that. The white fairy was fighting him.","“Run!” the white fairy told Feng Wu in her mind. “I can’t hold him back for much longer.”"]},{"number":2192,"title":"Chapter 2192","paragraphs":["Hearing the white fairy’s warning, Feng Wu dashed off without hesitation.","But before she left, she slid the blade across the Spiritual Lord’s throat.","The Spiritual Lord wanted to cry for help, but he was too late.","Poof!","Blood gushed out of the gash on his neck.","The Spiritual Lord stared at Feng Wu in disbelief.","He wanted to turn around to look at the Spiritual King and ask him why he wouldn’t help him.","But he never had the chance.","Because he was dead before he could do so.","D*mn it!","The Spiritual King cursed inwardly.","It wasn’t that he didn’t want to, but he couldn’t.","Because a ghost-like being came out of nowhere and started attacking him.","As soon as he tried to fight back, he was confined by his opponent’s spiritual essence, and neither of them could move.","So, he had to watch as the Spiritual Lord fell.","Gritting his teeth, he started attacking the semi-transparent being.","Feng Wu ran as fast as she could, brushing past the trees that flanked the path.","“I can’t stop! I must keep running!” After finding a direction, she nimbly jumped around the woods like a cat.","There was one Spiritual King and five Spiritual Lords left.","If the five Spiritual Lords joined hands...","Feng Wu felt like crying.","I can’t be that unlucky, right?","Just then, she sensed something dangerous ahead of her.","Ahead?","Feng Wu narrowed her eyes.","She couldn’t see anyone for several hundred meters ahead of her. It was just a normal road.","However...","She then noticed two trees that had a rather eerie feel about them.","They felt unnaturally still.","Feng Wu’s stomach lurched. When she looked again, she saw a thin string tied between them, so thin that it was barely detectable.","The string was transparent so that it was almost invisible in the sunlight. Feng Wu only knew it was there because of past experience.","Because she had done it to other people before.","Feng Wu was glad that she was sharp enough. Otherwise, if she ran into the string at her current speed, she might have gotten her head cut off.","She made a sudden turn when she was 10 meters away and headed for the northwest.","She chose that direction because it was closer to the exit of the woods. If Jun Linyuan came to rescue her, that would be the shortest route.","However, as soon as she turned, two figures jumped down from the trees.","Both were very capable men.","One was a Level 3 Spiritual Lord, and the other one a Level 4.","Being a mere Level 1 Spiritual Lord, Feng Wu wasn’t their match.","The two cultivators glanced at each other, and both seemed frustrated.","What a cunning girl. She had spotted the transparent string.","“Let’s go! We must kill her!”","The two Spiritual Lords spoke in unison."]},{"number":2193,"title":"Chapter 2193","paragraphs":["“Let’s go! We must kill her!”","The two Spiritual Lords spoke in unison.","However, when they started chasing her, they realized how fast the girl was.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","She zigzagged through the woods like a nimble cat.","Soon, they lost sight of her.","How did that happen?","The two Spiritual Lords saw surprise in each other’s eyes.","It shouldn’t have happened...","They had both been Level 1 Spiritual Lords before, so they knew better than anyone else how big the gap was between the two levels.","No matter how talented the girl was, she couldn’t suddenly disappear from sight, unless...","“She’s hiding somewhere!”","The two men looked at each other.","“Find her!”","The Level 4 man gestured at the other man.","They each chose a direction and searched two different areas, hoping that they would soon find Feng Wu.","The Level 3 man nodded.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","They quietly flitted through the woods without making a sound.","Suddenly, the Level 3 man sensed something amiss, because he noticed that the spiritual essence seemed to be flowing in a certain direction.","Immediately, he turned in that direction.","Soon, he reached an old tree so thick that three people would only just be able to get their arms around it.","The leaves of the old tree had turned yellow, and the bark was covered with dots. It looked like it was going to collapse at any moment.","The Spiritual Lord stopped and stared at a spot in the tree. He narrowed his eyes.","He looked pleased.","He had a speculation, and he was going to prove it.","He touched the tree trunk.","If he had stuck to the plan, he should have called for his Level 4 friend, but the reward of killing Feng Wu all by himself was too generous to resist.","If he could kill her on his own, why share? The man immediately gave up on the idea of waiting for his friend.","However...","He was perplexed.","Before they had set out, they were told that their target was a girl who was a Level 7 Spiritual Elder, but this girl was a Level 1 Spiritual Lord.","Could there have been a mistake?","With that question in mind, the man peeled off the rotten tree bark.","Soon, he saw a stunningly beautiful face.","Yes! She was his target!","The man nodded.","Their captain had shown them her portrait before they left, and they had all studied it carefully.","It was a portrait of their target.","The captain had also told them something else.","“She’s only a Level 7 Spiritual Elder, but she’s very lucky. Anything can happen.","“Don’t be arrogant just because you’re all Spiritual Lords. Don’t let your guard down. She has killed Spiritual Lords before.","“No matter what happens, don’t lose your target!","“If you can kill her, the reward will be beyond your imagination!","“Don’t be reckless!”"]},{"number":2194,"title":"Chapter 2194","paragraphs":["He could still remember what the captain said, but when he saw Feng Wu, he didn’t think much of it.","He just couldn’t see how this girl could be so capable.","She was just another pretty girl. All he had to do was wrap his fingers around her neck, and she would be dead.","The man reached out for Feng Wu’s neck.","Right at that moment!","Feng Wu’s eyes snapped open.","She kept her unblinking cold gaze on the man.","WTF!","The man almost jumped.","But he reacted quickly enough and smirked. “You stupid girl. Of all the places, you had to hide in a tree. You have nowhere to go now!”","As he spoke, he raised his right hand.","He was about to smack Feng Wu on the top of her head.","If he succeeded, he would kill Feng Wu instantly.","But there was no fear in Feng Wu’s eyes.","She said coldly, “You can’t kill me!”","The man snorted. “Why can’t I?”","Feng Wu said calmly, “I’m making a breakthrough right now. If you kill me, the law of Nature will make sure that your attack will backfire.”","Hearing this, the man laughed. “Hahaha! If that’s true, there’s really nothing I can do, but...”","He looked Feng Wu up and down and said scornfully, “Do you think you can do it just like that, by closing your eyes and sitting on the ground?”","He wouldn’t believe it.","No one would.","Cultivation was such a difficult thing, but she made it sound like she could do it whenever she wanted. That just wasn’t possible!","“So, die now!” Without hesitation, the man struck down at Feng Wu’s head.","What happened was quicker than words could describe!","Feng Wu shouted, “Now!”","Thump!","Somewhere he couldn’t see, an advancement egg burst open.","Everything happened in a split second.","The man felt all the power of Nature working against his hand, and he couldn’t move another inch.","It was as if Feng Wu had turned into an untouchable being that nothing could harm.","The spiritual essence around them all flowed in their direction.","More precisely, it all surged toward Feng Wu!","The speed was unbelievable.","The man looked shocked.","He had never expected this.","How could he?","He stared at the pretty face in disbelief.","When she said that she could make a breakthrough, he thought that she was only bluffing.","But it was true!","It took him a while to digest that information.","But even if that was the case, she was only going to be a Level 2 Spiritual Lord, which was still below him.","He could wait!","He could kill her after she was done!","That thought reassured him.","He crossed his arms and leaned back on the tree."]},{"number":2195,"title":"Chapter 2195","paragraphs":["He stared at Feng Wu with a half-smile on her face. He would like to see how much longer the girl could stall for.","The advancement soon ended.","Once Feng Wu was no longer under the protection of the power of Nature, he could easily kill her.","Rumble —","Finally, Feng Wu became a Level 2 Spiritual Lord.","The man stared at Feng Wu, and his eyes glinted coldly. “I’ve given you enough time. Now, your life is mine.”","He gave Feng Wu no time to react. Without hesitation, he aimed his fist at Feng Wu’s chest.","No one could survive if their heart was broken.","But —","He didn’t expect what happened next.","When he raised his hand, the power of Nature covered Feng Wu again.","It was the fiercest power.","Caught off guard, the man was almost knocked away.","What the heck?!","He was so sure that he was going to kill Feng Wu, but as it turned out, he was the one that was sent flying.","When he looked again, he was astonished.","“How is this possible?”","The most impossible thing was happening to Feng Wu.","She was making a breakthrough again!","She was only a Level 2 Spiritual Lord before, but she was a Level 3 now!","The man’s stomach lurched.","He felt a chill run down his spine.","This was so strange.","The unknown scared him.","He felt goosebumps all over his body, so he turned to run.","Run?","He was too late.","He only took one step before Feng Wu grabbed his belt.","Panicked, he tried to slap Feng Wu with the back of his hand.","If Feng Wu were still a Level 1 Spiritual Lord, she wouldn’t stand a chance.","But she had just made two breakthroughs.","After that, she became a Level 3 Spiritual Lord.","They were of the same level now.","Of course, Feng Wu wouldn’t lose this battle.","There was a rumbling sound.","Feng Wu raised her fist and punched the man in the head.","Rumble!","The man’s head immediately caved in. His brains were all over the ground, and his eyes popped out. It was a horrifying scene.","He no longer moved, as if he had frozen.","He was killed instantly.","One punch.","It only took Feng Wu one punch to take out a Level 3 Spiritual Lord.","She was much more powerful now.","After killing the man, Feng Wu didn’t lower her guard because she knew that there was still a Level 4 Spiritual Lord nearby.","She was right!","When Feng Wu pushed the dead man aside, the Level 4 Spiritual Lord was standing right in front of her and staring at her with a murderous look in his eyes.","“Did you kill him?” He narrowed his eyes.","He glared at Feng Wu.","His aura was very intimidating.","How frightening.","Feng Wu was always careful, and right now, she was more alarmed than ever."]},{"number":2196,"title":"Chapter 2196","paragraphs":["Feng Wu was always careful, and right now, she was more alarmed than ever.","She stared at the man, who was staring back at her as well.","She threw the dead body at the man.","The man caught his teammate and looked furious when he checked his pulse.","This girl had killed his teammate!","He was ready to kill her now.","Feng Wu smiled a little.","Without another word, she sat on the ground and started making another breakthrough.","She was already a Level 3 Spiritual Lord now.","It was possible for her to defeat a Level 4, but it would be a difficult battle.","Not only would it cost her a lot of energy, the noise would also alarm the other killers.","Therefore, Feng Wu chose to make another breakthrough.","Since she had a shortcut, why not take it?","When the man struck down at Feng Wu’s head like his teammate tried to do...","He had to wait for Feng Wu to finish as well.","No one could fight the law of Nature unless they wanted to taste the backlash.","D*mn it!","The man put down his hand, and his face was livid with rage.","He looked alarmed and surprised as he studied Feng Wu’s face.","How strange.","Based on what he was told, his target was supposed to be a Level 7 Spiritual Elder.","It had made them wonder. She was only a Level 7 Spiritual Elder, so why did the job need so many of them?","However...","Judging by the fluctuation of her spiritual essence, she was at least a Level 3 Spiritual Lord!","How was that even possible?!","An idea suddenly struck him.","Could it be because of the legendary Seed of the Spirit Source?","Did she have it?","There was a greedy look in his eyes.","According to legend, this seed could do wonders. It could elevate a person’s cultivation level by an entire stage.","All cultivators wanted it.","Trying to kill the girl now would result in a backlash from the power of Nature. What if he just stole the seed? That way, the backlash wouldn’t be so powerful.","At that thought, the man charged at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu sensed the approaching danger.","Hum!","The breakthrough wasn’t completed yet, so she concentrated the power of Nature in her palms.","She then struck at the man’s head.","She was almost a Level 4 Spiritual Lord and was using the power of Nature. The effect was terrifying.","Thump!","There was a loud bang.","The man flew backward.","He smashed into an old tree and split it in two. He destroyed 13 trees in succession before he finally dropped to the ground.","He coughed...","Blood poured out of his mouth.","A shadow fell over him.","He looked up and saw that it was Feng Wu, and he said, “The Seed of the Spirit Source...”"]},{"number":2197,"title":"Chapter 2197","paragraphs":["Feng Wu grinned. “That’s right. I have it.”","There was a greedy look in his eyes.","Suddenly, his eyes glinted coldly, and he used all his strength to charge at Feng Wu.","The Seed of the Spirit Source!","He had to have it!","If he took it from her, he would be able to rise to the Spiritual King stage!","To him, that would be like becoming God.","However, he had underestimated Feng Wu.","She had never lost to an opponent of the same cultivation level. He was never going to be her match.","The moment the man charged at her —","Feng Wu raised her foot.","Thump!","It was the sound of something falling on the ground.","Although the man spared no effort, Feng Wu still kicked him away. He flew through the air and fell to a heap on the ground.","Unlike earlier, Feng Wu had used all her strength this time.","She heard the cracking sound of broken bones.","At least four of his ribs were broken.","The man coughed and pointed at Feng Wu, but he couldn’t utter a word.","He was fatally wounded.","Feng Wu casually walked to his side, squatted down, and smiled at him. “You can’t talk anymore, can you?”","The man said, “How did you level up so fast?”","Feng Wu said proudly, “You said it yourself already: I have the Seed of the Spirit Source.”","The man wouldn’t believe her. “Even if that’s the case, it still won’t make you level up so fast.”","Feng Wu raised an eyebrow. “I had help.”","The man asked, “From whom?”","Feng Wu said, “You’re going to die, so I suppose it won’t hurt to tell you the truth. The person was Jun Linyuan.”","The man was shocked. “His Royal Highness? That’s impossible! Why would the crown prince help you?”","Feng Wu asked, “Maybe it’s because I’m very pretty.”","The man said, “No! His Royal Highness is fond of Miss Qingluan! He would never help you!”","Miss Qingluan? Feng Wu smiled a little.","The Level 3 Spiritual Lord was Zuo Qingyu’s guard, and this one referred to Zuo Qingluan as Miss Qingluan. It wasn’t difficult to connect the dots.","Feng Wu snorted. “I see that you’re Zuo Qingluan’s guard.”","However, the man lowered his head in frustration. “I haven’t been her guard for a very long time.”","“Haven’t been.” That was to say, he had been once.","He stared at Feng Wu. “It wasn’t the crown prince, was it?”","Feng Wu shook her head. “But it really was him.”","She had even swapped bodies with Jun Linyuan for a while. Zuo Qingluan would be furious!","A voice suddenly rang out behind Feng Wu. “Then you’ll have to die.”","Feng Wu turned around and saw a figure standing nearby.","He looked exceptionally calm, and there was a crossbow in his hands.","“You’re here!” The Level 4 Spiritual Lord was thrilled to see his Level 5 teammate. He wanted to remind the man that Feng Wu had the Seed of Spirit Source at first, but in the end decided to keep that fact to himself."]},{"number":2198,"title":"Chapter 2198","paragraphs":["If he didn’t say anything, maybe he would still have a chance of getting the seed when the fighting was over, but if he told his teammate...","“Lower your weapon.” The Level 5 Spiritual Lord stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu rose to her feet and smiled at him.","Just then, she heard another person approaching.","She paled slightly.","One Level 5 Spiritual Lord didn’t scare her, because she could easily take care of him.","But if he had help...","She couldn’t take the risk.","What happened next was quicker than words could describe!","When she heard the approaching footsteps, she quickly hid behind the Level 4 Spiritual Lord.","Meanwhile!","The Level-5 Spiritual Lord took action as well!","He started shooting with the crossbow in his right hand.","Whoosh!","Luckily, Feng Wu had reacted in time and could use the Level 4 man as her shield.","Therefore!","“Ahhhh —”","The Level 4 Spiritual Lord screamed in pain.","His Level 5 teammate was furious.","He had never expected that the girl could be so bold.","She had used one of them as her shield!","“Stop!” he bellowed.","Of course, Feng Wu wouldn’t listen to him. She had already run out of sight.","Two people joined the Level 5 Spiritual Lord.","The Zuo family was indeed an influential force.","They had more Spiritual Lords than one could count.","The two newcomers were both Level 6 Spiritual Lords!","“What’s going on?” the two men asked.","One of them had a round face, and the other one had long arms. Both their faces were covered with scarves.","“Feng Wu escaped!” The Level 5 man narrowed his eyes. “She made some rapid progress and is already a Level 4 Spiritual Lord!”","“Is that so?” Round Face narrowed his eyes as well. “Weren’t we told that she was only a Level 7 Spiritual Elder?”","Long Arms frowned. “Does that mean that Miss Qingluan’s information is true?”","One piece of information that Zuo Qingluan had sent back was that Feng Wu probably had the Seed of the Spirit Source.","If that was the case, they had to kill her and take the seed!","Round Face said coldly, “I see that the girl has quite a few nice things on her.”","Long Arms said, “Let’s catch her before she’s done with her breakthroughs and fetch the seed. Otherwise, by the time she’s done, the seed will become useless!”","“If Miss Qingluan has the seed, she’ll make major progress again. That’ll be great news for the Zuo family!” said Round Face. “Our family seems to have become entangled with ill fortune, and the young members keep dying...”","His two teammates fell silent.","He was right.","Although the Zuo family was rather large, there weren’t many outstanding members in the younger generation. Zuo Ming’s children were the most talented ones.","But he had lost two sons and a daughter already...","Therefore, Zuo Qingluan was basically their only hope now.","“We’ll thrive if the Zuo family does, and if they fall, so will we.” Round Face waved his hand and said, “No more delay! We must kill Feng Wu today! Gather everyone and catch her!”"]},{"number":2199,"title":"Chapter 2199","paragraphs":["Feng Wu had been making such rapid progress that it alarmed them.","But what made them more nervous was that if Feng Wu used up all the energy in the seed for her advancement, there would be nothing left for Zuo Qingluan!","Whoosh –","A unique whistling sound rang out in the silent woods.","Instantly, several people ran in the direction of the sound.","The men of the Zuo family weren’t the only ones who heard it.","Little Phoenix heard it as well!","“They’ve sent the signal, and they’re gathering the team!” The bird spoke fast when it was nervous. “There are seven of them in total, and the Spiritual King is being stalled by the white fairy.”","It ran a quick analysis for Feng Wu. “You’ve killed three Spiritual Lords already, so they should only have three people left.”","Feng Wu shook her head. “There’s more.”","Little Phoenix nodded. “That’s very cunning of them. They seemed to have sent seven men, but there are actually many more of them. How many assassins are after you? I see that they’re really determined to kill you. What did you do to make them hate you so much?”","Feng Wu said, “Zuo Ming has lost two sons and a daughter directly or indirectly because of me. I bet the rage has driven him crazy. I’m impressed that he still acts like a sane person.”","Little Phoenix said, “I think they’ve found out that you have the Seed of the Spirit Source.”","Feng Wu nodded.","“They probably didn’t know at first, which was why they weren’t in a hurry to kill me in the beginning. Now that they’ve confirmed it, however, they’ve picked up their pace!”","Little Phoenix looked at her in resignation.","How could she sound so relaxed when she was being hunted?","“Aren’t you afraid at all?” Little Phoenix was speechless. “They’re all after you, and they’re all more capable than you are!”","Feng Wu shrugged. “This won’t go away just because I’m scared. Get up there and see how Jun Linyuan is doing.”","She was confident in what she was doing partly because of the seed that Jun Linyuan had refined and partly because of the bird.","It could fly and see a lot of things from up in the sky.","Little Phoenix knew how serious the situation was, so it flew up into the sky without hesitation.","It then told Feng Wu, “The crown prince is as capable as he’s said to be. It took him less than three minutes to defeat his enemies, and he’s coming for you!”","Feng Wu checked the log for the tenth trial.","As expected, the number of deaths had grown.","Feng Wu said, “Lead me to him!”","Jun Linyuan was her only hope now.","Little Phoenix nodded.","Not only could it lead Feng Wu to Jun Linyuan, it could also help Feng Wu avoid the assassins.","Little Phoenix said, “The crown prince is coming from the southeast!”","Feng Wu was about to head in that direction, when the bird stopped her. “No. If you go that way, three Level 6 Spiritual Lords will be on you in three seconds!”","She then turned to the right, but the bird stopped her again. “No! The Spiritual King has shaken off the white fairy and is coming from that direction!”"]},{"number":2200,"title":"Chapter 2200","paragraphs":["Feng Wu said, “Then there’s only one direction left.”","Little Phoenix looked in that direction and cried out, “Don’t!”","Feng Wu said, “What?”","The bird said, “There’s a magical beast too powerful for you to handle in that direction!”","Feng Wu asked, “Then what should I do now?”","The bird fell silent.","Since all four directions were out of the question, her only option now was...","“I need to find a place to hide and stall them for as long as I can. You go tell Jun Linyuan.” Feng Wu made the decision.","“Alright!”","Although the bird was worried about Feng Wu, it knew that this was the best option. The next second, it flew away like a bolt of lightning.","Three minutes. That was all she needed.","Feng Wu encouraged herself. Three minutes, and Jun Linyuan would be here.","She only needed to stall for a little while.","She looked around.","She was in the heart of the woods, and a lake glistened in the moonlight.","The water was very calm, but she didn’t know what it was like underneath.","She dipped her fingers into the lake.","It was very cold.","But she didn’t have time to think. It wasn’t easy to pass three minutes.","Just then, she heard rustling.","The four Spiritual Lords were coming!","Feng Wu swiftly dove into the lake.","She quickly sank to the bottom and sat there with her legs crossed. She then closed her eyes and held her breath.","She even slowed down her heartbeat.","She sealed off all her senses.","Only then could she minimize the chance of being discovered.","Whoosh!","Four men rushed to the lake.","“Her aura disappeared here.” The Spiritual Lord with the crossbow looked perplexed.","There were three Level 6 Spiritual Lords and one Level 5.","“Are you sure?” Round Face asked with a frown.","“Yes!” The bowman was very certain. “My arrows have poisonous powder on them. Although I missed her, the powder still got on her clothes.”","As he spoke, he crouched down and pinched some soil between his fingers. “Look. Here’s the powder. I’m sure of it.”","The three Level 6 men looked at one another, before their gazes all fell on the lake.","“So, the girl jumped into Mirror Lake.” Round Face’s eyes glinted coldly.","“We’re going to fish her out.” Long Arms raised his right arm, and where his right hand should be, there was an iron hook.","It was very sharp, and the air it gave off could chill one to the bone.","If one looked closely, one could see that the iron hook was retractable.","As expected!","The man threw the hook into the lake.","No one knew how far the hook could reach. When he drew it back, there was a black object on the hook.","“What is it?” Everyone looked at it with a frown.","Thud.","Long Arms released the thing, and it landed on the ground. It then waved its red claws ferociously.","“Is that a crab?” Everyone was shocked.","How could a crab be so big? It was several meters long, and its claws were as sharp as razors!","Crack!"]}]);
